(736721, 79250, 20732, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think that the light or maybe it''s the background makes the edges look a bit out of focus. It might also be a bit of dust (judging from the bottom surface), so perhaps getting rid of that might have helped make it have sharper edges.</td>', 'I like it, but I think that the light or maybe it''s the background makes the edges look a bit out of focus. It might also be a bit of dust (judging from the bottom surface), so perhaps getting rid of that might have helped make it have sharper edges.', '2004-05-26 05:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(736722, 78020, 20732, '<td valign="top">Lol, that''s taking multiple light sources to the extreme!! I like the composition with the trees, however I think if they were a bit lower showing a bit more of the main subject, it might have had a bit more impact. I like it a lot though.</td>', 'Lol, that''s taking multiple light sources to the extreme!! I like the composition with the trees, however I think if they were a bit lower showing a bit more of the main subject, it might have had a bit more impact. I like it a lot though.', '2004-05-26 05:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
