(736727, 79290, 15920, '<td valign="top">The light on our right isn''t quite strong enough on the models face to kill the shadows, maybe because the laptop blocks it, maybe not, not sure.  The lights on the coffe cup and hand are a little strong.  All that aside, this is a good image that should have broad appeal.</td>', 'The light on our right isn''t quite strong enough on the models face to kill the shadows, maybe because the laptop blocks it, maybe not, not sure.  The lights on the coffe cup and hand are a little strong.  All that aside, this is a good image that should have broad appeal.', '2004-05-26 06:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
