(736740, 79318, 6999, '<td valign="top">Small, in both size and usage of available bandwidth, which will hurt your score I''m sure. I find this composition clumsy too - there''s only the single movement through the frame for the eye, and that takes it pretty quickly out of frame. The balance of the weight of the image is heavily to the left too, making it feel un-thought-out. 4</td>', 'Small, in both size and usage of available bandwidth, which will hurt your score I''m sure. I find this composition clumsy too - there''s only the single movement through the frame for the eye, and that takes it pretty quickly out of frame. The balance of the weight of the image is heavily to the left too, making it feel un-thought-out. 4', '2004-05-26 06:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(736742, 78504, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the progression of colours here, but can''t get on with it as an entry for this challenge. Good work to make the centred subject function with that background, and blalnce the shot - not easy to do. The colours are the only thing I find interesting here, apart from a possible suggestion of the poisonous nature of Coca-Cola, but that seems incidental. 3</td>', 'Like the progression of colours here, but can''t get on with it as an entry for this challenge. Good work to make the centred subject function with that background, and blalnce the shot - not easy to do. The colours are the only thing I find interesting here, apart from a possible suggestion of the poisonous nature of Coca-Cola, but that seems incidental. 3', '2004-05-26 06:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(736743, 78946, 6999, '<td valign="top">2. So small, so compressed, very difficult to see that there might be more than one light source. The one point above minimum you score is for having some sense of composition in the image.</td>', '2. So small, so compressed, very difficult to see that there might be more than one light source. The one point above minimum you score is for having some sense of composition in the image.', '2004-05-26 06:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(736744, 79160, 22011, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''ve got quite a bit of camera shake?</td>', 'Looks like you''ve got quite a bit of camera shake?', '2004-05-26 06:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(736746, 79089, 6999, '<td valign="top">3. Intriguing image, though I''m not a fan of your post-processing - those blown out whites appearing inpatches is kind of unflattering, and doesn''t add to what is already a quite bizarre feel. In simple terms of the challenge details, it''s impossible to score you more.</td>', '3. Intriguing image, though I''m not a fan of your post-processing - those blown out whites appearing inpatches is kind of unflattering, and doesn''t add to what is already a quite bizarre feel. In simple terms of the challenge details, it''s impossible to score you more.', '2004-05-26 06:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(736750, 79305, 6999, '<td valign="top">Why so small!? It may be just that I''ve seen three or four shots in a row that haven''t used the available size by a distance, but surely this would have been more effective at 640xsomething? There''s nearly 200 pixels of height you haven''t used here ... whyever not? It''s tha more annoying, because this could be wonderful - really wonderful: the effect of the lampshade on the things own stand, and the effect of that little cross-light on the shade itself could have brought out more, perhaps. You could have found that great range of tonality that black and white can really do, but that only really shows in the details, and the detail disappear in the sizing. 6</td>', 'Why so small!? It may be just that I''ve seen three or four shots in a row that haven''t used the available size by a distance, but surely this would have been more effective at 640xsomething? There''s nearly 200 pixels of height you haven''t used here ... whyever not? It''s tha more annoying, because this could be wonderful - really wonderful: the effect of the lampshade on the things own stand, and the effect of that little cross-light on the shade itself could have brought out more, perhaps. You could have found that great range of tonality that black and white can really do, but that only really shows in the details, and the detail disappear in the sizing. 6', '2004-05-26 06:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(736758, 79099, 6999, '<td valign="top">Why so many small photos this week? maybe it''s just a freak of the order I''m seeing them in. If it should be a software problem - there are many free editors, many programs put out on the coverdiscs of computer and photography magazines ... you don''t have to spend $600 on photoshop. If someone were to enter a 4x6 print into a print photography competition, would you expect it to get marked down? <br/> <br/>This doesn''t seem particularly sharp, even at this resolution. Compositionally, you''ve placed the bridge right across the centre of frame, at the expense of some of those reflections, and at the expense of a comfortable shape for the eye to follow through the frame: placed a little higher, it would, in conjunction with the river, create a curving sweep up and round to the right that would give a strong central graphic element to the image, and improve it for the viewer no end. 3</td>', 'Why so many small photos this week? maybe it''s just a freak of the order I''m seeing them in. If it should be a software problem - there are many free editors, many programs put out on the coverdiscs of computer and photography magazines ... you don''t have to spend $600 on photoshop. If someone were to enter a 4x6 print into a print photography competition, would you expect it to get marked down?  This doesn''t seem particularly sharp, even at this resolution. Compositionally, you''ve placed the bridge right across the centre of frame, at the expense of some of those reflections, and at the expense of a comfortable shape for the eye to follow through the frame: placed a little higher, it would, in conjunction with the river, create a curving sweep up and round to the right that would give a strong central graphic element to the image, and improve it for the viewer no end. 3', '2004-05-26 07:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(736764, 78956, 22011, '<td valign="top">Something looks odd about your clouds, and I can''t see more than one light source here?</td>', 'Something looks odd about your clouds, and I can''t see more than one light source here?', '2004-05-26 07:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(736773, 79122, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t know - perhaps there''s some thinking that I''m missing, but I can''t see this fitting the challenge here. Top shot, however. Love the pose, the bubbles. 4</td>', 'I don''t know - perhaps there''s some thinking that I''m missing, but I can''t see this fitting the challenge here. Top shot, however. Love the pose, the bubbles. 4', '2004-05-26 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(736776, 78618, 6999, '<td valign="top">Difficult capture, but the quality issue lets it down very badly indeed. Not to mention the force required to get it into the challenge at all (which, IMO, it fails) 2</td>', 'Difficult capture, but the quality issue lets it down very badly indeed. Not to mention the force required to get it into the challenge at all (which, IMO, it fails) 2', '2004-05-26 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(736777, 79037, 14202, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but still abit dark and hmmm....empty, for my liking</td>', 'Good concept, but still abit dark and hmmm....empty, for my liking', '2004-05-26 07:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(736783, 78352, 7252, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a much more compelling photo if you cropped tighter on the right side.</td>', 'I think this would be a much more compelling photo if you cropped tighter on the right side.', '2004-05-26 07:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(736784, 78659, 14202, '<td valign="top">this sure is a good show of multiple lights...very simple and very adequate.</td>', 'this sure is a good show of multiple lights...very simple and very adequate.', '2004-05-26 07:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(736790, 78020, 6999, '<td valign="top">You Scots have all the locations :-) This seems very noisy (the smoke) - and I wonder if that is having an effect on what I''m seeing as a lack of fine detail in the pipework here. I''m not completely convinced about the silhouetted bushes/trees in foreground either: in fact, I rather think there isn''t enough location here, just that pattern of lights and pipes, but without enough drama to grab me. were it my shot, I''d parhps have tried early evening (late evening at the moment, I suspect), to keep some sky and surrounding detail. 6</td>', 'You Scots have all the locations :-) This seems very noisy (the smoke) - and I wonder if that is having an effect on what I''m seeing as a lack of fine detail in the pipework here. I''m not completely convinced about the silhouetted bushes/trees in foreground either: in fact, I rather think there isn''t enough location here, just that pattern of lights and pipes, but without enough drama to grab me. were it my shot, I''d parhps have tried early evening (late evening at the moment, I suspect), to keep some sky and surrounding detail. 6', '2004-05-26 07:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(736792, 77936, 6999, '<td valign="top">Highly accomplished technically, though just seeming to lack an edge of clarity around the text - sharpening? <i>see also</i> divorce :-)  -  catches my eye. 6</td>', 'Highly accomplished technically, though just seeming to lack an edge of clarity around the text - sharpening? see also divorce :-)  -  catches my eye. 6', '2004-05-26 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(736800, 78032, 20247, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-05-26 07:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(736802, 79015, 20407, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get a good solid shot in the dark like this. I think you did well under the lighting circumstances. I''d rotate the image a little to make the car more level.</td>', 'It''s hard to get a good solid shot in the dark like this. I think you did well under the lighting circumstances. I''d rotate the image a little to make the car more level.', '2004-05-26 07:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(736804, 79156, 21652, '<td valign="top">The atmosphere of this photo is superb. My eyes were led from the brightness and colour of the foreground to the more sombre flame image in the background</td>', 'The atmosphere of this photo is superb. My eyes were led from the brightness and colour of the foreground to the more sombre flame image in the background', '2004-05-26 07:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(736805, 78730, 20407, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the lights have let you down here. You might want to investigate changing the levels in photoshop to reduce the flatness of the image and bring out the black. I''d also crop the front a little to remove some of the grass.  The blance between the lghts and the fountain is nice.</td>', 'Unfortunately the lights have let you down here. You might want to investigate changing the levels in photoshop to reduce the flatness of the image and bring out the black. I''d also crop the front a little to remove some of the grass.  The blance between the lghts and the fountain is nice.', '2004-05-26 07:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(736806, 78683, 22011, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and well executed athough you seem to have quite a bit of noise in the image...</td>', 'Neat idea, and well executed athough you seem to have quite a bit of noise in the image...', '2004-05-26 07:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(736810, 77987, 20407, '<td valign="top">I''d crop in closer on the sign and window to bring more interest to the image and focus on the lights a little. The main thing here is to try to get it into focus. It appears that you camera may have let you down a bit on this one. It''s worth trying again though. I like the tiger.</td>', 'I''d crop in closer on the sign and window to bring more interest to the image and focus on the lights a little. The main thing here is to try to get it into focus. It appears that you camera may have let you down a bit on this one. It''s worth trying again though. I like the tiger.', '2004-05-26 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(736816, 77844, 20407, '<td valign="top">While the image isn''t terribly interesting as a subject it was hopefully good learning for you in setting up lighting.  I''d crop it at the top left corner where the white outlines the petals and leaves - this bit is really nice - forget the pot and the centred image.</td>', 'While the image isn''t terribly interesting as a subject it was hopefully good learning for you in setting up lighting.  I''d crop it at the top left corner where the white outlines the petals and leaves - this bit is really nice - forget the pot and the centred image.', '2004-05-26 08:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(736820, 79313, 20407, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve gone a bit overboard here - we didn''t really need to see the lights. I''d crop it right in on the little guy and his reflection - it would be really obvious that there were multiple light sources and would make it quite interesting.</td>', 'I think you''ve gone a bit overboard here - we didn''t really need to see the lights. I''d crop it right in on the little guy and his reflection - it would be really obvious that there were multiple light sources and would make it quite interesting.', '2004-05-26 08:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(736823, 78504, 20407, '<td valign="top">The idea of seeing the logo is nice. It would be good to see a bit more focus. I think it would also be more sucessful if it was cropped a bit further to take out a lot of the black.</td>', 'The idea of seeing the logo is nice. It would be good to see a bit more focus. I think it would also be more sucessful if it was cropped a bit further to take out a lot of the black.', '2004-05-26 08:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(736833, 79089, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very nice baby portrait.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice baby portrait.  Well done.', '2004-05-26 08:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(736835, 79240, 20407, '<td valign="top">The bunnys are sorta cute. It obviously has multiple lighting sources. The red spot in the corner is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The bunnys are sorta cute. It obviously has multiple lighting sources. The red spot in the corner is a bit distracting.', '2004-05-26 08:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(736837, 79306, 17185, '<td valign="top">Wow....the atmosphere created by the lighting is fantastic. Love the composition too, the way the tree brings you into the frame with its trunk, and then down with its branch. Beautiful!</td>', 'Wow....the atmosphere created by the lighting is fantastic. Love the composition too, the way the tree brings you into the frame with its trunk, and then down with its branch. Beautiful!', '2004-05-26 08:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(736841, 78322, 19446, '<td valign="top">I love the way the shadows bend.  Not sure whay parts of this are so grainy though.</td>', 'I love the way the shadows bend.  Not sure whay parts of this are so grainy though.', '2004-05-26 08:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(736842, 79179, 19446, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is what the admins had in mind w/ "multiple light sources",  good interpertation and "thinking outside the box"</td>', 'I don''t think this is what the admins had in mind w/ "multiple light sources",  good interpertation and "thinking outside the box"', '2004-05-26 08:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(736843, 78269, 19446, '<td valign="top">I like how the sun looks like it''s in front of the horizon.  A little too centered for my taste though.</td>', 'I like how the sun looks like it''s in front of the horizon.  A little too centered for my taste though.', '2004-05-26 08:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(736844, 79306, 19446, '<td valign="top">rich photo, great color depth for such a dark picture.</td>', 'rich photo, great color depth for such a dark picture.', '2004-05-26 08:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(736845, 78836, 19446, '<td valign="top">I hear Better Homes &amp; Gardens knocking</td>', 'I hear Better Homes & Gardens knocking', '2004-05-26 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(736847, 78985, 19446, '<td valign="top">excellent interpertation of this challenge.</td>', 'excellent interpertation of this challenge.', '2004-05-26 08:46:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(736848, 79219, 6999, '<td valign="top">I guess you must have used some reflector, or fill light from somehwere, to have entered this in this challenge ... but for the life of me I cannot see what that is other than what looks like one large softlight. there''s also a slight feeling of the bowl of the petal drifting out of focus, just out of the focal range perhaps, almost like a wide aperture shot focussed on the nearer part of the petal; this is a shame, as the wter drop makes that area appear to be the natural catch-point of the image. 4 - mainly for not meeting challenge.</td>', 'I guess you must have used some reflector, or fill light from somehwere, to have entered this in this challenge ... but for the life of me I cannot see what that is other than what looks like one large softlight. there''s also a slight feeling of the bowl of the petal drifting out of focus, just out of the focal range perhaps, almost like a wide aperture shot focussed on the nearer part of the petal; this is a shame, as the wter drop makes that area appear to be the natural catch-point of the image. 4 - mainly for not meeting challenge.', '2004-05-26 08:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(736849, 79290, 19446, '<td valign="top">Great use of the lighting to frame the subject.</td>', 'Great use of the lighting to frame the subject.', '2004-05-26 08:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(736850, 77996, 19446, '<td valign="top">nice picture &amp; excellent concept.</td>', 'nice picture & excellent concept.', '2004-05-26 08:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(736851, 79160, 20407, '<td valign="top">Focus is your main problem here. With better focus the balance of the photo would be quite nice.</td>', 'Focus is your main problem here. With better focus the balance of the photo would be quite nice.', '2004-05-26 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(736854, 79231, 19446, '<td valign="top">great idea.  the colors look a little too artifical for me though (post processing?)  I think a tighter crop on just the glass makes for a nice picture too.</td>', 'great idea.  the colors look a little too artifical for me though (post processing?)  I think a tighter crop on just the glass makes for a nice picture too.', '2004-05-26 08:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(736857, 79087, 20407, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity the lights are showing through her chin.</td>', 'It''s a pity the lights are showing through her chin.', '2004-05-26 08:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(736859, 78627, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great execution -10</td>', 'Great idea, great execution -10', '2004-05-26 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(736860, 79187, 19446, '<td valign="top">excellent composition &amp; color scheme.</td>', 'excellent composition & color scheme.', '2004-05-26 09:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(736861, 78512, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very very good idea.  Simple but effective composition.</td>', 'Very very good idea.  Simple but effective composition.', '2004-05-26 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(736863, 78957, 19446, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I really dig this one.</td>', 'Wow!  I really dig this one.', '2004-05-26 09:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(736864, 79300, 22011, '<td valign="top">That''s s startling flare effect on the lights, curious to know what settings gave that on the camera?  My G5 gives quite distinct flares at f6 or so and smaller, but nothing like this.  Photo looks a bit over saturated for my liking, but that enhances the flares.</td>', 'That''s s startling flare effect on the lights, curious to know what settings gave that on the camera?  My G5 gives quite distinct flares at f6 or so and smaller, but nothing like this.  Photo looks a bit over saturated for my liking, but that enhances the flares.', '2004-05-26 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(736865, 79180, 15920, '<td valign="top">Lighting is perfect, and the focus is spot on.  A very nice photo that belongs on your wall.</td>', 'Lighting is perfect, and the focus is spot on.  A very nice photo that belongs on your wall.', '2004-05-26 09:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
