(736964, 79018, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed! The image seems a bit hazy. Were you using a UV/Haze filter? The overall image is a bit flat on my screen. Still a great baseball shot! 5</td>', 'Nicely framed! The image seems a bit hazy. Were you using a UV/Haze filter? The overall image is a bit flat on my screen. Still a great baseball shot! 5', '2004-05-26 10:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
