(736968, 78741, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nicely done cityscape! I can''t decide if there is a high level of noise in the image, or if it was a hot, hazy night. If it was hazy out- consider adding a UV/Haze filter to the camera. If your camera is just noisy, consider converting this image to black and white. Make a longer exposure, then convert. The noise will more closely approximate "grain". And it would give you an interesting looking image.</td>', 'Nicely done cityscape! I can''t decide if there is a high level of noise in the image, or if it was a hot, hazy night. If it was hazy out- consider adding a UV/Haze filter to the camera. If your camera is just noisy, consider converting this image to black and white. Make a longer exposure, then convert. The noise will more closely approximate "grain". And it would give you an interesting looking image.', '2004-05-26 10:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(736971, 79089, 15920, '<td valign="top">Simply excellent composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Simply excellent composition.  Good luck.', '2004-05-26 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
