(737109, 78949, 20018, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, object on the floor should''ve been moved and/or cropped out to just the greenish center area</td>', 'interesting shot, object on the floor should''ve been moved and/or cropped out to just the greenish center area', '2004-05-26 11:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737110, 78512, 14202, '<td valign="top">A little dark but I love the composition and the presentation.  Well done</td>', 'A little dark but I love the composition and the presentation.  Well done', '2004-05-26 11:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737111, 78464, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2004-05-26 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(737112, 79255, 14202, '<td valign="top">very sharp, very crisp and very good contrast</td>', 'very sharp, very crisp and very good contrast', '2004-05-26 12:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(737115, 79312, 20018, '<td valign="top">great shot, would expect to see more motion blur</td>', 'great shot, would expect to see more motion blur', '2004-05-26 12:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737117, 79282, 14202, '<td valign="top">I find the palm fonds in the left too distracting from the main conposition...</td>', 'I find the palm fonds in the left too distracting from the main conposition...', '2004-05-26 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737123, 78956, 14202, '<td valign="top">and the ''obvious use of multiple light sources''  is where???</td>', 'and the ''obvious use of multiple light sources''  is where???', '2004-05-26 12:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(737130, 78966, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love this idea (I considered submitting similar one) ... a tad brighter than my taste but certainly fits the challenge (you can see at least two sources from the sparkles).  Colors are beautiful ... very opalescent.  Framing is also extraordinary.</td>', 'Love this idea (I considered submitting similar one) ... a tad brighter than my taste but certainly fits the challenge (you can see at least two sources from the sparkles).  Colors are beautiful ... very opalescent.  Framing is also extraordinary.', '2004-05-26 12:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(737132, 79041, 18080, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot<br/>8</td>', 'Really nice shot8', '2004-05-26 12:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(737134, 79155, 14202, '<td valign="top">this shot leaves me with the feeling of "And...." I''m not to sure what the main focal point is within this pic.</td>', 'this shot leaves me with the feeling of "And...." I''m not to sure what the main focal point is within this pic.', '2004-05-26 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737135, 78281, 12962, '<td valign="top">Incredible.  Heavenly is actually a better word - colors are wonderful, framing is exquisite, details are remarkable, clarity is something I aspire to.  (While I don''t like the long title, I agree with you that it''s necessary because the light sources here might not be obvious.) In my top ten choice for this challenge.  I really hope you do well.</td>', 'Incredible.  Heavenly is actually a better word - colors are wonderful, framing is exquisite, details are remarkable, clarity is something I aspire to.  (While I don''t like the long title, I agree with you that it''s necessary because the light sources here might not be obvious.) In my top ten choice for this challenge.  I really hope you do well.', '2004-05-26 12:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(737138, 79153, 20018, '<td valign="top">great setup, love to see this with maybe someone dressed in black moving hanging lights through the bed with like a 30 sec exposure.</td>', 'great setup, love to see this with maybe someone dressed in black moving hanging lights through the bed with like a 30 sec exposure.', '2004-05-26 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(737139, 79315, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very ''arty,'' if I can use that word without being derogatory.   I like the color and the overexposure of the light on top.  It gives this an edge.  The cropping and framing is also out of the ordinary.  Hope you do well ...</td>', 'Very ''arty,'' if I can use that word without being derogatory.   I like the color and the overexposure of the light on top.  It gives this an edge.  The cropping and framing is also out of the ordinary.  Hope you do well ...', '2004-05-26 12:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737142, 79296, 10959, '<td valign="top">Cool photo--I like how the multple colors are nowhere other than in the reflection.  It makes it seem like the glass itself is the source of color.  Neat effect.  Unfortunatley, the whole things seems out of focus, and there''s an odd black triangle in the lower right corner--looks like where the edge of your table is.  Should have cropped that off.  Overall, good idea but the technicals let it down.  5</td>', 'Cool photo--I like how the multple colors are nowhere other than in the reflection.  It makes it seem like the glass itself is the source of color.  Neat effect.  Unfortunatley, the whole things seems out of focus, and there''s an odd black triangle in the lower right corner--looks like where the edge of your table is.  Should have cropped that off.  Overall, good idea but the technicals let it down.  5', '2004-05-26 12:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737146, 79156, 14202, '<td valign="top">appears very soft with the focus, but I like the contrast of colours.</td>', 'appears very soft with the focus, but I like the contrast of colours.', '2004-05-26 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737147, 78275, 10959, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the theme--some voters may have trouble "seeing" the multiple light sources, but your title should help.  I like it--7</td>', 'Interesting take on the theme--some voters may have trouble "seeing" the multiple light sources, but your title should help.  I like it--7', '2004-05-26 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737148, 78949, 4747, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but what''s the do-dad on the floor?</td>', 'Great photo, but what''s the do-dad on the floor?', '2004-05-26 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737149, 79219, 12962, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.  Multiple light sources might not be obvious, but I am sure you used more than one.  The texture of the petal and the shadows are just exquisite.  I would have liked the dew to sparkle a little bit more, if you reshoot this, maybe place it just near the light and not under the shadows.  But for this challenge, you got ''it.''</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.  Multiple light sources might not be obvious, but I am sure you used more than one.  The texture of the petal and the shadows are just exquisite.  I would have liked the dew to sparkle a little bit more, if you reshoot this, maybe place it just near the light and not under the shadows.  But for this challenge, you got ''it.''', '2004-05-26 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737152, 78997, 10959, '<td valign="top">I like the star effect on the lights.  Photo could be a bit bigger.  Also, I''m not sure the overall yellow cast really helps here.  I''d prefer better white balance.</td>', 'I like the star effect on the lights.  Photo could be a bit bigger.  Also, I''m not sure the overall yellow cast really helps here.  I''d prefer better white balance.', '2004-05-26 12:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(737154, 79291, 10959, '<td valign="top">Looks like only a single light source to me.</td>', 'Looks like only a single light source to me.', '2004-05-26 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(737156, 78122, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry ... probably crop a little closer from the top and bottom for a closer and even more sinister look but I am just being petty.  The lighting especially the back lighting of the hair is gorgeous.</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry ... probably crop a little closer from the top and bottom for a closer and even more sinister look but I am just being petty.  The lighting especially the back lighting of the hair is gorgeous.', '2004-05-26 12:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(737162, 79319, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space especially that you filled it with color.  Maybe increase the overall brightness/contrast just a tad to bring out the texture of the jar and the wicker.  But that is just me.</td>', 'Good use of negative space especially that you filled it with color.  Maybe increase the overall brightness/contrast just a tad to bring out the texture of the jar and the wicker.  But that is just me.', '2004-05-26 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737163, 79239, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creative point of view!  I love the monk effect.</td>', 'Very creative point of view!  I love the monk effect.', '2004-05-26 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(737164, 78741, 11410, '<td valign="top">cool, if a bit hazy</td>', 'cool, if a bit hazy', '2004-05-26 12:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(737168, 79153, 16241, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2004-05-26 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(737169, 79293, 11410, '<td valign="top">cool - nice colours!</td>', 'cool - nice colours!', '2004-05-26 12:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(737170, 78277, 10959, '<td valign="top">Nice--I like the use of a candy dish to showcase the multple lgihts/colors.  The reflection on the doily works well, as does the "matching" colorful vase.  Nice still life--8</td>', 'Nice--I like the use of a candy dish to showcase the multple lgihts/colors.  The reflection on the doily works well, as does the "matching" colorful vase.  Nice still life--8', '2004-05-26 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(737174, 78810, 20925, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like that you got the moon in there too. I''d probably like to have seen more water in the crop, but only a minor consideration.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like that you got the moon in there too. I''d probably like to have seen more water in the crop, but only a minor consideration.', '2004-05-26 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(737175, 79261, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting near the bible, but the overexposure on the candles is just too much for me.  Not sure of the solution, but it needs some tweaking.</td>', 'I like the lighting near the bible, but the overexposure on the candles is just too much for me.  Not sure of the solution, but it needs some tweaking.', '2004-05-26 12:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(737177, 79089, 10959, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  My only niggle is that the head nad left foot are cut off.  A little more room in the composition would have helped.  Also, this may be interesting flipped vertically!</td>', 'Great photo!  My only niggle is that the head nad left foot are cut off.  A little more room in the composition would have helped.  Also, this may be interesting flipped vertically!', '2004-05-26 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(737181, 78730, 20204, '<td valign="top">Underexposed on the center makes this difficult to enjoy.  A longer shutter would have created a nice effect on the fountain andbrightened the rest of the image.</td>', 'Underexposed on the center makes this difficult to enjoy.  A longer shutter would have created a nice effect on the fountain andbrightened the rest of the image.', '2004-05-26 12:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(737182, 79191, 20204, '<td valign="top">Too underexposed to really enjoy the detail.</td>', 'Too underexposed to really enjoy the detail.', '2004-05-26 12:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(737183, 79281, 20925, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and angle.  Nice negative space.  Would have been great if you could have some of the distracting elements above the spot lights.</td>', 'I like the framing and angle.  Nice negative space.  Would have been great if you could have some of the distracting elements above the spot lights.', '2004-05-26 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(737184, 79303, 10959, '<td valign="top">Yes, there are 2 light sources, but unfortunately they aren''t very well controlled.  The bright window is completelyl blown out, and the area above the table is too dark in relation to it.  This is an example of a scene with very difficult exposure conditions.  A good try for the challenge though.</td>', 'Yes, there are 2 light sources, but unfortunately they aren''t very well controlled.  The bright window is completelyl blown out, and the area above the table is too dark in relation to it.  This is an example of a scene with very difficult exposure conditions.  A good try for the challenge though.', '2004-05-26 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(737187, 78932, 10959, '<td valign="top">The fog adds interest, but everything is out of focus.</td>', 'The fog adds interest, but everything is out of focus.', '2004-05-26 12:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(737188, 78032, 11410, '<td valign="top">that''s really cool!</td>', 'that''s really cool!', '2004-05-26 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(737190, 77955, 11410, '<td valign="top">a bit on the dark side...</td>', 'a bit on the dark side...', '2004-05-26 12:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(737191, 79180, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  For me, I''m interesed in the background as well - might be nice to have a bit more loose cropping as it seems scenic.</td>', 'Great portrait.  For me, I''m interesed in the background as well - might be nice to have a bit more loose cropping as it seems scenic.', '2004-05-26 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(737192, 78050, 20925, '<td valign="top">Very delicate.  Nice balance.</td>', 'Very delicate.  Nice balance.', '2004-05-26 12:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(737193, 79294, 10959, '<td valign="top">Very nice--Simple, great color, nice diagonal composition.  I''d like to know what lights you used, and how you got the different colors!</td>', 'Very nice--Simple, great color, nice diagonal composition.  I''d like to know what lights you used, and how you got the different colors!', '2004-05-26 12:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737197, 79149, 21183, '<td valign="top">Fascinated by the neon effect.  Love the colours combination.  Wondering if it could be improved by cropping the darker sides away a bit?</td>', 'Fascinated by the neon effect.  Love the colours combination.  Wondering if it could be improved by cropping the darker sides away a bit?', '2004-05-26 12:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(737198, 79262, 20925, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the angles and the subtle pastel fades in the corners.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the angles and the subtle pastel fades in the corners.', '2004-05-26 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(737199, 79293, 10959, '<td valign="top">Good try, but the technicals need a bit of work.  It''s slightly out of focus, and there are a couple black specks on the red side of the background.</td>', 'Good try, but the technicals need a bit of work.  It''s slightly out of focus, and there are a couple black specks on the red side of the background.', '2004-05-26 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(737201, 79311, 20925, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures and mild contrasts of this one.</td>', 'I really like the textures and mild contrasts of this one.', '2004-05-26 12:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(737202, 78352, 12160, '<td valign="top">awesome. love the motion that gave of a different color. nice mood to it too. 7</td>', 'awesome. love the motion that gave of a different color. nice mood to it too. 7', '2004-05-26 12:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737206, 79158, 10959, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but I like it.  Interesting effect, and good light on the face/eyes/nose of the mask.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but I like it.  Interesting effect, and good light on the face/eyes/nose of the mask.', '2004-05-26 12:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(737207, 79237, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like the cropping is a bit uneven.  I''d like to see this tilted counter-clockwise by 2 deg. and centered.  You captured a nice pose!</td>', 'Looks like the cropping is a bit uneven.  I''d like to see this tilted counter-clockwise by 2 deg. and centered.  You captured a nice pose!', '2004-05-26 12:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737209, 79163, 21183, '<td valign="top">Like the effect of ''sribbling with light''.  Is that what it is?</td>', 'Like the effect of ''sribbling with light''.  Is that what it is?', '2004-05-26 12:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737211, 79016, 20925, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really creative shot, but I wonder if the voters will take the challenge topic too literally.</td>', 'I think this is a really creative shot, but I wonder if the voters will take the challenge topic too literally.', '2004-05-26 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(737212, 79155, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s an element of interest missing - the backdrop works for interest, but there''s no clearly defined subject I can use to bring me into the vision you are trying to create.</td>', 'There''s an element of interest missing - the backdrop works for interest, but there''s no clearly defined subject I can use to bring me into the vision you are trying to create.', '2004-05-26 12:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(737213, 79004, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice shot, exposure is spot on. like the blur on the window. max size of the photo is 640px on the longest side. would have been better if the photo was bigger.</td>', 'nice shot, exposure is spot on. like the blur on the window. max size of the photo is 640px on the longest side. would have been better if the photo was bigger.', '2004-05-26 12:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737217, 78330, 21183, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a kaleidoscope.  Nice and colourful. Like it.</td>', 'Reminds me of a kaleidoscope.  Nice and colourful. Like it.', '2004-05-26 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(737218, 78994, 20204, '<td valign="top">This would be amazing with a wider shot stictched together - the lighting is beautiful I can only imagine how cool it would be closer up.</td>', 'This would be amazing with a wider shot stictched together - the lighting is beautiful I can only imagine how cool it would be closer up.', '2004-05-26 12:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737219, 79305, 10959, '<td valign="top">This probably won''t do well, but I really like this photo.  It''s very simple, but mysterious at the same time.  The two light sources are obvious, even if one of them is out of the frame, and it creates a nice effect.  7</td>', 'This probably won''t do well, but I really like this photo.  It''s very simple, but mysterious at the same time.  The two light sources are obvious, even if one of them is out of the frame, and it creates a nice effect.  7', '2004-05-26 12:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737222, 79129, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice angle, looks like you were trying to decide whether to enter this on in multiple light sources or threes...</td>', 'nice angle, looks like you were trying to decide whether to enter this on in multiple light sources or threes...', '2004-05-26 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(737223, 79000, 20925, '<td valign="top">I think you got the colors just right on this one.  Nice contrast in textures too - the soft clouds against the sharp lines.</td>', 'I think you got the colors just right on this one.  Nice contrast in textures too - the soft clouds against the sharp lines.', '2004-05-26 12:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(737224, 79319, 10959, '<td valign="top">Great color, cool photo.  I think it needs a little bit of clockwise rotation though.</td>', 'Great color, cool photo.  I think it needs a little bit of clockwise rotation though.', '2004-05-26 12:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(737226, 79240, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think sepia might have brought out more of a mood in the image but it''s well composed.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think sepia might have brought out more of a mood in the image but it''s well composed.', '2004-05-26 12:40:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(737227, 79087, 18349, '<td valign="top">I will have to give you credit for the Aggie shirt, but the shot itself is a bit blurry, tilted to the left, and the red-eye is distracting.  There are multiple lights in the photo, and it is a unique interpretation.</td>', 'I will have to give you credit for the Aggie shirt, but the shot itself is a bit blurry, tilted to the left, and the red-eye is distracting.  There are multiple lights in the photo, and it is a unique interpretation.', '2004-05-26 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(737228, 78122, 20018, '<td valign="top">whoa,scary, go away bad lady go away!</td>', 'whoa,scary, go away bad lady go away!', '2004-05-26 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(737229, 78949, 21183, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Crop the box out on the floor maybe? Interesting pattern of light reflections on the floorway.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Crop the box out on the floor maybe? Interesting pattern of light reflections on the floorway.', '2004-05-26 12:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737230, 79160, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very blurry - sharpness would look great with the crystal.  Looks like a good clean background.</td>', 'Very blurry - sharpness would look great with the crystal.  Looks like a good clean background.', '2004-05-26 12:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(737231, 77844, 20204, '<td valign="top">The overexposure on the upper right is too much of a contrast with the left side background - it detracts from the subject.</td>', 'The overexposure on the upper right is too much of a contrast with the left side background - it detracts from the subject.', '2004-05-26 12:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(737233, 77986, 21183, '<td valign="top">A novel photo.</td>', 'A novel photo.', '2004-05-26 12:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(737234, 79130, 18349, '<td valign="top">I wish I could make out more detail in her face, especially around the eyes.  Interesting subject.  Contrast adjustment might help.  The umbrella seems a bit blown out, along with some areas in the BG.</td>', 'I wish I could make out more detail in her face, especially around the eyes.  Interesting subject.  Contrast adjustment might help.  The umbrella seems a bit blown out, along with some areas in the BG.', '2004-05-26 12:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(737235, 78426, 20925, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective on this shot.  It almost feels like the car streaks are pulling the frame off center.</td>', 'I like the perspective on this shot.  It almost feels like the car streaks are pulling the frame off center.', '2004-05-26 12:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(737236, 79163, 20018, '<td valign="top">very attractive, figure (driftwood) in the center great addition, would''ve liked to seen this cropped down to remove lines on sides</td>', 'very attractive, figure (driftwood) in the center great addition, would''ve liked to seen this cropped down to remove lines on sides', '2004-05-26 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737238, 78303, 10959, '<td valign="top">I find the background here a lot more interesting than the vase--the play in light between the cool gray on the left and warm yellow light on the right is great.  The vase itself is tilted (intentionally?).</td>', 'I find the background here a lot more interesting than the vase--the play in light between the cool gray on the left and warm yellow light on the right is great.  The vase itself is tilted (intentionally?).', '2004-05-26 12:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(737240, 79102, 21183, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Love the way that various spots of light are picked out by (a starlight filter lens?).</td>', 'I like this.  Love the way that various spots of light are picked out by (a starlight filter lens?).', '2004-05-26 12:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(737243, 79163, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think I would like it better without the driftwood.   Nice colors, interesting lines and patterns.</td>', 'I think I would like it better without the driftwood.   Nice colors, interesting lines and patterns.', '2004-05-26 12:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(737244, 79158, 20018, '<td valign="top">great background but the effect is ruined by the shadow</td>', 'great background but the effect is ruined by the shadow', '2004-05-26 12:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(737245, 78407, 10959, '<td valign="top">"Multiple" means more than one.</td>', '"Multiple" means more than one.', '2004-05-26 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(737246, 79103, 20018, '<td valign="top">wb off</td>', 'wb off', '2004-05-26 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737247, 79007, 10959, '<td valign="top">This is really strange, in an interesting way!  I''d like to know what those things are (other than the light bulb of course), and what the "meaning" is here.</td>', 'This is really strange, in an interesting way!  I''d like to know what those things are (other than the light bulb of course), and what the "meaning" is here.', '2004-05-26 12:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(737248, 79069, 20204, '<td valign="top">Too much light from the window.  It grabs my eye before I find the subject.</td>', 'Too much light from the window.  It grabs my eye before I find the subject.', '2004-05-26 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737249, 79239, 18820, '<td valign="top">How did you see that? -- Great vision</td>', 'How did you see that? -- Great vision', '2004-05-26 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(737251, 79301, 12160, '<td valign="top">great shot, good colors, sharp and moody.</td>', 'great shot, good colors, sharp and moody.', '2004-05-26 12:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737252, 77936, 21183, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Love IS considered to be a "light source" by the spiritually enlightened?</td>', 'Excellent.  Love IS considered to be a "light source" by the spiritually enlightened?', '2004-05-26 12:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(737258, 78303, 14202, '<td valign="top">Brilliant...love this photo. colour, focus, lighting and overall composition.</td>', 'Brilliant...love this photo. colour, focus, lighting and overall composition.', '2004-05-26 12:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(737260, 78275, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, great colors and composition. I believe you have one source of light here. Electricity as a component of the photo is a neat idea but it wasn''t used here to illuminate your subject. Does not meet the challenge imo. adding points to photo quality - 6</td>', 'Very nice photo, great colors and composition. I believe you have one source of light here. Electricity as a component of the photo is a neat idea but it wasn''t used here to illuminate your subject. Does not meet the challenge imo. adding points to photo quality - 6', '2004-05-26 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
