(737388, 79122, 15260, '<td valign="top">Brilliant Shot !!!!   Although the first impression might be that there is only one light source, i think that the sea balances out the sun light intensity nicely across the whole image. Moreover the seabed reflects back light onto your subject, hence the multiple light sources.</td>', 'Brilliant Shot !!!!   Although the first impression might be that there is only one light source, i think that the sea balances out the sun light intensity nicely across the whole image. Moreover the seabed reflects back light onto your subject, hence the multiple light sources.', '2004-05-26 13:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
