(737612, 79089, 9747, '<td valign="top">This is great! The only nitpick from me is that the background (the cloth/edge behind the baby) is distracting. It would be awesome if the baby was placed right in the middle of the mirror without the cloth/edge. The baby''s expression and the camera angle is terrific! The image being in B&amp;W is an excellent choice.</td>', 'This is great! The only nitpick from me is that the background (the cloth/edge behind the baby) is distracting. It would be awesome if the baby was placed right in the middle of the mirror without the cloth/edge. The baby''s expression and the camera angle is terrific! The image being in B&W is an excellent choice.', '2004-05-26 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
