(737615, 78932, 7684, '<td valign="top">7.</td>', '7.', '2004-05-26 15:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(737616, 78949, 19025, '<td valign="top">this picture should have been cropped to rid of the white box in the lower part. it is somewhat distracting..otherwise excellent picture.</td>', 'this picture should have been cropped to rid of the white box in the lower part. it is somewhat distracting..otherwise excellent picture.', '2004-05-26 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(737617, 79176, 9747, '<td valign="top">The moon is too blurry and there is too much noise overall. I like the black-white gradient and concept, though. Good attempt.</td>', 'The moon is too blurry and there is too much noise overall. I like the black-white gradient and concept, though. Good attempt.', '2004-05-26 15:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737626, 79131, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very cool and creative light-painting! Bright and attractive, it has a nice futuristic feel. I think it would look better with fewer straight lines, but that''s just my opinion. Good colors - I''m guessing you used a laser point? Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool and creative light-painting! Bright and attractive, it has a nice futuristic feel. I think it would look better with fewer straight lines, but that''s just my opinion. Good colors - I''m guessing you used a laser point? Nicely done!', '2004-05-26 15:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(737628, 79122, 2376, '<td valign="top">All is needing is the use of a flash unit. I feel the need for nitrogen-narcosis!!!</td>', 'All is needing is the use of a flash unit. I feel the need for nitrogen-narcosis!!!', '2004-05-26 15:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737631, 77969, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very cute and colorful. I only wish that the tags/strings weren''t there. The picture might look better if cropped a little more so that there are no or less black areas showing. All in all, a good image!</td>', 'Very cute and colorful. I only wish that the tags/strings weren''t there. The picture might look better if cropped a little more so that there are no or less black areas showing. All in all, a good image!', '2004-05-26 16:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(737632, 79085, 20992, '<td valign="top">Though your lamp is slightly out of focus, I kinda like this picture! I like the two different colours of the shadows, and think that you shouldn''t have showed the reflections of the lights in the lamp (but I guess you couldn''t avoid that..it is an open challenge, so you couldn''t use PS..pity..)</td>', 'Though your lamp is slightly out of focus, I kinda like this picture! I like the two different colours of the shadows, and think that you shouldn''t have showed the reflections of the lights in the lamp (but I guess you couldn''t avoid that..it is an open challenge, so you couldn''t use PS..pity..)', '2004-05-26 16:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(737635, 79232, 20992, '<td valign="top">The right face is very nice, good black and white contrast, nice expression! The left face misses this all and seems also a bit out of focus! But I guess you needed her for your second lightsource :)</td>', 'The right face is very nice, good black and white contrast, nice expression! The left face misses this all and seems also a bit out of focus! But I guess you needed her for your second lightsource :)', '2004-05-26 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(737636, 79216, 20018, '<td valign="top">pReTtyColOrS....POINTS OFF FOR NIKON!!!<br/> :P     jj</td>', 'pReTtyColOrS....POINTS OFF FOR NIKON!!! :P     jj', '2004-05-26 16:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(737639, 79018, 20992, '<td valign="top">ok, there are a lot of lightsources, but this is nothing more than a snapshot, and not a really nice one either...maybe next time you should think of another way to meet the challenge other than just taking a picture of multiple lightsources?? What is so interesting often on those playfields is that the multiple lights are visible in a lot of shadows around the persons or, in this case, no shadows at all! maybe focussing on that would have given the photo something extra..something to think about?</td>', 'ok, there are a lot of lightsources, but this is nothing more than a snapshot, and not a really nice one either...maybe next time you should think of another way to meet the challenge other than just taking a picture of multiple lightsources?? What is so interesting often on those playfields is that the multiple lights are visible in a lot of shadows around the persons or, in this case, no shadows at all! maybe focussing on that would have given the photo something extra..something to think about?', '2004-05-26 16:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(737640, 79086, 20992, '<td valign="top">though there is a triangle in the photo, there are too many other things my attention get drawn to..this is a chaotic picture with too much in it and too much colours also...</td>', 'though there is a triangle in the photo, there are too many other things my attention get drawn to..this is a chaotic picture with too much in it and too much colours also...', '2004-05-26 16:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737641, 79306, 9643, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  It certainly meets the challenge and it has a wonderful "atmosphere."  Best so far 10</td>', 'I love this photo.  It certainly meets the challenge and it has a wonderful "atmosphere."  Best so far 10', '2004-05-26 16:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(737644, 79131, 20018, '<td valign="top">hot, very hot</td>', 'hot, very hot', '2004-05-26 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(737647, 79039, 20992, '<td valign="top">the two lightsources are visible in the reflections, nice idea! Too bad that the mango (??) and the lemon are out of focus..only the apple is sharp..colours and placing are nice too!!</td>', 'the two lightsources are visible in the reflections, nice idea! Too bad that the mango (??) and the lemon are out of focus..only the apple is sharp..colours and placing are nice too!!', '2004-05-26 16:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(737652, 79264, 20992, '<td valign="top">exciting composition, nice idea..BUT the light is too sharp! Even here at home, it hurts my eyes, also the light lays a thin layer over the photo, so now the whole picture looks our of focus...also I don''t really like to see the angle of the ceiling, because it brings me back into your livingroom and out of the abstract world you could have created here...</td>', 'exciting composition, nice idea..BUT the light is too sharp! Even here at home, it hurts my eyes, also the light lays a thin layer over the photo, so now the whole picture looks our of focus...also I don''t really like to see the angle of the ceiling, because it brings me back into your livingroom and out of the abstract world you could have created here...', '2004-05-26 16:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(737653, 78520, 20992, '<td valign="top">you say you used multiple lightsources (I only see sunlight reflecting on the water and maybe some kind of red laserlight on the bollocks of the duck?? If that is your second light, it doesn''t really show..), but you still managed to underexpose the duck''s face!!</td>', 'you say you used multiple lightsources (I only see sunlight reflecting on the water and maybe some kind of red laserlight on the bollocks of the duck?? If that is your second light, it doesn''t really show..), but you still managed to underexpose the duck''s face!!', '2004-05-26 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(737662, 78533, 20992, '<td valign="top">this photo is nice to look at, but not very original and the tree on the right is disturbing, because it seems cropped too tightly...meanwhile I don''t see how this photo meets the challenge, since the only lightsource u used is the sun (or I must be overlooking something??)</td>', 'this photo is nice to look at, but not very original and the tree on the right is disturbing, because it seems cropped too tightly...meanwhile I don''t see how this photo meets the challenge, since the only lightsource u used is the sun (or I must be overlooking something??)', '2004-05-26 16:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737664, 79071, 19780, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - I like the DOF and how some of the lights are larger than others. The diagonal composition and chaotic look of the points of light make this much more interestesting than a straight on shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot - I like the DOF and how some of the lights are larger than others. The diagonal composition and chaotic look of the points of light make this much more interestesting than a straight on shot.', '2004-05-26 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(737666, 79309, 20992, '<td valign="top">is it about the waterfall or is it about the streetlights? Either way, I don''t think this is a nice photo to look at..the electricity cables are disturbing and for the sake of a good composition and have the waterfall more in the picture you could have zoomed in more and leave out all that blurry site chaos..</td>', 'is it about the waterfall or is it about the streetlights? Either way, I don''t think this is a nice photo to look at..the electricity cables are disturbing and for the sake of a good composition and have the waterfall more in the picture you could have zoomed in more and leave out all that blurry site chaos..', '2004-05-26 16:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737667, 79264, 19780, '<td valign="top">An intresting abstract - I like your focus on the shadows and light and the shapes that they made. The muted tones are good and your compsotion is strong with the centering of the light source but the flare from it is a little overexposed.</td>', 'An intresting abstract - I like your focus on the shadows and light and the shapes that they made. The muted tones are good and your compsotion is strong with the centering of the light source but the flare from it is a little overexposed.', '2004-05-26 16:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(737668, 79261, 15207, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you used a high ISO for this. Digital cameras usually look like crap regardless of light - at any high ISO. Always shoot at 80 to 100 and never higher or you''ll get a lot of noise grain. I''m not even sure why digital cameras allow you to shoot at higher ISOs since the noise is always distracting adn the image is usually unprintable. Maybe open the shutter a bit longer to compensate for low lighting. On my monitor the right hand candle is a bit over-pixelated and strange looking.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you used a high ISO for this. Digital cameras usually look like crap regardless of light - at any high ISO. Always shoot at 80 to 100 and never higher or you''ll get a lot of noise grain. I''m not even sure why digital cameras allow you to shoot at higher ISOs since the noise is always distracting adn the image is usually unprintable. Maybe open the shutter a bit longer to compensate for low lighting. On my monitor the right hand candle is a bit over-pixelated and strange looking.', '2004-05-26 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737669, 79184, 21542, '<td valign="top">I''m torn.  I really enjoy the lens flares from the candles here, but the excessive noise in the shot (low-light hell, but it''s the price we pay), the light switch, and the pile of cardboard boxes in the background all tear away from a great concept.</td>', 'I''m torn.  I really enjoy the lens flares from the candles here, but the excessive noise in the shot (low-light hell, but it''s the price we pay), the light switch, and the pile of cardboard boxes in the background all tear away from a great concept.', '2004-05-26 16:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737671, 78994, 20992, '<td valign="top">You should have exposed longer to get more detail...now it''s not quite clear what''s in the picture...for an abstract it is too centered to be exciting to look at..</td>', 'You should have exposed longer to get more detail...now it''s not quite clear what''s in the picture...for an abstract it is too centered to be exciting to look at..', '2004-05-26 16:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(737672, 79103, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photo - 9<br/>My only suggestion (and it''s really not a big dea and I''m not really an expert myself) is to maybe reduce the length of your shutter in lighting like this. While it''s great that the lights really play a huge role in your composition, the buildings seem just a tiny bit (and I mean a fraction) over-exposed. good luck with this one. It really stands out.</td>', 'This is a really cool photo - 9My only suggestion (and it''s really not a big dea and I''m not really an expert myself) is to maybe reduce the length of your shutter in lighting like this. While it''s great that the lights really play a huge role in your composition, the buildings seem just a tiny bit (and I mean a fraction) over-exposed. good luck with this one. It really stands out.', '2004-05-26 16:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(737674, 78956, 20992, '<td valign="top">You had a beautiful sky that day and a lovely child, but this is nothing more than a snapshot..it would be more appealing if the child''s face was more visible, if you focussed on the child and not on the bushes behind him/her and the contrast was a little bit less hard...also this picture doesn''t meet the challenge at all since there is only one lightsource you used and that was daylight (or I must be overlooking something??)</td>', 'You had a beautiful sky that day and a lovely child, but this is nothing more than a snapshot..it would be more appealing if the child''s face was more visible, if you focussed on the child and not on the bushes behind him/her and the contrast was a little bit less hard...also this picture doesn''t meet the challenge at all since there is only one lightsource you used and that was daylight (or I must be overlooking something??)', '2004-05-26 16:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(737675, 78683, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is exceptionally pixelatd. I''m not sure if decreasing your ISo to 80 or 100 (never ever go above that with a digital camera, despite the rules for low lighting with a 35mm) - or if maybe your resolution isn''t as high with the camera. I''m not sure how you could improve it, but it''s a good composition - just very distracting with the heavy pixelation - especially along the top.</td>', 'This is exceptionally pixelatd. I''m not sure if decreasing your ISo to 80 or 100 (never ever go above that with a digital camera, despite the rules for low lighting with a 35mm) - or if maybe your resolution isn''t as high with the camera. I''m not sure how you could improve it, but it''s a good composition - just very distracting with the heavy pixelation - especially along the top.', '2004-05-26 16:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737676, 79034, 21542, '<td valign="top">That''s lookin'' like a single light source to me...</td>', 'That''s lookin'' like a single light source to me...', '2004-05-26 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737677, 79161, 20018, '<td valign="top">freaky...nice shot</td>', 'freaky...nice shot', '2004-05-26 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(737678, 77936, 15207, '<td valign="top">My mark isn''t going to be biased by this - but this looks extremely similar to an entry from last year - maybe it''s the same photographer. You may find that your marks suffer from DPCers who don''t like to see the same thing more than once. Overall though, I really like this one - 9</td>', 'My mark isn''t going to be biased by this - but this looks extremely similar to an entry from last year - maybe it''s the same photographer. You may find that your marks suffer from DPCers who don''t like to see the same thing more than once. Overall though, I really like this one - 9', '2004-05-26 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(737680, 77936, 20992, '<td valign="top">I bet you already got a lot of comments on this picture concerning the subject??? I think thought that it is a really nice picture, but maybe next time you can focus a bit more on the words that get lit (sure, I see marriage there, but it is almost in the shadows...)</td>', 'I bet you already got a lot of comments on this picture concerning the subject??? I think thought that it is a really nice picture, but maybe next time you can focus a bit more on the words that get lit (sure, I see marriage there, but it is almost in the shadows...)', '2004-05-26 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(737681, 79069, 15207, '<td valign="top">This looks extremely pixelated - almost liek it was taken with a cell phone camera. You may want to reduce your ISO considerably. Never take any photo (despite the rules in 35mm photography) that is over 100 ISO. Good idea for this challenge tthough and a good composition.</td>', 'This looks extremely pixelated - almost liek it was taken with a cell phone camera. You may want to reduce your ISO considerably. Never take any photo (despite the rules in 35mm photography) that is over 100 ISO. Good idea for this challenge tthough and a good composition.', '2004-05-26 16:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737682, 78946, 20018, '<td valign="top">yum, a little small...ynot use the max 640 resolution to your advantage?</td>', 'yum, a little small...ynot use the max 640 resolution to your advantage?', '2004-05-26 16:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(737683, 79313, 20992, '<td valign="top">funny, but...no...too bad to get a high score from me, because the background is just way too disturbing, the figure is not really suggesting what your title is saying and the lightning on the whole scene is bad...</td>', 'funny, but...no...too bad to get a high score from me, because the background is just way too disturbing, the figure is not really suggesting what your title is saying and the lightning on the whole scene is bad...', '2004-05-26 16:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(737684, 79263, 21542, '<td valign="top">This is a moment to sit back and have your monitor checked.  None of your blacks are actually black, and I''m left wondering what on earth the random oval in the middle of your shot is.  And while the motion blur is relatively well done (a little over the top, maybe), absolutely no other part of the shot is in focus; give us something to hang onto.<br/> <br/>Oops... and check your crop job down in the lower right...</td>', 'This is a moment to sit back and have your monitor checked.  None of your blacks are actually black, and I''m left wondering what on earth the random oval in the middle of your shot is.  And while the motion blur is relatively well done (a little over the top, maybe), absolutely no other part of the shot is in focus; give us something to hang onto. Oops... and check your crop job down in the lower right...', '2004-05-26 16:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(737686, 78303, 7907, '<td valign="top">This is very nice - too bad the horizon is slightly off.</td>', 'This is very nice - too bad the horizon is slightly off.', '2004-05-26 16:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(737687, 78834, 20992, '<td valign="top">I really think that this is a nice picture, technically of a high standard, but what made you choose this subject for this challenge??</td>', 'I really think that this is a nice picture, technically of a high standard, but what made you choose this subject for this challenge??', '2004-05-26 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737689, 78435, 20992, '<td valign="top">how did you do this? <br/>I like the compostion and colours, but I would have like it more when the glass was a bit more brighter than now...it almost fades into the background..</td>', 'how did you do this? I like the compostion and colours, but I would have like it more when the glass was a bit more brighter than now...it almost fades into the background..', '2004-05-26 16:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(737690, 79290, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh. Great expression. Totally the way I feel right now (sadly). Also, great composition and very effective use of multiple light sources. Good luck with this one. I hope you do well.</td>', 'This one made me laugh. Great expression. Totally the way I feel right now (sadly). Also, great composition and very effective use of multiple light sources. Good luck with this one. I hope you do well.', '2004-05-26 16:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(737693, 78956, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here very much, the blueness of the sky, the pop of the red shirt and the green fringes of grass to the right. The horizon looks a little off, a slight rotation ccw would make this "feel" a little more natural. I like the capture of the waves and the child as she reaches, it gives the shot a captured moment quality. I''m not seeing multiple light sources, but I thought I''d comment on the photo as a whole.</td>', 'I like the colors here very much, the blueness of the sky, the pop of the red shirt and the green fringes of grass to the right. The horizon looks a little off, a slight rotation ccw would make this "feel" a little more natural. I like the capture of the waves and the child as she reaches, it gives the shot a captured moment quality. I''m not seeing multiple light sources, but I thought I''d comment on the photo as a whole.', '2004-05-26 16:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737694, 78080, 20992, '<td valign="top">great colours and nice composition, good DOF, but I think one light was a bit too bright: the upper leaves of the flowers are too overexposed on the edges..pity..but definitely a top 10 shot!!</td>', 'great colours and nice composition, good DOF, but I think one light was a bit too bright: the upper leaves of the flowers are too overexposed on the edges..pity..but definitely a top 10 shot!!', '2004-05-26 16:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(737701, 79004, 19780, '<td valign="top">I wish very much that this photo was larger so I could really enjoy the details you''ve captured. I love the old style fillament bulbs and the old glass that accentuates the DOF in the window. The irregularness of the bulb placment is really nice.</td>', 'I wish very much that this photo was larger so I could really enjoy the details you''ve captured. I love the old style fillament bulbs and the old glass that accentuates the DOF in the window. The irregularness of the bulb placment is really nice.', '2004-05-26 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(737703, 78325, 20992, '<td valign="top">nice use of coloured lights!! Pity the left site of the photo is out of focus..a bit more of DOF would have made this a great shot!!</td>', 'nice use of coloured lights!! Pity the left site of the photo is out of focus..a bit more of DOF would have made this a great shot!!', '2004-05-26 16:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(737705, 79041, 20992, '<td valign="top">yep! winner!!</td>', 'yep! winner!!', '2004-05-26 16:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(737710, 79299, 20992, '<td valign="top">you say lamps, but I only see one..the combination of orange and blue of the falling night is a nice one.</td>', 'you say lamps, but I only see one..the combination of orange and blue of the falling night is a nice one.', '2004-05-26 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737712, 78341, 22054, '<td valign="top">i love the colors and the light. great</td>', 'i love the colors and the light. great', '2004-05-26 16:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(737715, 79296, 20018, '<td valign="top">good thought, nice execution</td>', 'good thought, nice execution', '2004-05-26 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(737717, 78222, 20992, '<td valign="top">I don''t see why you would show this picture..it had nothing to do with multiple lights, it''s sort of shocking and deadly (!!) out of focus.</td>', 'I don''t see why you would show this picture..it had nothing to do with multiple lights, it''s sort of shocking and deadly (!!) out of focus.', '2004-05-26 16:54:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(737719, 79262, 8509, '<td valign="top">Talk about fulfilling the challenge objectives....<br/>All I can really say is WOW.</td>', 'Talk about fulfilling the challenge objectives....All I can really say is WOW.', '2004-05-26 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(737721, 79103, 20992, '<td valign="top">wooh!! Such a long exposure time and so sharp!! How''s that possible!!</td>', 'wooh!! Such a long exposure time and so sharp!! How''s that possible!!', '2004-05-26 16:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(737725, 78412, 20018, '<td valign="top">i like this but having a hard time seeing it...make use of the full 640pixels..might want to adjust the white balance as well<br/></td>', 'i like this but having a hard time seeing it...make use of the full 640pixels..might want to adjust the white balance as well', '2004-05-26 16:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737726, 77996, 19780, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh. It''s just so charming to see a marble with a high tech replacement. The highlights on the left edge of the gameboy are wonderful and the curve of the yellow swish in the marble is especially fun because it''s such an organic shape combined with the perfect sphere and then the electronics. Your composition is original and inventive and I like the use of negative space at the top of the frame. Your DOF and focus and exposure are all top notch.</td>', 'This one made me laugh. It''s just so charming to see a marble with a high tech replacement. The highlights on the left edge of the gameboy are wonderful and the curve of the yellow swish in the marble is especially fun because it''s such an organic shape combined with the perfect sphere and then the electronics. Your composition is original and inventive and I like the use of negative space at the top of the frame. Your DOF and focus and exposure are all top notch.', '2004-05-26 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(737730, 79154, 20992, '<td valign="top">applause! you managed to get in the flower!! You just forgot to use a second lightsource other than daylight (or didn''t you?)</td>', 'applause! you managed to get in the flower!! You just forgot to use a second lightsource other than daylight (or didn''t you?)', '2004-05-26 16:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(737732, 78114, 20018, '<td valign="top">pretty damn cool</td>', 'pretty damn cool', '2004-05-26 16:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(737738, 79004, 20992, '<td valign="top">strange atmosphere you created...but who''s john, why is he having those strange lights on his table and what is the other disturbing thing on the table? All in all..you didn''t really used the light to actually light the scene a bit more...this picture raises questions..</td>', 'strange atmosphere you created...but who''s john, why is he having those strange lights on his table and what is the other disturbing thing on the table? All in all..you didn''t really used the light to actually light the scene a bit more...this picture raises questions..', '2004-05-26 16:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737741, 79018, 20018, '<td valign="top">neat shot sort of sureal like it was actually a toy set, not sure if the light bleed from the stadium lights helps or hurts</td>', 'neat shot sort of sureal like it was actually a toy set, not sure if the light bleed from the stadium lights helps or hurts', '2004-05-26 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737750, 78994, 20018, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, might be a little better if you cropped closer in and used the 640xSomething</td>', 'interesting shot, might be a little better if you cropped closer in and used the 640xSomething', '2004-05-26 17:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737755, 77847, 20018, '<td valign="top">little too dark, shadows too pronounced, seems though to fit the mood, just not very attractive</td>', 'little too dark, shadows too pronounced, seems though to fit the mood, just not very attractive', '2004-05-26 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(737756, 77955, 20992, '<td valign="top">nice picture! good DOF, nice use of the lights (it''s almost like how my eyes would have seen it)..the street is so poorly lit that it wouldn''t surprise me that this picture is a colour photo and not black and white!!!</td>', 'nice picture! good DOF, nice use of the lights (it''s almost like how my eyes would have seen it)..the street is so poorly lit that it wouldn''t surprise me that this picture is a colour photo and not black and white!!!', '2004-05-26 17:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737758, 79306, 20992, '<td valign="top">you really needed the second light from the left to colour in the grass, the orange lights adds great colour contrast to the picture! Great use of the lights thus!</td>', 'you really needed the second light from the left to colour in the grass, the orange lights adds great colour contrast to the picture! Great use of the lights thus!', '2004-05-26 17:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(737762, 78281, 20992, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the purple light is adding something to the flower and the top of the leaves are overexposed...furthermore, the picture is too blurred, nothing is in focus. Good idea, presentation is not so good..</td>', 'I don''t think the purple light is adding something to the flower and the top of the leaves are overexposed...furthermore, the picture is too blurred, nothing is in focus. Good idea, presentation is not so good..', '2004-05-26 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(737768, 79307, 20992, '<td valign="top">too bad the upper part of the photo is overexposed and the light at the end of the tunnel is too weak...it also seems like you overused the Unsharp Mask. The idea is wonderful though!</td>', 'too bad the upper part of the photo is overexposed and the light at the end of the tunnel is too weak...it also seems like you overused the Unsharp Mask. The idea is wonderful though!', '2004-05-26 17:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737770, 78800, 20992, '<td valign="top">you managed to show the difference between the two lightsources and the title is well chosen! I love the sphere you put down with this photo, the use of colours and the composition! Top 10 photo!!</td>', 'you managed to show the difference between the two lightsources and the title is well chosen! I love the sphere you put down with this photo, the use of colours and the composition! Top 10 photo!!', '2004-05-26 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(737777, 77781, 20018, '<td valign="top">great subject for B&amp;W...just wondering about the multiple light sources...</td>', 'great subject for B&W...just wondering about the multiple light sources...', '2004-05-26 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737779, 78741, 16739, '<td valign="top">it''s spring</td>', 'it''s spring', '2004-05-26 17:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(737780, 78742, 21833, '<td valign="top">Love the pattern cast from the lights.  Mesmerizing!</td>', 'Love the pattern cast from the lights.  Mesmerizing!', '2004-05-26 17:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737781, 79160, 21833, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.  Perhaps a  larger aperture and faster shutter speed?</td>', 'Out of focus.  Perhaps a  larger aperture and faster shutter speed?', '2004-05-26 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737784, 79248, 21833, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this meets the challenge, but a good pic nonetheless.</td>', 'Not sure how this meets the challenge, but a good pic nonetheless.', '2004-05-26 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(737786, 78408, 21833, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the egg, and nice coloring from the lights.</td>', 'Nice texture on the egg, and nice coloring from the lights.', '2004-05-26 17:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(737787, 78512, 21833, '<td valign="top">Very good pattern.  Almost abstract.  I like it!</td>', 'Very good pattern.  Almost abstract.  I like it!', '2004-05-26 17:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(737788, 79087, 21833, '<td valign="top">BG is severely motion-blurred.  You needed a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'BG is severely motion-blurred.  You needed a faster shutter speed.', '2004-05-26 17:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(737789, 79184, 21833, '<td valign="top">Great compostition, but the light switch on the left throws off the whole balance of the picture.</td>', 'Great compostition, but the light switch on the left throws off the whole balance of the picture.', '2004-05-26 17:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(737791, 78032, 21833, '<td valign="top">I love timed exposures like this.  Gives a real sense of speed.</td>', 'I love timed exposures like this.  Gives a real sense of speed.', '2004-05-26 17:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(737794, 79178, 21833, '<td valign="top">"Bright"<br/>It sure is. . .</td>', '"Bright"It sure is. . .', '2004-05-26 17:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(737795, 77931, 22011, '<td valign="top">This image is quite busy, I think to make it cleaner you could have dimmed down the overheard lights / bounce flash to isolate the model &amp; sewing machine...    What''s she making?</td>', 'This image is quite busy, I think to make it cleaner you could have dimmed down the overheard lights / bounce flash to isolate the model & sewing machine...    What''s she making?', '2004-05-26 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(737796, 78212, 21833, '<td valign="top">I like the red background.  It almost suggests an ominous tone in an otherwise angelic composition.</td>', 'I like the red background.  It almost suggests an ominous tone in an otherwise angelic composition.', '2004-05-26 17:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(737799, 79320, 21833, '<td valign="top">Looks like a spur of the moment snapshot.</td>', 'Looks like a spur of the moment snapshot.', '2004-05-26 17:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(737800, 79182, 21833, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the shadows deepen as your eye travels from left to right...  I like it.</td>', 'Interesting how the shadows deepen as your eye travels from left to right...  I like it.', '2004-05-26 17:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(737801, 78957, 21833, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Might have been a little better if the seed pod had been disconnected from the main flower a little, but what do I know?</td>', 'Very interesting.  Might have been a little better if the seed pod had been disconnected from the main flower a little, but what do I know?', '2004-05-26 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737802, 78286, 21833, '<td valign="top">Venetian blinds in the background are far too distracting and busy.</td>', 'Venetian blinds in the background are far too distracting and busy.', '2004-05-26 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(737803, 79290, 21833, '<td valign="top">Angular shadows and uneven light are ruining the composition in this pic.</td>', 'Angular shadows and uneven light are ruining the composition in this pic.', '2004-05-26 17:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737804, 77781, 21833, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and texture.  Would have been nice to see a payoff at the convergence of the lines, since your eye is naturally led to the bottom of the picture.  As-is: anticlimactic.</td>', 'Nice tone and texture.  Would have been nice to see a payoff at the convergence of the lines, since your eye is naturally led to the bottom of the picture.  As-is: anticlimactic.', '2004-05-26 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(737806, 79291, 22011, '<td valign="top">I think a 3rd''s composition would work better for this shot..</td>', 'I think a 3rd''s composition would work better for this shot..', '2004-05-26 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(737807, 78366, 21833, '<td valign="top">Blurry and confusing.  I assume (by the title) that the focus is on the name of the syrups, but the are almost unreadable.  Picture is unbalanced, with almost a defineable diagonal line at the halfway point of the pic.  Lots of useless negative space.</td>', 'Blurry and confusing.  I assume (by the title) that the focus is on the name of the syrups, but the are almost unreadable.  Picture is unbalanced, with almost a defineable diagonal line at the halfway point of the pic.  Lots of useless negative space.', '2004-05-26 17:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(737808, 78800, 21833, '<td valign="top">Should have been cropped tighter to eliminate negative space.  Good leading of the eye to the sunlight.</td>', 'Should have been cropped tighter to eliminate negative space.  Good leading of the eye to the sunlight.', '2004-05-26 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(737810, 78275, 22011, '<td valign="top">I saw a comment on another challenge about the practice of normally removing power lines from photos using PS or similar.  This is another good reason toleave them in.<br/> <br/>Nice image, although I would have put the power Pylon further to the right (3rd''s?)</td>', 'I saw a comment on another challenge about the practice of normally removing power lines from photos using PS or similar.  This is another good reason toleave them in. Nice image, although I would have put the power Pylon further to the right (3rd''s?)', '2004-05-26 17:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(737811, 78341, 21833, '<td valign="top">Nice graduation of color from top to bottom.  Interesting lines and coposition.  Good balance.</td>', 'Nice graduation of color from top to bottom.  Interesting lines and coposition.  Good balance.', '2004-05-26 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(737812, 79156, 21833, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2004-05-26 17:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(737814, 79296, 21833, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, with the three colored shadows.  I like how it is off-center as well.  Good shot.</td>', 'This is very cool, with the three colored shadows.  I like how it is off-center as well.  Good shot.', '2004-05-26 17:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(737817, 79034, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a neat image, pity about the dust/scratches on the bulb...  Just the right amount of ''negative space'' around the bulb for my money.</td>', 'This is a neat image, pity about the dust/scratches on the bulb...  Just the right amount of ''negative space'' around the bulb for my money.', '2004-05-26 17:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(737821, 78212, 20018, '<td valign="top">great lighting job, but so much of this seems to be someone else''s work</td>', 'great lighting job, but so much of this seems to be someone else''s work', '2004-05-26 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(737823, 79288, 21833, '<td valign="top">Relevance?</td>', 'Relevance?', '2004-05-26 17:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(737824, 78080, 21833, '<td valign="top">Relevance?</td>', 'Relevance?', '2004-05-26 17:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(737826, 79041, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, might benefit from a tighter crop on the right to lose the two big hot spots. Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice color, might benefit from a tighter crop on the right to lose the two big hot spots. Good luck.', '2004-05-26 17:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(737827, 78690, 22011, '<td valign="top">Ooer...</td>', 'Ooer...', '2004-05-26 17:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(737830, 79262, 21621, '<td valign="top">Brilliant work, Fantastic shot,  just superb.</td>', 'Brilliant work, Fantastic shot,  just superb.', '2004-05-26 17:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(737831, 78281, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-05-26 17:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(737832, 78857, 22011, '<td valign="top">How large is this model?  Just curious...</td>', 'How large is this model?  Just curious...', '2004-05-26 17:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(737834, 78949, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rotoation effective, lovely effect. Like also the sense of mystery that the inability to see the other end of the ''corridor'' produces; Don''t expect to see it scoring very much above 5, but here''s an 8 for you.</td>', 'Rotoation effective, lovely effect. Like also the sense of mystery that the inability to see the other end of the ''corridor'' produces; Don''t expect to see it scoring very much above 5, but here''s an 8 for you.', '2004-05-26 17:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737836, 79041, 327, '<td valign="top">Great colors, and of course light! Nice one. 8 from me.</td>', 'Great colors, and of course light! Nice one. 8 from me.', '2004-05-26 18:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(737837, 78069, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, perspective, color, focus, all great.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice shot, perspective, color, focus, all great.  Good luck.', '2004-05-26 18:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(737840, 78946, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors but why is your shot so small? If you having trouble with sizing post in the forums and someone will help you. Good entry!</td>', 'Pretty colors but why is your shot so small? If you having trouble with sizing post in the forums and someone will help you. Good entry!', '2004-05-26 18:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(737841, 78146, 6999, '<td valign="top">Dang - this was a Benzene Ring when I studied chemistry. Kind of like the effect, but don''t find much of great interest in the shot. DOF helps to give some idea of the three-dimensionality of it, but works against any visual ''magic'' for me.</td>', 'Dang - this was a Benzene Ring when I studied chemistry. Kind of like the effect, but don''t find much of great interest in the shot. DOF helps to give some idea of the three-dimensionality of it, but works against any visual ''magic'' for me.', '2004-05-26 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(737843, 79303, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a nice mood here. I love the red table and the title too. :) GOOD luck.</td>', 'Really a nice mood here. I love the red table and the title too. :) GOOD luck.', '2004-05-26 18:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(737846, 78742, 22011, '<td valign="top">I find the off center door and soft focus are a bit distracting in this shot.</td>', 'I find the off center door and soft focus are a bit distracting in this shot.', '2004-05-26 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737848, 79300, 6999, '<td valign="top">Inclusion of the little camera sign makes me smile. Like the composition, the rooting of the whole image in bottom left, spreading acros the frame. colouration is good, though I''m not sure about the extent of your processing - a personal preference, but then, a personal vote.</td>', 'Inclusion of the little camera sign makes me smile. Like the composition, the rooting of the whole image in bottom left, spreading acros the frame. colouration is good, though I''m not sure about the extent of your processing - a personal preference, but then, a personal vote.', '2004-05-26 18:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(737851, 77853, 327, '<td valign="top">I think if this was shot when lit it would of had more impact.</td>', 'I think if this was shot when lit it would of had more impact.', '2004-05-26 18:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(737852, 79088, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Wow we really waste electricity don''t we? Good looking shot.</td>', 'Pretty. Wow we really waste electricity don''t we? Good looking shot.', '2004-05-26 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(737855, 78269, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work on a difficult capture, and an extraordinarily still moment. Good colours. A bit of a push to get into the challenge criteria, for which you lose a mark or two from me - I''m not saying it''s outside it, but you''re pushing the limits too hard for my taste. 6</td>', 'Good work on a difficult capture, and an extraordinarily still moment. Good colours. A bit of a push to get into the challenge criteria, for which you lose a mark or two from me - I''m not saying it''s outside it, but you''re pushing the limits too hard for my taste. 6', '2004-05-26 18:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(737858, 79248, 22011, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, although the focus seems tobe on the object on theleft, not the bird.</td>', 'Stunning image, although the focus seems tobe on the object on theleft, not the bird.', '2004-05-26 18:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(737861, 78834, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro - great sense of the fragility of the wings here, and the curl of its proboscis (sp?) . Great detail, good light. More than one source? It isn''t clear, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt I suppose.</td>', 'Wonderful macro - great sense of the fragility of the wings here, and the curl of its proboscis (sp?) . Great detail, good light. More than one source? It isn''t clear, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt I suppose.', '2004-05-26 18:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(737863, 78800, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the exposure here - the controlled blowing out of the highlights from the sun really add impact to the sense of suffusion of light through the space. In my experience people will comment on that as a bad point, but don''t believe them - it''s a fascinating and useful trick, well pulled off here.</td>', 'Like the exposure here - the controlled blowing out of the highlights from the sun really add impact to the sense of suffusion of light through the space. In my experience people will comment on that as a bad point, but don''t believe them - it''s a fascinating and useful trick, well pulled off here.', '2004-05-26 18:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(737864, 79178, 6999, '<td valign="top">ahem. So much flash that it''s difficult to tell if there actually is another light source. Obviously you''ve done this deliberately, from your title, but I don''t find anything of interest here.</td>', 'ahem. So much flash that it''s difficult to tell if there actually is another light source. Obviously you''ve done this deliberately, from your title, but I don''t find anything of interest here.', '2004-05-26 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(737868, 79158, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting cropping and composition. A sense of dried staw in that light painting, somehow, which also somehow seems apt to the image. Neat work. Has a sense of 1970''s design to it also.</td>', 'Intersting cropping and composition. A sense of dried staw in that light painting, somehow, which also somehow seems apt to the image. Neat work. Has a sense of 1970''s design to it also.', '2004-05-26 18:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(737870, 78212, 6999, '<td valign="top">Just the lightest sense of reflection from your rpimary light, but enough to distract for me. Not big-time, though. One enormous soft-light is what this cries out for in my book, and I''d perhaps have reduce d the level of the blue fill, though I can absolutely understand your position in re this challenge. I think I''d personally want a touch more light on the background, or rather as mch but in a broader area - I want to lighten my monitor tos ee the texture there also. Very effective though - all the above are just personla opinions and thoughts.</td>', 'Just the lightest sense of reflection from your rpimary light, but enough to distract for me. Not big-time, though. One enormous soft-light is what this cries out for in my book, and I''d perhaps have reduce d the level of the blue fill, though I can absolutely understand your position in re this challenge. I think I''d personally want a touch more light on the background, or rather as mch but in a broader area - I want to lighten my monitor tos ee the texture there also. Very effective though - all the above are just personla opinions and thoughts.', '2004-05-26 18:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737873, 79239, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good eye. Would dearly love to see something done about the noise in the blue here, but I appreciate your dilemma with the black umbrellas and any kind of darkness.</td>', 'Good eye. Would dearly love to see something done about the noise in the blue here, but I appreciate your dilemma with the black umbrellas and any kind of darkness.', '2004-05-26 18:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(737883, 78408, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great work.</td>', 'Nice shot, great work.', '2004-05-26 18:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737888, 77936, 22046, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is wonderful and so clever.</td>', 'The lighting in this is wonderful and so clever.', '2004-05-26 18:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(737891, 78494, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is a near perfect portrait. I love the sharp focus throughout the whole portrait and the lighting is great.</td>', 'This is a near perfect portrait. I love the sharp focus throughout the whole portrait and the lighting is great.', '2004-05-26 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(737892, 78464, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this. It feels like jazz.</td>', 'Great lighting on this. It feels like jazz.', '2004-05-26 18:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(737893, 79319, 22046, '<td valign="top">Just a touch dark for me but otherwise perfect use of colored light.</td>', 'Just a touch dark for me but otherwise perfect use of colored light.', '2004-05-26 18:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(737894, 79158, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like your use of light here.</td>', 'I really like your use of light here.', '2004-05-26 18:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
