(738847, 77789, 20407, '<td valign="top">Poor pussycat with the light in his eyes. I tihnk this image would be more successful if you cropped right in on his squinty eyes and the outline of his whiskers with the grass in the background. You should have a go at this, I think it might be a nice portrait.</td>', 'Poor pussycat with the light in his eyes. I tihnk this image would be more successful if you cropped right in on his squinty eyes and the outline of his whiskers with the grass in the background. You should have a go at this, I think it might be a nice portrait.', '2004-05-27 06:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(738850, 79183, 20407, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about your choice of subject matter. However, the lighting is quite nice. Hopefully this is a good start on the way to more lighting photos and better subjects :-)</td>', 'I''m not sure about your choice of subject matter. However, the lighting is quite nice. Hopefully this is a good start on the way to more lighting photos and better subjects :-)', '2004-05-27 06:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(738852, 78742, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but your choice of subject is a little dull and flat. A little more work in photshop might bring the colours up. The idea shows that you have an eye for the subject though - looking forward to seeing more work from you.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but your choice of subject is a little dull and flat. A little more work in photshop might bring the colours up. The idea shows that you have an eye for the subject though - looking forward to seeing more work from you.', '2004-05-27 06:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(738859, 78275, 20407, '<td valign="top">I can''t see multiple light sources here, but anyway, this is one of my choices for a top 10. I love it.</td>', 'I can''t see multiple light sources here, but anyway, this is one of my choices for a top 10. I love it.', '2004-05-27 07:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(738860, 78114, 20407, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The word in the eye really makes the shot. I tired something like this with a cat for this challenge but just got squiggles in the eyes.  I guess dogs sit still better.  9<br/> <br/>Is he waiting for you to come out of the bar? :)</td>', 'Excellent. The word in the eye really makes the shot. I tired something like this with a cat for this challenge but just got squiggles in the eyes.  I guess dogs sit still better.  9 Is he waiting for you to come out of the bar? :)', '2004-05-27 07:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(738863, 79102, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. The black shadow/bushes/whatever in the foreground really give it a nice balance.  It''s so clear for a night shot. 9</td>', 'This is lovely. The black shadow/bushes/whatever in the foreground really give it a nice balance.  It''s so clear for a night shot. 9', '2004-05-27 07:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(738865, 78683, 20407, '<td valign="top">The balance of this is good, but seeing the bases of the candles disturbs the photo for me. You might try running it through Neat Image to get rid of some of the grain.</td>', 'The balance of this is good, but seeing the bases of the candles disturbs the photo for me. You might try running it through Neat Image to get rid of some of the grain.', '2004-05-27 07:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(738867, 78356, 20407, '<td valign="top">I can''t say much about this, except that I really really like it. It would make an excellent print. The border works well on this. 9</td>', 'I can''t say much about this, except that I really really like it. It would make an excellent print. The border works well on this. 9', '2004-05-27 07:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(738868, 78069, 20407, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, excellent angle. Well done. 9</td>', 'Lovely colours, excellent angle. Well done. 9', '2004-05-27 07:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(738869, 78032, 20407, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I think ti would also look good if you cropped right in on the left side with the steps and the orbiter sign.  It would be nice to see a series of these photos. 9</td>', 'I really like this. I think ti would also look good if you cropped right in on the left side with the steps and the orbiter sign.  It would be nice to see a series of these photos. 9', '2004-05-27 07:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(738875, 77936, 20407, '<td valign="top">Oooh, this is going to be controversial. I''ve never seen it done with two hearts before, that is clever. It is a nice idea to put it on the definition of marriage page too. Good luck, hope you survive the comments :-)</td>', 'Oooh, this is going to be controversial. I''ve never seen it done with two hearts before, that is clever. It is a nice idea to put it on the definition of marriage page too. Good luck, hope you survive the comments :-)', '2004-05-27 07:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(738892, 79320, 6999, '<td valign="top">This has to be one fo those shots that is so bizarre it''s not fake. Certainly meets the challenge, but I think a number of people are going to do you down for being too strange.</td>', 'This has to be one fo those shots that is so bizarre it''s not fake. Certainly meets the challenge, but I think a number of people are going to do you down for being too strange.', '2004-05-27 07:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
