(739590, 79315, 20679, '<td valign="top">I think the burnt out light in the top right is a bit distracting. Nice composition though</td>', 'I think the burnt out light in the top right is a bit distracting. Nice composition though', '2004-05-27 17:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(739591, 79281, 17357, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2004-05-27 17:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(739594, 78730, 19305, '<td valign="top">should have held up a yellow or orange filter over the flash to even the color temp from the multiple light sources (or not used a flash at all).</td>', 'should have held up a yellow or orange filter over the flash to even the color temp from the multiple light sources (or not used a flash at all).', '2004-05-27 17:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(739595, 78496, 20679, '<td valign="top">beautifully lit portrait. As photographers we know that there are multiple light sources used, but the key is to make the phot look as natural as possible, which you have done so well. However I think the theme was looking for a more obvious use of multiple sources so will have to mark it down a little accordingly. Great shot though. 8</td>', 'beautifully lit portrait. As photographers we know that there are multiple light sources used, but the key is to make the phot look as natural as possible, which you have done so well. However I think the theme was looking for a more obvious use of multiple sources so will have to mark it down a little accordingly. Great shot though. 8', '2004-05-27 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(739596, 79034, 19305, '<td valign="top">a spectacular image.</td>', 'a spectacular image.', '2004-05-27 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(739598, 78412, 19305, '<td valign="top">I like the light you got from the clouds by lengthening the exposure.</td>', 'I like the light you got from the clouds by lengthening the exposure.', '2004-05-27 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(739599, 78412, 17357, '<td valign="top">would have liked to see it a little bit bigger.</td>', 'would have liked to see it a little bit bigger.', '2004-05-27 17:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(739601, 79248, 19305, '<td valign="top">wow. i''m impressed.</td>', 'wow. i''m impressed.', '2004-05-27 17:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(739608, 79314, 20679, '<td valign="top">novel interpretation!</td>', 'novel interpretation!', '2004-05-27 17:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(739610, 79221, 19305, '<td valign="top">a very interesting subject, very interestingly and proficiently photographed.</td>', 'a very interesting subject, very interestingly and proficiently photographed.', '2004-05-27 17:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(739612, 78426, 19305, '<td valign="top">very nice. nicely composed. perfect exposure.</td>', 'very nice. nicely composed. perfect exposure.', '2004-05-27 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(739615, 78385, 19305, '<td valign="top">oops... the slide is in backwards.</td>', 'oops... the slide is in backwards.', '2004-05-27 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(739616, 79129, 20679, '<td valign="top">beautifully captured</td>', 'beautifully captured', '2004-05-27 17:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(739618, 79288, 19305, '<td valign="top">nice spur of the moment type shot. too bad there wasn''t more appropriate imagery on screen (like dog poo or potato salad or something).</td>', 'nice spur of the moment type shot. too bad there wasn''t more appropriate imagery on screen (like dog poo or potato salad or something).', '2004-05-27 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(739619, 78322, 17357, '<td valign="top">for me, this one has a really seventies vibe to it.</td>', 'for me, this one has a really seventies vibe to it.', '2004-05-27 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(739624, 77936, 20679, '<td valign="top">haven''t we see this before? ;)  It is still very nice and the multiple light sources work well!</td>', 'haven''t we see this before? ;)  It is still very nice and the multiple light sources work well!', '2004-05-27 17:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(739626, 79180, 20679, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Love the DOF and the lighting is tremendous!</td>', 'Awesome shot. Love the DOF and the lighting is tremendous!', '2004-05-27 17:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(739628, 77844, 19305, '<td valign="top">putting the reflector in-frame is a little over-the-top (and not too subtle, either). The fringing effect on the leaves and petals on the left side would be great applied to the whole plant with an out-of-frame reflector. Could have been one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'putting the reflector in-frame is a little over-the-top (and not too subtle, either). The fringing effect on the leaves and petals on the left side would be great applied to the whole plant with an out-of-frame reflector. Could have been one of the best in the challenge.', '2004-05-27 17:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(739633, 79202, 19305, '<td valign="top">pretty to look at, just don''t touch! you have some overcompression or sharpening or something going on creating jpeg artifacts. should have been a tad more careful with that before posting...</td>', 'pretty to look at, just don''t touch! you have some overcompression or sharpening or something going on creating jpeg artifacts. should have been a tad more careful with that before posting...', '2004-05-27 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(739638, 79215, 19305, '<td valign="top">an ode to renee magritte''s empire of light? One of my favorite series of paintings, BTW.</td>', 'an ode to renee magritte''s empire of light? One of my favorite series of paintings, BTW.', '2004-05-27 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(739640, 79237, 19305, '<td valign="top">how did you get it to stay still? I don''t see the pin! nice work</td>', 'how did you get it to stay still? I don''t see the pin! nice work', '2004-05-27 17:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(739644, 79309, 17357, '<td valign="top">lights were a little too hot for me</td>', 'lights were a little too hot for me', '2004-05-27 17:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(739645, 78339, 19305, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this lighting a lot. and the abstract nature of the imagery. composition probably could have stuck to the rule of thirds a little more closely, but overall a very good image.</td>', 'I enjoy this lighting a lot. and the abstract nature of the imagery. composition probably could have stuck to the rule of thirds a little more closely, but overall a very good image.', '2004-05-27 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(739646, 78092, 19305, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the emerald city for some reason...</td>', 'reminds me of the emerald city for some reason...', '2004-05-27 17:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(739647, 79213, 19305, '<td valign="top">very creative. a little noisy. could have used a little more front-lighting. very fun.</td>', 'very creative. a little noisy. could have used a little more front-lighting. very fun.', '2004-05-27 17:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(739657, 78114, 11068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but why is it blue?</td>', 'Beautiful, but why is it blue?', '2004-05-27 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(739673, 79232, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lighting on this is great, I really just wish there was more context for the composition. Is the guy singing and girl''s enjoying it? Is it a duet?</td>', 'Lighting on this is great, I really just wish there was more context for the composition. Is the guy singing and girl''s enjoying it? Is it a duet?', '2004-05-27 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(739685, 79300, 19305, '<td valign="top">way noisy. very good composition.</td>', 'way noisy. very good composition.', '2004-05-27 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(739710, 79016, 20679, '<td valign="top">I love this! I think it should be a ribbon winner. The tonality is wonderful and the angle superb</td>', 'I love this! I think it should be a ribbon winner. The tonality is wonderful and the angle superb', '2004-05-27 18:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(739712, 79156, 20679, '<td valign="top">badly out of focus</td>', 'badly out of focus', '2004-05-27 18:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(739714, 78993, 20679, '<td valign="top">shame about the burnt out highlights</td>', 'shame about the burnt out highlights', '2004-05-27 18:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(739718, 79262, 20679, '<td valign="top">how the heck did you do this? Beautiful!</td>', 'how the heck did you do this? Beautiful!', '2004-05-27 18:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(739723, 79255, 20679, '<td valign="top">ugh! Ugly flash on ugly gargoyle!</td>', 'ugh! Ugly flash on ugly gargoyle!', '2004-05-27 18:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(739726, 79089, 20679, '<td valign="top">a GREAT reflection shot - shame about the crop cutting the ankle and reflected head. Not sure it shows multiple light sources too well....</td>', 'a GREAT reflection shot - shame about the crop cutting the ankle and reflected head. Not sure it shows multiple light sources too well....', '2004-05-27 18:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(739727, 78933, 11518, '<td valign="top">This would probably have been better in the portrait mode.nice capture.</td>', 'This would probably have been better in the portrait mode.nice capture.', '2004-05-27 18:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(739728, 79160, 20679, '<td valign="top">focus is poor, unfortunately</td>', 'focus is poor, unfortunately', '2004-05-27 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(739729, 79296, 20679, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot</td>', 'I like this a lot', '2004-05-27 18:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(739730, 79239, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A tad oversharpened (you can see a halo along the edges) and overexposed.</td>', 'Nice shot. A tad oversharpened (you can see a halo along the edges) and overexposed.', '2004-05-27 18:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(739735, 79296, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice but thge black area on the bottom left corber is distracting</td>', 'Nice but thge black area on the bottom left corber is distracting', '2004-05-27 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(739736, 79087, 20679, '<td valign="top">shame about the camera shake in the lights. Nice idea and interpretation of theme. Would definitely be a winner if the tripod was firmer and the  I also think the model should have a different kind of demeanor to create the right atmoshphere for the title.</td>', 'shame about the camera shake in the lights. Nice idea and interpretation of theme. Would definitely be a winner if the tripod was firmer and the  I also think the model should have a different kind of demeanor to create the right atmoshphere for the title.', '2004-05-27 18:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(739739, 78659, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL very original, I like. 8</td>', 'LOL very original, I like. 8', '2004-05-27 18:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(739740, 79069, 11518, '<td valign="top">A tad blurry and grainy.</td>', 'A tad blurry and grainy.', '2004-05-27 18:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(739805, 79306, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice ominous tone, something about the tree looming into the shot. Deft handeling of colors and tone. ribbon pick.</td>', 'Nice ominous tone, something about the tree looming into the shot. Deft handeling of colors and tone. ribbon pick.', '2004-05-27 19:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(739809, 78352, 15768, '<td valign="top">amazing! Was it one of those fluke shots or is this selected from many trials?</td>', 'amazing! Was it one of those fluke shots or is this selected from many trials?', '2004-05-27 19:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(739810, 77996, 16106, '<td valign="top">Since my daughter plays with both Im not sure about the title, but the shot is just fine. the small speck of green puts it over the top though I wish the light on the marble was either tighter or had softer edges. Good job, should ribbon IMHO</td>', 'Since my daughter plays with both Im not sure about the title, but the shot is just fine. the small speck of green puts it over the top though I wish the light on the marble was either tighter or had softer edges. Good job, should ribbon IMHO', '2004-05-27 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(739813, 78092, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great sky and subject. both powerfull and balanced in tone. I wish the buildings had a bit more of the frame, but I assume there was a good reason you couldn''t go lower, top ten, but could have been higher.</td>', 'Great sky and subject. both powerfull and balanced in tone. I wish the buildings had a bit more of the frame, but I assume there was a good reason you couldn''t go lower, top ten, but could have been higher.', '2004-05-27 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(739872, 79309, 7908, '<td valign="top">Would be nice to see an angle without all those power lines. Nice soft water though!</td>', 'Would be nice to see an angle without all those power lines. Nice soft water though!', '2004-05-27 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(739877, 77936, 7908, '<td valign="top">Nice multi-source take on it! Konador should be proud ... assuming you''re not him of course :) A little more saturation in the hearts would be great, but presumably not possible with the multiple lights.</td>', 'Nice multi-source take on it! Konador should be proud ... assuming you''re not him of course :) A little more saturation in the hearts would be great, but presumably not possible with the multiple lights.', '2004-05-27 20:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(739879, 79296, 7908, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition ... I like it. I wish the blue and green were a little more saturated, though. And I really wish you had cropped that lower left corner! Nice idea though.</td>', 'Nice simple composition ... I like it. I wish the blue and green were a little more saturated, though. And I really wish you had cropped that lower left corner! Nice idea though.', '2004-05-27 20:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(739886, 78322, 7908, '<td valign="top">Neat shadows and highlights and nice composition. I like the symmetry around the stem of the glass. Don''t know if it would be possible to get a little more color "pop" in the lime, but might be fun to try!</td>', 'Neat shadows and highlights and nice composition. I like the symmetry around the stem of the glass. Don''t know if it would be possible to get a little more color "pop" in the lime, but might be fun to try!', '2004-05-27 20:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(739887, 79103, 7908, '<td valign="top">Nice mood. I''m not sure the branches work very well as a frame though.</td>', 'Nice mood. I''m not sure the branches work very well as a frame though.', '2004-05-27 20:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(739888, 79239, 7908, '<td valign="top">Ha! This is a very nice shot, made even more so by a great title! Love the deep blue sky as well. Very nice!</td>', 'Ha! This is a very nice shot, made even more so by a great title! Love the deep blue sky as well. Very nice!', '2004-05-27 20:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(739890, 79150, 7908, '<td valign="top">The angle is interesting, and makes is somewhat original, but is also a little disconcerting. I just can''t decide if it works for me or not. Sorry.</td>', 'The angle is interesting, and makes is somewhat original, but is also a little disconcerting. I just can''t decide if it works for me or not. Sorry.', '2004-05-27 20:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(739897, 79178, 22011, '<td valign="top">I can see what you''re getting at with this shot, but it''s just too iver exposed for me, and the dead-center composition dosn''t work that well for this subject.</td>', 'I can see what you''re getting at with this shot, but it''s just too iver exposed for me, and the dead-center composition dosn''t work that well for this subject.', '2004-05-27 20:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(739899, 78823, 22011, '<td valign="top">Neat image......  What is it? :-)  I can study this for ages and still not know whether it''s a concave of convex surface, or in fact how many light bulbs are in the picture.</td>', 'Neat image......  What is it? :-)  I can study this for ages and still not know whether it''s a concave of convex surface, or in fact how many light bulbs are in the picture.', '2004-05-27 20:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(739901, 78834, 18374, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Very nice focus and DOF.  The lighting is fantastic as well.  (I''ll take your word for there being multiple sources, though I don''t think it is "obvious")  This is one of my favorites from this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot!  Very nice focus and DOF.  The lighting is fantastic as well.  (I''ll take your word for there being multiple sources, though I don''t think it is "obvious")  This is one of my favorites from this challenge.', '2004-05-27 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(739903, 79279, 18374, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The shadows and blue tint make this very interesting.  The one bright spot at the top of the music stand is a little distracting but it doesn''t detract from the overall image too much.  This is one of my favorites for this week.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The shadows and blue tint make this very interesting.  The one bright spot at the top of the music stand is a little distracting but it doesn''t detract from the overall image too much.  This is one of my favorites for this week.', '2004-05-27 20:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(739905, 79187, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the lighting and color in this one.  The focus and DOF are excellent as well.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the lighting and color in this one.  The focus and DOF are excellent as well.', '2004-05-27 20:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(739907, 78494, 18374, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The lighting definitely enhances the picture and is pretty obviously coming from multiple sources.  I like the large DOF on this picture as well.  The cropping and framing are well conceived.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The lighting definitely enhances the picture and is pretty obviously coming from multiple sources.  I like the large DOF on this picture as well.  The cropping and framing are well conceived.', '2004-05-27 21:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(739908, 79294, 7908, '<td valign="top">Great! Love the angle of the lights on the bowls.</td>', 'Great! Love the angle of the lights on the bowls.', '2004-05-27 21:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(739918, 77936, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge.  I think this photo is executed well-  good focus, exposure and cropping.</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge.  I think this photo is executed well-  good focus, exposure and cropping.', '2004-05-27 21:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(739926, 79158, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I like the effect and the title.  The highlights on the mask look a little overexposed, but other than that the exposure is pretty good.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I like the effect and the title.  The highlights on the mask look a little overexposed, but other than that the exposure is pretty good.', '2004-05-27 21:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(739942, 78277, 13897, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. I''ve tried something similar and it didn''t come out anywhere near as good. Nice work. I expect this to ribbon and hope the others agree. Tom</td>', 'Awesome shot. I''ve tried something similar and it didn''t come out anywhere near as good. Nice work. I expect this to ribbon and hope the others agree. Tom', '2004-05-27 21:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(739945, 78050, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  My one suggestion would be to soften the light a tad.  The lower right hand side looks a little blown out on the edge of the shell.  That is just a little nit-picky.  I still think this is an excellent shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  My one suggestion would be to soften the light a tad.  The lower right hand side looks a little blown out on the edge of the shell.  That is just a little nit-picky.  I still think this is an excellent shot.', '2004-05-27 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(739952, 79088, 18374, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but I think it is a bit too busy.  There is no main subject or point of interest to draw the eye into the photo.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but I think it is a bit too busy.  There is no main subject or point of interest to draw the eye into the photo.', '2004-05-27 21:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(739958, 78050, 17166, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and toning.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and toning.', '2004-05-27 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(739959, 79250, 17166, '<td valign="top">The light underneath is a nice effect, and you''ve created lots of interesting shadows.  The blown-out spots of light - especially on the top of the guys head, are a bit harsh, though.</td>', 'The light underneath is a nice effect, and you''ve created lots of interesting shadows.  The blown-out spots of light - especially on the top of the guys head, are a bit harsh, though.', '2004-05-27 21:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(739962, 79004, 17166, '<td valign="top">The lights with their visible filaments make an interesting subject.  I think the light coming in the window is a bit too much competition for them - this photo might work better taken at a different time of day.</td>', 'The lights with their visible filaments make an interesting subject.  I think the light coming in the window is a bit too much competition for them - this photo might work better taken at a different time of day.', '2004-05-27 21:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(739965, 78080, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice stab at a high-key effect, but a lot of the detail in the flower has been lost.  This is way overcompressed, try saving at a higher jpeg quality.</td>', 'Nice stab at a high-key effect, but a lot of the detail in the flower has been lost.  This is way overcompressed, try saving at a higher jpeg quality.', '2004-05-27 21:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(739972, 79300, 17166, '<td valign="top">The starbursts around the lights are echoed in the sign - nice detail, very creative to capture this.</td>', 'The starbursts around the lights are echoed in the sign - nice detail, very creative to capture this.', '2004-05-27 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(739976, 79020, 17166, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this might work better with the light or camera at a different angle so that the reflection of the colors on the balls showed up better.  Also, lacking in sharpness and detail some of which is likely due to overcompression.  Try saving with a higher jpeg quality setting.</td>', 'I''m thinking this might work better with the light or camera at a different angle so that the reflection of the colors on the balls showed up better.  Also, lacking in sharpness and detail some of which is likely due to overcompression.  Try saving with a higher jpeg quality setting.', '2004-05-27 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(739977, 78269, 17166, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like the sun is setting *in* the water - bizarre.   With everything centered, and the nearly solid colors, this almost looks like some country''s flag.</td>', 'Almost looks like the sun is setting *in* the water - bizarre.   With everything centered, and the nearly solid colors, this almost looks like some country''s flag.', '2004-05-27 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(739984, 78406, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like the basic idea, and the red hair, orange sunglasses, and orange lights compliment each other nicely.  It seems to be lakcing something, though - maybe a different arrangement of the lights, or even hiding her eyes behind the sunglasses maybe?</td>', 'I like the basic idea, and the red hair, orange sunglasses, and orange lights compliment each other nicely.  It seems to be lakcing something, though - maybe a different arrangement of the lights, or even hiding her eyes behind the sunglasses maybe?', '2004-05-27 22:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(739988, 77987, 17166, '<td valign="top">This picture is way too blurry.  Did you use a tripod or try bracing the camera on something, like one of the tables?  Also, it''s suffering from being compressed too much - try saving with a higher jpeg quality setting.</td>', 'This picture is way too blurry.  Did you use a tripod or try bracing the camera on something, like one of the tables?  Also, it''s suffering from being compressed too much - try saving with a higher jpeg quality setting.', '2004-05-27 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(739989, 78352, 17166, '<td valign="top">I bet this one is getting a huge range of votes - I like it, gives a good feeling of the club atmosphere.</td>', 'I bet this one is getting a huge range of votes - I like it, gives a good feeling of the club atmosphere.', '2004-05-27 22:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(739994, 78742, 17166, '<td valign="top">Seems fairly static.  Has some nice rhythm and patterns with the shadows, bricks, pictures, and so on, but not sure what it''s really trying to say.</td>', 'Seems fairly static.  Has some nice rhythm and patterns with the shadows, bricks, pictures, and so on, but not sure what it''s really trying to say.', '2004-05-27 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(739997, 79130, 17166, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better cropped tighter to get rid of the sky.  Nice B&amp;W, the soft background gives a good feeling of motion.</td>', 'I think this would work better cropped tighter to get rid of the sky.  Nice B&W, the soft background gives a good feeling of motion.', '2004-05-27 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(740000, 78627, 11518, '<td valign="top">Well done, very original.</td>', 'Well done, very original.', '2004-05-27 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(740001, 79290, 17166, '<td valign="top">I really like how the edge of the light parallells the edge of the laptop screen - makes it look like the god of computers is shining light upon him, or something like that.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like how the edge of the light parallells the edge of the laptop screen - makes it look like the god of computers is shining light upon him, or something like that.  Nicely done.', '2004-05-27 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(740003, 79211, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, has a soft, dreamy feel to it.</td>', 'Nicely lit, has a soft, dreamy feel to it.', '2004-05-27 22:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(740015, 78882, 19841, '<td valign="top">That vignette around the edges adds an unfortunately soft touch to the clean crisp look of the lighters.  Good idea for the challenge, though!</td>', 'That vignette around the edges adds an unfortunately soft touch to the clean crisp look of the lighters.  Good idea for the challenge, though!', '2004-05-27 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(740049, 79018, 19376, '<td valign="top">brilliant shot--aren''t many that fit the challenge like this one--great job</td>', 'brilliant shot--aren''t many that fit the challenge like this one--great job', '2004-05-27 22:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
