(740408, 79306, 21516, '<td valign="top">A well chosen subject, nice colour balance. Good work capturing green at night. I like it too (personally) so an extra point for that.</td>', 'A well chosen subject, nice colour balance. Good work capturing green at night. I like it too (personally) so an extra point for that.', '2004-05-28 07:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(740409, 78092, 21516, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop and better focus could have improved this, but it''s a very nice photo.</td>', 'A tighter crop and better focus could have improved this, but it''s a very nice photo.', '2004-05-28 07:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(740410, 78957, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong impression that what detail there is here is forced, through processing, rather than captured. I know it''s a very tricky subject to capture, with there being such an amount of fine detail here, and display of very fine white lines on the internet, given the pixels, is tricky. But for me, here, there are too many jagged edges, and too much of the head of the dandelion is out of light or out of focus or just plain dark. Don''t get any sense of multiple light sources either - there amy well be reflectors used etc., but we were asked for it to be ''obvious'', and I fear that here it isn''t - I''m certain this will hurt your score more from others than from me, however. 5</td>', 'Strong impression that what detail there is here is forced, through processing, rather than captured. I know it''s a very tricky subject to capture, with there being such an amount of fine detail here, and display of very fine white lines on the internet, given the pixels, is tricky. But for me, here, there are too many jagged edges, and too much of the head of the dandelion is out of light or out of focus or just plain dark. Don''t get any sense of multiple light sources either - there amy well be reflectors used etc., but we were asked for it to be ''obvious'', and I fear that here it isn''t - I''m certain this will hurt your score more from others than from me, however. 5', '2004-05-28 07:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(740412, 79004, 6999, '<td valign="top">Size issue - you''ve  used way under half the available pixels, under two thirds of the available file size. Even without great software, I would think you could get this image larger. I think I quite like the image, though I always have the feeling with these small shots that something is being hidden by that re-sizing, that maybe the fine detail is missing and just doesn''t register so much at this size. 5</td>', 'Size issue - you''ve  used way under half the available pixels, under two thirds of the available file size. Even without great software, I would think you could get this image larger. I think I quite like the image, though I always have the feeling with these small shots that something is being hidden by that re-sizing, that maybe the fine detail is missing and just doesn''t register so much at this size. 5', '2004-05-28 07:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(740419, 79163, 21516, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, interesting interpretation of the challenge. The final image is over optimised. Try reducing the dimensions if it''s the only way to reduce the file size. Score 6.</td>', 'An interesting photo, interesting interpretation of the challenge. The final image is over optimised. Try reducing the dimensions if it''s the only way to reduce the file size. Score 6.', '2004-05-28 07:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(740421, 79318, 21516, '<td valign="top">Better than most of the other candle shots due to nice cropping</td>', 'Better than most of the other candle shots due to nice cropping', '2004-05-28 07:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(740423, 78275, 21516, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo, good contrast, sharp, lovely colours. But too big of a leap to connect this to the challenge...</td>', 'An excellent photo, good contrast, sharp, lovely colours. But too big of a leap to connect this to the challenge...', '2004-05-28 07:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(740424, 78464, 21516, '<td valign="top">Sharpness/focus might have been improved just a little, but this is being pedantic because the sheen makes focus very difficult in the first place and a good result has been achieved anyway. Lovely colour, great contrast. The green glow on the valves really ''finished off'' the image. Nice use of an interesting background. Complementary colours. Score 9.</td>', 'Sharpness/focus might have been improved just a little, but this is being pedantic because the sheen makes focus very difficult in the first place and a good result has been achieved anyway. Lovely colour, great contrast. The green glow on the valves really ''finished off'' the image. Nice use of an interesting background. Complementary colours. Score 9.', '2004-05-28 07:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(740427, 79216, 21516, '<td valign="top">A clever idea!</td>', 'A clever idea!', '2004-05-28 07:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(740428, 79183, 21516, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and focus with very interesting background colour, but an odd choice of subject. That''s a truly ugly doll! ;)</td>', 'Very nice lighting and focus with very interesting background colour, but an odd choice of subject. That''s a truly ugly doll! ;)', '2004-05-28 07:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(740432, 78356, 21516, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, and a creative interpretation of the challenge. Colour and focus is good. The border perplexes me... Although borders are valid parts of the competition, they are intended to enhance the photo without changing it. This border, although it very definitely improves the *design* of the photo, arguably *changes* the photo. I''m not sure whether this matches the spirit of the competition. I was unsure whether to add points for the clever design of the border or take points off because it alters the photo itself. Final score 6, I decided to take a point off because others don''t use such borders and therefore it could be considered an unfair advantage.</td>', 'A nice photo, and a creative interpretation of the challenge. Colour and focus is good. The border perplexes me... Although borders are valid parts of the competition, they are intended to enhance the photo without changing it. This border, although it very definitely improves the *design* of the photo, arguably *changes* the photo. I''m not sure whether this matches the spirit of the competition. I was unsure whether to add points for the clever design of the border or take points off because it alters the photo itself. Final score 6, I decided to take a point off because others don''t use such borders and therefore it could be considered an unfair advantage.', '2004-05-28 07:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(740434, 77969, 21516, '<td valign="top">This is a happy photo. Made me as happy as looking at penguins waddle along. :D Exciting colour, big emotional response. Score 7.</td>', 'This is a happy photo. Made me as happy as looking at penguins waddle along. :D Exciting colour, big emotional response. Score 7.', '2004-05-28 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(740440, 78309, 21516, '<td valign="top">A very nicely selected photo, and a good crop. Contrast is nice. Plenty of interesting ''primary'' shapes. Good depth in the photo.</td>', 'A very nicely selected photo, and a good crop. Contrast is nice. Plenty of interesting ''primary'' shapes. Good depth in the photo.', '2004-05-28 08:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(740442, 78618, 21516, '<td valign="top">He looks frozen</td>', 'He looks frozen', '2004-05-28 08:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(740443, 78352, 7684, '<td valign="top">9.</td>', '9.', '2004-05-28 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(740445, 79007, 21516, '<td valign="top">Well staged, interesting collection of objects to manipulate the light sources and produce colour. Lost points for the light globe because the predictable object spoils the effect of the other objects a little. Also a little blurry. Score 6.</td>', 'Well staged, interesting collection of objects to manipulate the light sources and produce colour. Lost points for the light globe because the predictable object spoils the effect of the other objects a little. Also a little blurry. Score 6.', '2004-05-28 08:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(740446, 79294, 21516, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour contrast, good to see black as black instead of grey. Bright colours are delightful against the dark background. Extra point because it makes you wonder how it was achieved. Score 9.</td>', 'Very nice colour contrast, good to see black as black instead of grey. Bright colours are delightful against the dark background. Extra point because it makes you wonder how it was achieved. Score 9.', '2004-05-28 08:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(740447, 78212, 7684, '<td valign="top">7.</td>', '7.', '2004-05-28 08:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(740448, 79156, 7684, '<td valign="top">5.</td>', '5.', '2004-05-28 08:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(740449, 78488, 7684, '<td valign="top">5.</td>', '5.', '2004-05-28 08:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(740450, 79262, 21516, '<td valign="top">Very nicely constructed photo, excellent interpretation of the challenge. Optimisation of the final image is a little dirty.</td>', 'Very nicely constructed photo, excellent interpretation of the challenge. Optimisation of the final image is a little dirty.', '2004-05-28 08:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(740451, 79158, 21516, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it means, but it''s a very nice photo.</td>', 'I don''t know what it means, but it''s a very nice photo.', '2004-05-28 08:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(740452, 78985, 7684, '<td valign="top">7.</td>', '7.', '2004-05-28 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(740453, 79068, 7684, '<td valign="top">7.</td>', '7.', '2004-05-28 08:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(740461, 78281, 21516, '<td valign="top">An absolutely lovely photo. Amazing how you''ve brought out the softness and haze with the blue lighting while maintaining the sharpness and contrast of the petals, as well as the bright yellow glow. This deserves a win.</td>', 'An absolutely lovely photo. Amazing how you''ve brought out the softness and haze with the blue lighting while maintaining the sharpness and contrast of the petals, as well as the bright yellow glow. This deserves a win.', '2004-05-28 08:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(740544, 79288, 19841, '<td valign="top">The cropping seems a little odd, but I like the fly on the eye.</td>', 'The cropping seems a little odd, but I like the fly on the eye.', '2004-05-28 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(740545, 78956, 16241, '<td valign="top">brilliant photo, colors are spectacluar!!  9</td>', 'brilliant photo, colors are spectacluar!!  9', '2004-05-28 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(740546, 79221, 16241, '<td valign="top">very cool 8</td>', 'very cool 8', '2004-05-28 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(740550, 78627, 9747, '<td valign="top">While the picture is already awesome, I think it would look even better if the yellow was a bit more yellower (saturated), and the black area on the left and right sides are cropped out. Superb shooting! Would love to know how this was done.</td>', 'While the picture is already awesome, I think it would look even better if the yellow was a bit more yellower (saturated), and the black area on the left and right sides are cropped out. Superb shooting! Would love to know how this was done.', '2004-05-28 10:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(740551, 79288, 16241, '<td valign="top">weird but nice</td>', 'weird but nice', '2004-05-28 10:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(740553, 79313, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s cute, but there is such a thing as overkill, you know.  you''ve totally obliterated the detail on the central thing (looks like otto from the simpsons).  i honestly took the challenge to infer that you should shoot something illuminated by multiple light sources, but i guess this technically fits.  seriously, how many torches do you own?  i would like to have seen a shot taken higher up at a different angle, so that only the reflective surface filled the shot - the dark background doesn''t really fit in my mind.  this is certainly a strange but humourous one...</td>', 'it''s cute, but there is such a thing as overkill, you know.  you''ve totally obliterated the detail on the central thing (looks like otto from the simpsons).  i honestly took the challenge to infer that you should shoot something illuminated by multiple light sources, but i guess this technically fits.  seriously, how many torches do you own?  i would like to have seen a shot taken higher up at a different angle, so that only the reflective surface filled the shot - the dark background doesn''t really fit in my mind.  this is certainly a strange but humourous one...', '2004-05-28 10:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(740554, 78533, 16241, '<td valign="top">En</td>', 'En', '2004-05-28 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(740555, 79149, 9747, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, especially the idea of making it diagnoal. Seeing the light snake come to an end is somewhat distracting for me, so maybe try positioning it so that only the middle of the snake is shown? Also, softening the image would give it a nice ethereal look, I think. Just my opinion. Wonderful subject!</td>', 'I like this a lot, especially the idea of making it diagnoal. Seeing the light snake come to an end is somewhat distracting for me, so maybe try positioning it so that only the middle of the snake is shown? Also, softening the image would give it a nice ethereal look, I think. Just my opinion. Wonderful subject!', '2004-05-28 10:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(740559, 79033, 16004, '<td valign="top">i''m afraid i only see evidence of a singular light source (big star in the sky); unless of course you''re counting the reflection from the glass as the second source?  the shot itself is great, the building (good choice of monochrome) looks very cool in a gotham city kind of way.  i do think the sky might need a bit of a play with - it just seems a bit weird, probably with the textured appearance produced by the clouds.  excellent striking image - just a bit unconvinced with the title.  5.</td>', 'i''m afraid i only see evidence of a singular light source (big star in the sky); unless of course you''re counting the reflection from the glass as the second source?  the shot itself is great, the building (good choice of monochrome) looks very cool in a gotham city kind of way.  i do think the sky might need a bit of a play with - it just seems a bit weird, probably with the textured appearance produced by the clouds.  excellent striking image - just a bit unconvinced with the title.  5.', '2004-05-28 10:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(740566, 79007, 16004, '<td valign="top">of all the light bulb pictures, this is by far the most ethereal...   you''ve almost constructed a whole new world for DP Challenge - looks like a sci-fi film set...  i think the quantity of the black in the background draws the eye away from whats going on somewhat (if the bulb was lower this effect might have been reduced) but in all, a damn good composition.  7.</td>', 'of all the light bulb pictures, this is by far the most ethereal...   you''ve almost constructed a whole new world for DP Challenge - looks like a sci-fi film set...  i think the quantity of the black in the background draws the eye away from whats going on somewhat (if the bulb was lower this effect might have been reduced) but in all, a damn good composition.  7.', '2004-05-28 10:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(740606, 78385, 16402, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and composition in this shot but ... you loose a point for having all the type on the bottle backwards. If this is some sort of mirror image it is not clear and detracts from the whole.</td>', 'I really like the colors and composition in this shot but ... you loose a point for having all the type on the bottle backwards. If this is some sort of mirror image it is not clear and detracts from the whole.', '2004-05-28 11:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(740608, 78933, 16402, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been stronger as a vertical.</td>', 'I think this would have been stronger as a vertical.', '2004-05-28 11:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(740720, 79312, 19337, '<td valign="top">Is that Black Francis??? And you ask yourself.... Where is my mind?</td>', 'Is that Black Francis??? And you ask yourself.... Where is my mind?', '2004-05-28 13:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(740722, 78069, 19337, '<td valign="top">Excellent Picture! I would definitely rate you top 5 in this challenge</td>', 'Excellent Picture! I would definitely rate you top 5 in this challenge', '2004-05-28 13:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(740723, 78020, 19337, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture! You really did a good job capturing the mood. Good Work!</td>', 'I really like this picture! You really did a good job capturing the mood. Good Work!', '2004-05-28 13:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(740725, 79306, 19337, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! I love the colors and everything is nicely in focus. Good Job!</td>', 'Excellent work! I love the colors and everything is nicely in focus. Good Job!', '2004-05-28 13:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(740728, 78994, 19337, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but I think it is a little bit under exposed</td>', 'I like the picture, but I think it is a little bit under exposed', '2004-05-28 13:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(740731, 78932, 16004, '<td valign="top">The idea is good; the title might need some development...  i like how the ehadlights illuminate the dirt in front - pretty good effect that.  however, might i suggest that you position the camera on a more stable surface and use the timer to take a picture?  i''m guessing the shot was hand-held, which inevitably leads to minor levels of shake and fuzziness.  DPC is a pedantic bunch who always harp on about focus...  the silver colour of the car suits the monochrome appearance well...   incidentally, my uncle just got a c-class - they''re very nice.  if it were sharper, 8.  as it is, i awarded 5.</td>', 'The idea is good; the title might need some development...  i like how the ehadlights illuminate the dirt in front - pretty good effect that.  however, might i suggest that you position the camera on a more stable surface and use the timer to take a picture?  i''m guessing the shot was hand-held, which inevitably leads to minor levels of shake and fuzziness.  DPC is a pedantic bunch who always harp on about focus...  the silver colour of the car suits the monochrome appearance well...   incidentally, my uncle just got a c-class - they''re very nice.  if it were sharper, 8.  as it is, i awarded 5.', '2004-05-28 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(740754, 78212, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, nice background.  However, the photo is a tad bit grainy (or so it seems).  The crop is not my favorite though.  I think I''d like to see it closer on the left and top actually,  or even have more room on the left and top.</td>', 'Beautiful color, nice background.  However, the photo is a tad bit grainy (or so it seems).  The crop is not my favorite though.  I think I''d like to see it closer on the left and top actually,  or even have more room on the left and top.', '2004-05-28 13:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(740755, 78403, 9763, '<td valign="top">Do all train stations look like this, or are you in Philadelphia?  I like the angle, but wish the line of the ceiling wasn''t cut off on the lower left.  The colors are very nice.  It''s a very abstract photo.</td>', 'Do all train stations look like this, or are you in Philadelphia?  I like the angle, but wish the line of the ceiling wasn''t cut off on the lower left.  The colors are very nice.  It''s a very abstract photo.', '2004-05-28 13:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(740756, 78520, 9763, '<td valign="top">I guess your mulitple light sources are your flash and the sun?  I see the sunset lighting the back fo the duck.  However, teh face is still a bit dark, even though it looks like a light reflection shows up on the beak from your flash or light source.  The water is kinda brown, so not the most attractive for a photo backdrop, but the reflection is nice.</td>', 'I guess your mulitple light sources are your flash and the sun?  I see the sunset lighting the back fo the duck.  However, teh face is still a bit dark, even though it looks like a light reflection shows up on the beak from your flash or light source.  The water is kinda brown, so not the most attractive for a photo backdrop, but the reflection is nice.', '2004-05-28 13:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(740757, 79180, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus.  I still think there''s a bit too much glare on the face, but it is really nice.  The crop is good too.</td>', 'Very nice focus.  I still think there''s a bit too much glare on the face, but it is really nice.  The crop is good too.', '2004-05-28 13:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(740758, 79085, 9763, '<td valign="top">The top corners are a bit dark, but I like the idea.  I think you could have a little more focus too.</td>', 'The top corners are a bit dark, but I like the idea.  I think you could have a little more focus too.', '2004-05-28 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(740759, 78690, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very horror movie of you!  Too bad the wall is in such great focus.</td>', 'Very horror movie of you!  Too bad the wall is in such great focus.', '2004-05-28 13:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(740760, 78069, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great clarity.  How''d you get this entire sign in focus from that angle?  I pass by this all the time, but have never been inside yet.   For this photo, the color is beautiful, the angle is great, but i would like to see a little space at the bottom below the word museum.  Great job!</td>', 'Great clarity.  How''d you get this entire sign in focus from that angle?  I pass by this all the time, but have never been inside yet.   For this photo, the color is beautiful, the angle is great, but i would like to see a little space at the bottom below the word museum.  Great job!', '2004-05-28 13:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(740766, 78309, 16241, '<td valign="top">stunning, also for centered.......  10</td>', 'stunning, also for centered.......  10', '2004-05-28 13:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(740771, 79300, 19376, '<td valign="top">i like the utra-grainy feel--great idea as well-8</td>', 'i like the utra-grainy feel--great idea as well-8', '2004-05-28 14:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
