(740873, 77789, 16004, '<td valign="top">looks like a nice cuddly cat, but the number of light sources employed to assist in composing this image appears to be singular.  this doesn''t fit the challenge, sorry.</td>', 'looks like a nice cuddly cat, but the number of light sources employed to assist in composing this image appears to be singular.  this doesn''t fit the challenge, sorry.', '2004-05-28 15:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
