(740944, 79282, 22332, '<td valign="top">This "wow" comes from a lover of fine photography and a good profile.  Any other shape wouldn''t have worked.</td>', 'This "wow" comes from a lover of fine photography and a good profile.  Any other shape wouldn''t have worked.', '2004-05-28 16:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(740951, 78956, 22332, '<td valign="top">water looks kinda muddy...</td>', 'water looks kinda muddy...', '2004-05-28 16:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(740955, 78325, 22338, '<td valign="top">Love the colours!</td>', 'Love the colours!', '2004-05-28 16:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(740984, 78834, 19305, '<td valign="top">wow. I''ve never seen this kind of a macro perspective of a butterfly before. very cool.</td>', 'wow. I''ve never seen this kind of a macro perspective of a butterfly before. very cool.', '2004-05-28 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(740985, 78699, 19305, '<td valign="top">nice picturesque title...</td>', 'nice picturesque title...', '2004-05-28 17:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(740987, 79099, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the light reflections.  The shot is a bit on the small side- I can''t make out as much detail in the picture as I would like.  The focus also looks a little soft on the bridge, or maybe there was some slight camera movement during the exposure.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the light reflections.  The shot is a bit on the small side- I can''t make out as much detail in the picture as I would like.  The focus also looks a little soft on the bridge, or maybe there was some slight camera movement during the exposure.', '2004-05-28 17:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(741000, 78325, 18374, '<td valign="top">Great idea! In my opinion there are some things that could be improved to really help this photo stand out.  For one,  I think the soft focus and small DOF hurts this shot.  The drive has nice, sharp, clean lines that would look great in perfect focus  There are two main points of interest in this shot that are spread out on opposite sides of the shot and are competing for my attention.  I think this shot could also be improved by either zooming in more on the arm or the spindle (whichever one you want to focus on) or zooming out and including both in focus as a single subject in the image with the platters serving as the background.  That is all just my opinion, though!  :)</td>', 'Great idea! In my opinion there are some things that could be improved to really help this photo stand out.  For one,  I think the soft focus and small DOF hurts this shot.  The drive has nice, sharp, clean lines that would look great in perfect focus  There are two main points of interest in this shot that are spread out on opposite sides of the shot and are competing for my attention.  I think this shot could also be improved by either zooming in more on the arm or the spindle (whichever one you want to focus on) or zooming out and including both in focus as a single subject in the image with the platters serving as the background.  That is all just my opinion, though!  :)', '2004-05-28 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(741014, 78464, 22011, '<td valign="top">The felt pads in this shot are a little distracting, I would have rotated the trumpt away from the camera a little more..  Stunning image though, and good choise for the backdrop.</td>', 'The felt pads in this shot are a little distracting, I would have rotated the trumpt away from the camera a little more..  Stunning image though, and good choise for the backdrop.', '2004-05-28 17:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(741018, 79221, 22011, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but it''s a neat image. <br/> <br/>Edit:  Possibly oversharpened a little?  High ISO?  Still not sure what I''m looking at :-).</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but it''s a neat image.  Edit:  Possibly oversharpened a little?  High ISO?  Still not sure what I''m looking at :-).', '2004-05-28 17:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(741041, 78956, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great shot all around... dramatic clouds, interesting light effect on the sand, child in the shot gives it the interest.  A bit overpunchy on the colors but I like the effect here.  One of my ribbon picks 9</td>', 'Great shot all around... dramatic clouds, interesting light effect on the sand, child in the shot gives it the interest.  A bit overpunchy on the colors but I like the effect here.  One of my ribbon picks 9', '2004-05-28 17:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(741043, 78050, 14614, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  the b&amp;w treatment adds to the simplicity and has me focus on the form and shadows - you''ve given the shell a luminessence (? spelling).  the soft focus adds to the effect.  One of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'beautiful.  the b&w treatment adds to the simplicity and has me focus on the form and shadows - you''ve given the shell a luminessence (? spelling).  the soft focus adds to the effect.  One of my favorites this challenge', '2004-05-28 17:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(741046, 79089, 14614, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful... the studio lighting is right on but the pose is anything but traditional, reflected sky adds a surreal touch (the cut off foot is the only thing keeping it from perfect)  9  One of my ribbon picks this challenge</td>', 'Just wonderful... the studio lighting is right on but the pose is anything but traditional, reflected sky adds a surreal touch (the cut off foot is the only thing keeping it from perfect)  9  One of my ribbon picks this challenge', '2004-05-28 17:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
