(741244, 78090, 15920, '<td valign="top">This could be a little sharper all around, and the strings are a little overexposed or over processed in some ways.  On the upside, I really like the way you created shadows along the outside of hte guitar''s body.  Perhaps the same light setup with slightly diffused lights would help.</td>', 'This could be a little sharper all around, and the strings are a little overexposed or over processed in some ways.  On the upside, I really like the way you created shadows along the outside of hte guitar''s body.  Perhaps the same light setup with slightly diffused lights would help.', '2004-05-28 21:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(741247, 78281, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the color and the clarity. One of my favorites!</td>', 'Wow! I love the color and the clarity. One of my favorites!', '2004-05-28 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(741248, 78408, 15920, '<td valign="top">I thought this was one of the coolest compositions in the challenge.  It was also one of the few times that I liked a photo that had hightlights that clipped, but I did.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I thought this was one of the coolest compositions in the challenge.  It was also one of the few times that I liked a photo that had hightlights that clipped, but I did.  Nice shot.', '2004-05-28 21:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(741252, 79156, 10339, '<td valign="top">Looks like the backdrop is in focus while the main subject is not.</td>', 'Looks like the backdrop is in focus while the main subject is not.', '2004-05-28 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(741266, 79239, 17033, '<td valign="top">very clever to spot the parasol shapes but distracts from the challenge itself as they are not the real subject which, to me, is the roof. As for that, the building to the left and the lights and restaurant below take away from the geometry of the roof. how about repositioning your vantage point next time? and the monks will still be there for the right challenge!</td>', 'very clever to spot the parasol shapes but distracts from the challenge itself as they are not the real subject which, to me, is the roof. As for that, the building to the left and the lights and restaurant below take away from the geometry of the roof. how about repositioning your vantage point next time? and the monks will still be there for the right challenge!', '2004-05-28 22:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(741282, 79177, 21429, '<td valign="top">This photo just doesn''t do anything for me.  Except for some of the colors there is nothing that the photo should be saying.</td>', 'This photo just doesn''t do anything for me.  Except for some of the colors there is nothing that the photo should be saying.', '2004-05-28 22:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(741284, 78251, 21429, '<td valign="top">This photo gives a feel of a fair at night...the bright lights,  junk food, screams of the riders...<br/></td>', 'This photo gives a feel of a fair at night...the bright lights,  junk food, screams of the riders...', '2004-05-28 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(741288, 79180, 21429, '<td valign="top">I like the look of quiet expectation in this photo.</td>', 'I like the look of quiet expectation in this photo.', '2004-05-28 23:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(741303, 78281, 17233, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot. Perfect DOF and lighting. Great composition. Well done (10). How did you achieve the blue glow?</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot. Perfect DOF and lighting. Great composition. Well done (10). How did you achieve the blue glow?', '2004-05-28 23:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(741304, 78464, 17233, '<td valign="top">Magnificent shot. Perfect DOF, lighting and composition. You didn''t lose any detail in the highlights either which is difficult under the circumstances you have here - well done (10)</td>', 'Magnificent shot. Perfect DOF, lighting and composition. You didn''t lose any detail in the highlights either which is difficult under the circumstances you have here - well done (10)', '2004-05-28 23:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(741307, 79262, 17233, '<td valign="top">I love the simple composition here and the colours are magnificent. Your DOF is spot on and the lighting perfect. Well done (10)</td>', 'I love the simple composition here and the colours are magnificent. Your DOF is spot on and the lighting perfect. Well done (10)', '2004-05-28 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(741310, 79187, 17233, '<td valign="top">I love your composition here - simple and uncluttered. The lighting is warm and very well directed giving good contrast throughout the shot. Very well done (10)</td>', 'I love your composition here - simple and uncluttered. The lighting is warm and very well directed giving good contrast throughout the shot. Very well done (10)', '2004-05-28 23:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(741312, 78090, 17233, '<td valign="top">I love the over exposed background here - it''s hard to get away with this but you have done it well. Great lighting on the guitar exposing just enough detail. Well done (10)</td>', 'I love the over exposed background here - it''s hard to get away with this but you have done it well. Great lighting on the guitar exposing just enough detail. Well done (10)', '2004-05-28 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(741314, 78264, 17233, '<td valign="top">Nice graduated background lighting and the subject is well lit without being overpowering (10)</td>', 'Nice graduated background lighting and the subject is well lit without being overpowering (10)', '2004-05-28 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(741320, 79176, 17233, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that there is so much noise in this shot. Less noise and a little more contrast would have made this a very interesting shot.</td>', 'It''s a pity that there is so much noise in this shot. Less noise and a little more contrast would have made this a very interesting shot.', '2004-05-28 23:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(741322, 78512, 17233, '<td valign="top">Great concept and a very interesting image. Terrific use of the lighting with good contrast and great shadow effects. (8)</td>', 'Great concept and a very interesting image. Terrific use of the lighting with good contrast and great shadow effects. (8)', '2004-05-28 23:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
