(741363, 77985, 20395, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very nice, and he has a great expression. From a costumer''s stand point, he''d look more evil without the white undershirt, and either dark blue or black, but not both, maybe red instead of the blue?</td>', 'The lighting is very nice, and he has a great expression. From a costumer''s stand point, he''d look more evil without the white undershirt, and either dark blue or black, but not both, maybe red instead of the blue?', '2004-05-29 01:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
