(741368, 79195, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting effect, but I''m not sure I like the rotation. I turned my laptop on it''s side, and it seemed to me to be better verticle. it''s got a weird 1950''s pre-fab starry sky thing going on.</td>', 'I like the lighting effect, but I''m not sure I like the rotation. I turned my laptop on it''s side, and it seemed to me to be better verticle. it''s got a weird 1950''s pre-fab starry sky thing going on.', '2004-05-29 01:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(741370, 79143, 20395, '<td valign="top">You usually see pics like this on busy city streets- it''s an interesting juxtaposition.</td>', 'You usually see pics like this on busy city streets- it''s an interesting juxtaposition.', '2004-05-29 01:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(741371, 79215, 21245, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  I wish I had something more interesting to say about it.</td>', 'I love this picture.  I wish I had something more interesting to say about it.', '2004-05-29 01:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(741374, 78110, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s got some strange color splotches going on, most noticably on the face of the watch. This is one that may have benefitted from Neat Image. Otherwise, it''s got a nice composition and I like the choice of colors.</td>', 'It''s got some strange color splotches going on, most noticably on the face of the watch. This is one that may have benefitted from Neat Image. Otherwise, it''s got a nice composition and I like the choice of colors.', '2004-05-29 01:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(741375, 79213, 21245, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of the light the dentist puts over me.  And the little green man is what I see once the laughing gas starts flowing :D</td>', 'This makes me think of the light the dentist puts over me.  And the little green man is what I see once the laughing gas starts flowing :D', '2004-05-29 01:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
