(741452, 79264, 19708, '<td valign="top">I only see one source and many reflections....<br/>Correction:<br/>I missed the fact there is a light facing upwards &amp; one facing down.<br/>A little pixelized, but good.</td>', 'I only see one source and many reflections....Correction:I missed the fact there is a light facing upwards & one facing down.A little pixelized, but good.', '2004-05-29 03:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(741464, 78932, 17148, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this was a snapshot or what, but this sorta has the horror movie creepiness to it...very good, if that was what you were going for you should have thought of a better title...well you should have thought of a better titled anyways. Like the pic though</td>', 'I don''t know if this was a snapshot or what, but this sorta has the horror movie creepiness to it...very good, if that was what you were going for you should have thought of a better title...well you should have thought of a better titled anyways. Like the pic though', '2004-05-29 03:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(741467, 78533, 17148, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot but I don''t see but one light source...but I''m going to give a 5 anyways cause the shot looks good</td>', 'beautiful shot but I don''t see but one light source...but I''m going to give a 5 anyways cause the shot looks good', '2004-05-29 03:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(741487, 78330, 20395, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea! Maybe it would have been easier to see the pinwheel if you''d left in the dial in focus?</td>', 'Interesting idea! Maybe it would have been easier to see the pinwheel if you''d left in the dial in focus?', '2004-05-29 04:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(741488, 79018, 20395, '<td valign="top">The color in this looks a little funny to me- the grass is almost yellow.</td>', 'The color in this looks a little funny to me- the grass is almost yellow.', '2004-05-29 04:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(741496, 78222, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a very emotional image - well exposed, well composed, taken under flat lighting conditions.</td>', 'You have a very emotional image - well exposed, well composed, taken under flat lighting conditions.', '2004-05-29 05:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(741500, 78932, 19608, '<td valign="top">The fog gives the image some interest but:<br/>a) the top 40% of the frame adds no value at all.<br/>b) Even with the top cropped out, there;s not much to hold my attention.<br/> <br/>The "printing" does have great whites and deep blacks - a good thing for B&amp;W images.</td>', 'The fog gives the image some interest but:a) the top 40% of the frame adds no value at all.b) Even with the top cropped out, there;s not much to hold my attention. The "printing" does have great whites and deep blacks - a good thing for B&W images.', '2004-05-29 05:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(741537, 78742, 17033, '<td valign="top">great shot except for the rather ugly and offset doors...maybe someone should have been walking in/out??</td>', 'great shot except for the rather ugly and offset doors...maybe someone should have been walking in/out??', '2004-05-29 06:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(741542, 78730, 16004, '<td valign="top">This looks like a nice old house; and choosing the location for your submission is a good idea...  the light in the foreground is somehow looking not right.  did you use a flash, or was it some other source?  if it was the result of a flash - might i suggest you rest your camera on a solid surface and use a long exposure and the timer?  also post editting it could do with a drop in brightness or an increase in contrast for the dark areas aren''t really dark or bold enough - a bit to greyey if you will.  it''s a good idea for the shot that does meet the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a nice old house; and choosing the location for your submission is a good idea...  the light in the foreground is somehow looking not right.  did you use a flash, or was it some other source?  if it was the result of a flash - might i suggest you rest your camera on a solid surface and use a long exposure and the timer?  also post editting it could do with a drop in brightness or an increase in contrast for the dark areas aren''t really dark or bold enough - a bit to greyey if you will.  it''s a good idea for the shot that does meet the challenge.', '2004-05-29 07:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(741543, 79099, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit on the small side, which unfortunately detracts a little from what is a really attractive shot.  however, by moving my head closer to the screen, it looks bigger and one can appreciate it more.  really, small sizing does detract from the image, and getting close to you 640 pixels max is important.  however, the sky, the lights and the reflections are all beautiful and well captured.  it might be my head (i''m a bit hungover) but it looks a smidgeon on the wonky side to me.  overall, gorgeous colours, fits the challenge, a bit out of focus (slightly hampered by the size) but very nice.  5.</td>', 'it''s a bit on the small side, which unfortunately detracts a little from what is a really attractive shot.  however, by moving my head closer to the screen, it looks bigger and one can appreciate it more.  really, small sizing does detract from the image, and getting close to you 640 pixels max is important.  however, the sky, the lights and the reflections are all beautiful and well captured.  it might be my head (i''m a bit hungover) but it looks a smidgeon on the wonky side to me.  overall, gorgeous colours, fits the challenge, a bit out of focus (slightly hampered by the size) but very nice.  5.', '2004-05-29 07:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(741551, 79313, 20685, '<td valign="top">gotta be the most stoopid pic this week, well done!</td>', 'gotta be the most stoopid pic this week, well done!', '2004-05-29 07:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
