(741555, 79239, 20685, '<td valign="top">VERY good idea, ashame perspective is a bit off-putting for me. I would have also cropped the bulding on left off which kills a possible spiritual mood. Still very clever.</td>', 'VERY good idea, ashame perspective is a bit off-putting for me. I would have also cropped the bulding on left off which kills a possible spiritual mood. Still very clever.', '2004-05-29 07:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
