(741698, 79018, 15029, '<td valign="top">a little too yellow</td>', 'a little too yellow', '2004-05-29 11:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(741705, 78520, 22360, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, because it is my favorite duck. Also you took a good picture.</td>', 'I like this picture, because it is my favorite duck. Also you took a good picture.', '2004-05-29 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(741706, 79232, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the lighting is great and it definately meets the challenge.  The only thing I think distracts me is the white line that looks as if it''s coming from her mouth.</td>', 'I really like this, the lighting is great and it definately meets the challenge.  The only thing I think distracts me is the white line that looks as if it''s coming from her mouth.', '2004-05-29 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(741741, 79011, 20210, '<td valign="top">very low-noise for such a long shutter-speed.  nice contrast in opacity between the two ''you''s</td>', 'very low-noise for such a long shutter-speed.  nice contrast in opacity between the two ''you''s', '2004-05-29 13:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(741742, 79319, 21853, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2004-05-29 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(741745, 78836, 21853, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-05-29 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(741746, 79085, 20210, '<td valign="top">rather contrived, but a good technical shot.</td>', 'rather contrived, but a good technical shot.', '2004-05-29 13:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(741747, 79161, 20210, '<td valign="top">very eerie...I have no idea what I''m looking at, but I like it! :)</td>', 'very eerie...I have no idea what I''m looking at, but I like it! :)', '2004-05-29 13:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(741764, 79180, 19248, '<td valign="top">The blurred background draws attention from the subject.</td>', 'The blurred background draws attention from the subject.', '2004-05-29 14:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(741797, 79317, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb use of color  to make your image really sing.  Technically, the exposure and DoF are right on, although I''d like the thumb on the left a bit sharper.  Compositionally, there''s something about the placement of the hand(s) that doesn''t quite work.  That is, if it''s supposed to be a peace sign - as the title suggests, it is very subtle.  Having said all that - I expect you will be in ribbonland or darn close to it.</td>', 'Superb use of color  to make your image really sing.  Technically, the exposure and DoF are right on, although I''d like the thumb on the left a bit sharper.  Compositionally, there''s something about the placement of the hand(s) that doesn''t quite work.  That is, if it''s supposed to be a peace sign - as the title suggests, it is very subtle.  Having said all that - I expect you will be in ribbonland or darn close to it.', '2004-05-29 14:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(741800, 78435, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very graphic image with plenty of appeal.  From a lighting point of view - I''d like just a hint of light on the left and right so that the side edges of the glass didn''t totally merge with the background.  That''s so minor - it''s still one of my top pics.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'A very graphic image with plenty of appeal.  From a lighting point of view - I''d like just a hint of light on the left and right so that the side edges of the glass didn''t totally merge with the background.  That''s so minor - it''s still one of my top pics.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-05-29 15:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(741801, 79041, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I really like the colors, composition, and focus in this. The many reflections in the glass bulb make the image more interesting. The main subject itself isn''t interesting enough for me to give it a 10, but I like the whole enough to give it a 9. Good job!</td>', 'Great photo! I really like the colors, composition, and focus in this. The many reflections in the glass bulb make the image more interesting. The main subject itself isn''t interesting enough for me to give it a 10, but I like the whole enough to give it a 9. Good job!', '2004-05-29 15:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(741808, 79261, 17166, '<td valign="top">nice basic setup, although might want to think about moving middle candle/lamp (can''t tell since it''s so bright) a bit more off center.  The whole picture is very noisy, fuzzy, and overcompressed.</td>', 'nice basic setup, although might want to think about moving middle candle/lamp (can''t tell since it''s so bright) a bit more off center.  The whole picture is very noisy, fuzzy, and overcompressed.', '2004-05-29 15:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(741809, 79143, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice subhect.  Maybe could crop a bit tighter to have the taillights sweep across more of the frame.</td>', 'Nice subhect.  Maybe could crop a bit tighter to have the taillights sweep across more of the frame.', '2004-05-29 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(741811, 79294, 17166, '<td valign="top">Very cool and creative effect.</td>', 'Very cool and creative effect.', '2004-05-29 15:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(741815, 79296, 17166, '<td valign="top">Would make an interesting example photo for a color theory tutorial.  Think this would work better with the edge of the table in the lower left cropped out.</td>', 'Would make an interesting example photo for a color theory tutorial.  Think this would work better with the edge of the table in the lower left cropped out.', '2004-05-29 15:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(741816, 79156, 17166, '<td valign="top">needs much more sharpness - it''s too soft to be a soft-focus effect and the whole picture is way too overcompressed.</td>', 'needs much more sharpness - it''s too soft to be a soft-focus effect and the whole picture is way too overcompressed.', '2004-05-29 15:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(741818, 78426, 17166, '<td valign="top">I personally, like the tilt in this photo - it adds drama.</td>', 'I personally, like the tilt in this photo - it adds drama.', '2004-05-29 15:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(741821, 78882, 17166, '<td valign="top">I think the lighter needs to be much sharper.</td>', 'I think the lighter needs to be much sharper.', '2004-05-29 15:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(741823, 79285, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit.  One suggestion - the lone blue computer screen in the middle is a nice capture and adds a point of interest.  I think the picutre would be more dynamic if it were positioned off center.</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit.  One suggestion - the lone blue computer screen in the middle is a nice capture and adds a point of interest.  I think the picutre would be more dynamic if it were positioned off center.', '2004-05-29 15:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(741825, 78069, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice 60s hollywood feel - compliments the subject well.  Wish there was more negative space at the bottom</td>', 'Nice 60s hollywood feel - compliments the subject well.  Wish there was more negative space at the bottom', '2004-05-29 15:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(741826, 79131, 17166, '<td valign="top">Great painting with light entry.  Very creative.</td>', 'Great painting with light entry.  Very creative.', '2004-05-29 15:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(741827, 78069, 21253, '<td valign="top">I really like that how the green takes over the whole building but there is still a definite boundary with the sky</td>', 'I really like that how the green takes over the whole building but there is still a definite boundary with the sky', '2004-05-29 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(741829, 78275, 21253, '<td valign="top">Nice, very clean image.</td>', 'Nice, very clean image.', '2004-05-29 15:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(741832, 78277, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and interesting.</td>', 'Very pretty and interesting.', '2004-05-29 16:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(741833, 79007, 10867, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and imaginative use of lights!</td>', 'Excellent composition and imaginative use of lights!', '2004-05-29 16:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(741835, 79319, 10867, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this shot.  My one nit is the green at the top right.  It occupies to small a part of the frame to contribute significantly to the image and, because of its position and difference from the colour close to it, it tends to draw the eye and act as a distraction.  Otherwise, this is a very good image.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this shot.  My one nit is the green at the top right.  It occupies to small a part of the frame to contribute significantly to the image and, because of its position and difference from the colour close to it, it tends to draw the eye and act as a distraction.  Otherwise, this is a very good image.', '2004-05-29 16:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(741836, 78659, 10867, '<td valign="top">VEry clever and nicely shot.</td>', 'VEry clever and nicely shot.', '2004-05-29 16:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
