(742118, 77987, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is so close to very, very good.  A tripod would make this a real winner as it needs to be tack sharp.  Good try!</td>', 'Oh, this is so close to very, very good.  A tripod would make this a real winner as it needs to be tack sharp.  Good try!', '2004-05-29 22:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(742156, 79307, 472, '<td valign="top">very awesome picture</td>', 'very awesome picture', '2004-05-29 23:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(742327, 79215, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish I had not seen this so early in the voting as the others seem rather palid and irrelevant in comparison. The massing is well balanced and the color palate is masterfull. I can''t belive anything will be better done in this challenge. From the lightness of touch I belive you are shooing in the south of France no? I am searching for something to criticize, and I have decided that your border must be the most faulty peice of the shot, not that it is too bad but you left so little else to argue with.</td>', 'I wish I had not seen this so early in the voting as the others seem rather palid and irrelevant in comparison. The massing is well balanced and the color palate is masterfull. I can''t belive anything will be better done in this challenge. From the lightness of touch I belive you are shooing in the south of France no? I am searching for something to criticize, and I have decided that your border must be the most faulty peice of the shot, not that it is too bad but you left so little else to argue with.', '2004-05-30 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
