(742433, 79240, 19841, '<td valign="top">Well spotted!  Perfectly exposed, and nicely focused.  9</td>', 'Well spotted!  Perfectly exposed, and nicely focused.  9', '2004-05-30 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(742450, 77996, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Nicely framed. Excellent levels. Good color. The title works well with the image. There''s one little hot spot on the right I might have cloned out, but the rules don''t allow it. Otherwise nearly perfect. (10)</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Nicely framed. Excellent levels. Good color. The title works well with the image. There''s one little hot spot on the right I might have cloned out, but the rules don''t allow it. Otherwise nearly perfect. (10)', '2004-05-30 12:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(742451, 79089, 18197, '<td valign="top">Spectacular photo. Congratulations!</td>', 'Spectacular photo. Congratulations!', '2004-05-30 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(742452, 78339, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the theme. I like the comp, levels, color and contrast. The ball has a subtle texture I like. It may be a bit too abstract for some people''s taste but I really like it. (10)</td>', 'Nice capture of the theme. I like the comp, levels, color and contrast. The ball has a subtle texture I like. It may be a bit too abstract for some people''s taste but I really like it. (10)', '2004-05-30 12:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(742456, 79279, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!<br/> <br/>I like the complexity of the subject, and the way it impacts color and shadow. Very nice levels and contrast. The parts along the top and top right distract a bit but I honestly can''t find a way to crop to avoid it. Good luck. (9)</td>', 'Beautiful! I like the complexity of the subject, and the way it impacts color and shadow. Very nice levels and contrast. The parts along the top and top right distract a bit but I honestly can''t find a way to crop to avoid it. Good luck. (9)', '2004-05-30 12:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(742459, 77847, 18197, '<td valign="top">Possibly the best of show, congratulations!<br/> <br/>The strongest aspect of this picture is the story it tells. The comp is superb. Foreground/background is stunning. You could have rendered in black &amp; white but the colors drag the eye to just the right places. I''m glad you didn''t. (10)</td>', 'Possibly the best of show, congratulations! The strongest aspect of this picture is the story it tells. The comp is superb. Foreground/background is stunning. You could have rendered in black & white but the colors drag the eye to just the right places. I''m glad you didn''t. (10)', '2004-05-30 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(742460, 78408, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simple but elegant rendering of the theme. Hope it does well in the voting. Good comp, levels, color and contrast. Bright spot on the egg is a bit hot. Don''t know if you could have improved with just basic editing, thogh. (9)</td>', 'Simple but elegant rendering of the theme. Hope it does well in the voting. Good comp, levels, color and contrast. Bright spot on the egg is a bit hot. Don''t know if you could have improved with just basic editing, thogh. (9)', '2004-05-30 12:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(742461, 79311, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this image but to be honest, I can''t really tell you why. I guess it''s that it all works together. The complexity of the shadows is intriguing. "Is it a picture of the paper, or of the shadows?" is what I keep thinking about. Congratulations on a fine image. Hope it does well in the voting. (9)</td>', 'I like this image but to be honest, I can''t really tell you why. I guess it''s that it all works together. The complexity of the shadows is intriguing. "Is it a picture of the paper, or of the shadows?" is what I keep thinking about. Congratulations on a fine image. Hope it does well in the voting. (9)', '2004-05-30 12:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(742463, 79281, 18197, '<td valign="top">We see quite a few "concert images" here and to be honest, I am generally not a fan of them. Generally find it hard to give them more than a 5.<br/> <br/>A concert image is very hard to get right. Lighting is often low (or totally blown out). Usually there''s a lot of movement. And to be frank, you often can''t control where the photo is taken (unless you have better luck choosing your seats than I do.)<br/> <br/>So the thing is ... you have attempted a photo with a very high degree of difficulty ... and pulled it off brilliantly. I like almost everything about it (comp, color, levels, contrast if not so much the subject) and it nicely renders the theme. Congratulations! Hope it does well in the voting. (9)</td>', 'We see quite a few "concert images" here and to be honest, I am generally not a fan of them. Generally find it hard to give them more than a 5. A concert image is very hard to get right. Lighting is often low (or totally blown out). Usually there''s a lot of movement. And to be frank, you often can''t control where the photo is taken (unless you have better luck choosing your seats than I do.) So the thing is ... you have attempted a photo with a very high degree of difficulty ... and pulled it off brilliantly. I like almost everything about it (comp, color, levels, contrast if not so much the subject) and it nicely renders the theme. Congratulations! Hope it does well in the voting. (9)', '2004-05-30 12:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(742466, 77789, 18197, '<td valign="top">Multiple light sources aren''t obvious. Technically the photo is a good workmanlike capture except the focus seems a bit off. The shed or tent in the background detracts somewhat.<br/> <br/>Keep at it. You have the technical skill. Just apply it to a better subject.</td>', 'Multiple light sources aren''t obvious. Technically the photo is a good workmanlike capture except the focus seems a bit off. The shed or tent in the background detracts somewhat. Keep at it. You have the technical skill. Just apply it to a better subject.', '2004-05-30 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(742467, 79288, 18197, '<td valign="top">To be honest I can''t figure this out. I think I understand what you''re trying to do but the composition hurts the effort. This may be a great idea but just impossibly difficult to capture.</td>', 'To be honest I can''t figure this out. I think I understand what you''re trying to do but the composition hurts the effort. This may be a great idea but just impossibly difficult to capture.', '2004-05-30 12:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(742469, 79213, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Centered subject hurts the overall effect. If you haven''t already, suggest you read the "rule of thirds" material. It will help your composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Centered subject hurts the overall effect. If you haven''t already, suggest you read the "rule of thirds" material. It will help your composition.', '2004-05-30 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(742472, 78222, 18197, '<td valign="top">Multiple light sources aren''t obvious. I like the high contrast but the levels at the dark end are too intense. Composition could be better, possibly if it were landscape rather than portrait. This may suffer a bit from a foreground/background balance issue.</td>', 'Multiple light sources aren''t obvious. I like the high contrast but the levels at the dark end are too intense. Composition could be better, possibly if it were landscape rather than portrait. This may suffer a bit from a foreground/background balance issue.', '2004-05-30 13:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(742474, 79150, 18197, '<td valign="top">Certainly delivers on the multiple light source the theme. But fails to hold my interest. My eye keeps sliding down and to the left to where the 1 is on the voting scale of 1 to 10.</td>', 'Certainly delivers on the multiple light source the theme. But fails to hold my interest. My eye keeps sliding down and to the left to where the 1 is on the voting scale of 1 to 10.', '2004-05-30 13:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(742475, 78742, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clearly meets the challenge but I don''t find anything interesting going on. The centered door (not really the subject of the photo?) draws attention away form the light and shadow. I suppose I could be interested in what''s behind the door, but the photo doesn''t really force me to ask the questioon. <br/> <br/>Sorry, may just be too esoteric for my taste.</td>', 'Clearly meets the challenge but I don''t find anything interesting going on. The centered door (not really the subject of the photo?) draws attention away form the light and shadow. I suppose I could be interested in what''s behind the door, but the photo doesn''t really force me to ask the questioon.  Sorry, may just be too esoteric for my taste.', '2004-05-30 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(742476, 78932, 18197, '<td valign="top">Every car on the planet has two light sources. This would have been better if it had given me a clue about what was unique about your car. Is it the location? Or the dust/fog. Might have been better to take the lights out of the photo and just caught the fog. The multiple light sources would still have been obvious.<br/> <br/>Techniquely, everything is a bit out of focus and the lights are blown out. Balance of dark at the top and light at the botttom feels overweighted.</td>', 'Every car on the planet has two light sources. This would have been better if it had given me a clue about what was unique about your car. Is it the location? Or the dust/fog. Might have been better to take the lights out of the photo and just caught the fog. The multiple light sources would still have been obvious. Techniquely, everything is a bit out of focus and the lights are blown out. Balance of dark at the top and light at the botttom feels overweighted.', '2004-05-30 13:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(742478, 79288, 7322, '<td valign="top">The fly crawling over the eye on the computer monitor is an interesting subject. The largest half of the frame is a bit cluttered by the rest of the monitor which is a bit blurry. It took me a second to figure out what this was. I imagine the monitor was one of your obvious sources of light?</td>', 'The fly crawling over the eye on the computer monitor is an interesting subject. The largest half of the frame is a bit cluttered by the rest of the monitor which is a bit blurry. It took me a second to figure out what this was. I imagine the monitor was one of your obvious sources of light?', '2004-05-30 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(742480, 78836, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks like it has some fine detail.It''s too bad you made it so small as it is really hard to tell. I like the warmth you''ve captured in the light coming from the window but the subject matter doesn''t hold much interest for me. I like the red umbrella against the dark sky. You have some potential there.</td>', 'This looks like it has some fine detail.It''s too bad you made it so small as it is really hard to tell. I like the warmth you''ve captured in the light coming from the window but the subject matter doesn''t hold much interest for me. I like the red umbrella against the dark sky. You have some potential there.', '2004-05-30 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(742481, 78110, 7322, '<td valign="top">The placement of the watch against this background makes for a confusing composition. It''s a rather noisy image and there are quite a few hotspots (the edge of the watch face and the top edge of the frame). The bead thing is rather interesting as an abstract and I encourage you to work on the lighting some more and see what you come up with.</td>', 'The placement of the watch against this background makes for a confusing composition. It''s a rather noisy image and there are quite a few hotspots (the edge of the watch face and the top edge of the frame). The bead thing is rather interesting as an abstract and I encourage you to work on the lighting some more and see what you come up with.', '2004-05-30 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(742482, 77789, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think this is a cute picture of this cat. I love cats and am not one of those folks that says, "Not another cat shot!" I say, "Bring ''em on." This one is a bit cluttered however. I know it is hard to get shots of your pets in a perfect surrounding because they go where they want (especially cats). If you could blur the background a bit with an image editing program that would be very helpful. The basket is also distracting but a blurred background might fix this. The cat has a great, ''cat'' expression.</td>', 'I think this is a cute picture of this cat. I love cats and am not one of those folks that says, "Not another cat shot!" I say, "Bring ''em on." This one is a bit cluttered however. I know it is hard to get shots of your pets in a perfect surrounding because they go where they want (especially cats). If you could blur the background a bit with an image editing program that would be very helpful. The basket is also distracting but a blurred background might fix this. The cat has a great, ''cat'' expression.', '2004-05-30 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(742483, 78366, 7322, '<td valign="top">The light coming through the flavored syrups makes for nice color in this composition. You may want to consider a tripod (you can get a very small one for about $10) next time. The image suffers quite a bit from motion blur.</td>', 'The light coming through the flavored syrups makes for nice color in this composition. You may want to consider a tripod (you can get a very small one for about $10) next time. The image suffers quite a bit from motion blur.', '2004-05-30 13:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(742487, 79156, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice start to a good composition. Consider a differenet background next time (terry cloth isn''t the best choice for a background unless you are going for a bathroom feel ---which perhaps you are?). I''m not sure if you intended to focus on the reflection instead of the candle but I think focusing on both might have been more effective. As it is, the candle is quite blurred but you have lots of texture in the terry cloth. A small tripod might be a good purchase. You can buy a little table top model for lighter weight digital cameras for about $10.</td>', 'This is a nice start to a good composition. Consider a differenet background next time (terry cloth isn''t the best choice for a background unless you are going for a bathroom feel ---which perhaps you are?). I''m not sure if you intended to focus on the reflection instead of the candle but I think focusing on both might have been more effective. As it is, the candle is quite blurred but you have lots of texture in the terry cloth. A small tripod might be a good purchase. You can buy a little table top model for lighter weight digital cameras for about $10.', '2004-05-30 13:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(742490, 77931, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice snap shot of someone busy at work. You''ve gotten the obvious light sources in also. Sadly, the background  and foreground are extremely cluttered. Sometimes this can be to good effect in a shot like this as it shows the person in their environment. In this case it''s just not working to well. Another choice might have been to get in a close as possible to her hands as they work at their task. This can tell a universal story about a craftsperson and elevate the shot from a nice snap shot to beautiful photograph. You might even be able to crop this photo from the original. The light falling on the edge of her fingers and the bit of lace looks quite nice.</td>', 'This is a nice snap shot of someone busy at work. You''ve gotten the obvious light sources in also. Sadly, the background  and foreground are extremely cluttered. Sometimes this can be to good effect in a shot like this as it shows the person in their environment. In this case it''s just not working to well. Another choice might have been to get in a close as possible to her hands as they work at their task. This can tell a universal story about a craftsperson and elevate the shot from a nice snap shot to beautiful photograph. You might even be able to crop this photo from the original. The light falling on the edge of her fingers and the bit of lace looks quite nice.', '2004-05-30 13:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(742491, 78403, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the neutral color combined with the blue light from the windows. The pattern on the ceiling is quiet nice also. I don''t care for this rather haphazard angle,however. The result is there doesn''t seem to be a main focal point and the eye wanders a bit.</td>', 'I like the neutral color combined with the blue light from the windows. The pattern on the ceiling is quiet nice also. I don''t care for this rather haphazard angle,however. The result is there doesn''t seem to be a main focal point and the eye wanders a bit.', '2004-05-30 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(742493, 79177, 7322, '<td valign="top">This was a neat idea. I like the way the pattern of the afghan acts as a filter for the light. I don''t care for this odd cropping however. It is also a bit small. I''d like to see more of the fuzzy texture from the throw. This is worth trying again.</td>', 'This was a neat idea. I like the way the pattern of the afghan acts as a filter for the light. I don''t care for this odd cropping however. It is also a bit small. I''d like to see more of the fuzzy texture from the throw. This is worth trying again.', '2004-05-30 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(742497, 79004, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the lights and the shimmery looking glass. I''m not as nuts about the composition. The chandelier (candleabra ?) seems to be falling out of the lower half of the frame and the curvy moulding against the dark curtain keeps drawing my eye. This looks like a beautiful room, by the way.</td>', 'I like the capture of the lights and the shimmery looking glass. I''m not as nuts about the composition. The chandelier (candleabra ?) seems to be falling out of the lower half of the frame and the curvy moulding against the dark curtain keeps drawing my eye. This looks like a beautiful room, by the way.', '2004-05-30 13:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(742500, 79111, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of all the flickering lights on the chocolate colored background. I don''t much care for this formal arrangement. The wrinkles in the background detract also (I got a lot of the same comment about my own background in a different challenge --- the trick is to iron it first. Fun, huh! LOL!)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the warmth of all the flickering lights on the chocolate colored background. I don''t much care for this formal arrangement. The wrinkles in the background detract also (I got a lot of the same comment about my own background in a different challenge --- the trick is to iron it first. Fun, huh! LOL!) ', '2004-05-30 13:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(742504, 79191, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful room and I like the warmth that is captured with the lighting. It is a little bit too dark in some areas. It could have been cropped to eliminate the flower arrangement and painting on the right edge of the frame. The wine press was rather baffling. I think it is an antique that is in the room but it appears to be just hovering there, rather like a UFO. I can''t place it in this room and that is what really hurt this photo for me.</td>', 'This is a beautiful room and I like the warmth that is captured with the lighting. It is a little bit too dark in some areas. It could have been cropped to eliminate the flower arrangement and painting on the right edge of the frame. The wine press was rather baffling. I think it is an antique that is in the room but it appears to be just hovering there, rather like a UFO. I can''t place it in this room and that is what really hurt this photo for me.', '2004-05-30 13:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(742507, 79318, 7322, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a nice warm mood with the lighting. The composition needs improvement. You might want to consider the classic triangle for an image like this. I don''t mean that literally --- I mean you arrange your subject so that they create the space of a triangle within the frame (you can look at classic portrait and still-life paintings for an illustration of what I mean). <br/>I like that the depth of field for the most part but the foremost candle seems to be falling out of the lower edge of the frame.</td>', 'You''ve captured a nice warm mood with the lighting. The composition needs improvement. You might want to consider the classic triangle for an image like this. I don''t mean that literally --- I mean you arrange your subject so that they create the space of a triangle within the frame (you can look at classic portrait and still-life paintings for an illustration of what I mean). I like that the depth of field for the most part but the foremost candle seems to be falling out of the lower edge of the frame.', '2004-05-30 13:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(742508, 77987, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene and looks like a wonderful place to be.  Consider a tripod for shots like this. It suffers quite a bit from camera shake. I like the composition.</td>', 'This is a nice scene and looks like a wonderful place to be.  Consider a tripod for shots like this. It suffers quite a bit from camera shake. I like the composition.', '2004-05-30 13:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(742510, 79160, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the subject is nice. It suffers a bit from lack of focus.</td>', 'I like the colors and the subject is nice. It suffers a bit from lack of focus.', '2004-05-30 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(742512, 77853, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a cool looking lighter. It has the potential to be a great subject.  I don''t care for this placement in the frame and the background has quite a bit of texture which is distracting. The dark traingle at the lower edge of the frame is very distracting.</td>', 'This is a cool looking lighter. It has the potential to be a great subject.  I don''t care for this placement in the frame and the background has quite a bit of texture which is distracting. The dark traingle at the lower edge of the frame is very distracting.', '2004-05-30 13:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(742515, 79086, 7322, '<td valign="top">These are cool light reflections. Unfortunately, there is just too much going on in the composition for me to enjoy this. The coiled triangle is confusing to me. Is it a source of light or just a framing device for the actual light source in the center? My eye keeps being drawn to the outlet in the lower right conrer. The frame is a bit tilted.</td>', 'These are cool light reflections. Unfortunately, there is just too much going on in the composition for me to enjoy this. The coiled triangle is confusing to me. Is it a source of light or just a framing device for the actual light source in the center? My eye keeps being drawn to the outlet in the lower right conrer. The frame is a bit tilted.', '2004-05-30 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(742518, 78412, 7322, '<td valign="top">This really suffers from being just too small. I can''t see any of the detail. The clouds overhead are intriguing. The tree on the right and the lamp post on the left could have been cropped to tighten the composition.</td>', 'This really suffers from being just too small. I can''t see any of the detail. The clouds overhead are intriguing. The tree on the right and the lamp post on the left could have been cropped to tighten the composition.', '2004-05-30 13:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(742522, 79034, 16982, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2004-05-30 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(742524, 78533, 16982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this fits the challenge as well as most...but it is a fine photograph.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this fits the challenge as well as most...but it is a fine photograph.', '2004-05-30 13:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(742525, 79154, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the centered composition works for this shot. The foliage and other blossoms have the effect of leading the eye away from the central flower. The lighting is very flat for the subject. The result is rather drab color with very little texture. Consider placing a single blossom off-center and taking the shot at a time of day where it will be lit from behind, capturing the beautiful translucent petals. If you can manage a blurred background with your camera that is also quite helpful.</td>', 'I don''t think the centered composition works for this shot. The foliage and other blossoms have the effect of leading the eye away from the central flower. The lighting is very flat for the subject. The result is rather drab color with very little texture. Consider placing a single blossom off-center and taking the shot at a time of day where it will be lit from behind, capturing the beautiful translucent petals. If you can manage a blurred background with your camera that is also quite helpful.', '2004-05-30 13:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(742526, 79262, 16982, '<td valign="top">Wow, spectacular shot.  (How did you do that?  etc. etc.)</td>', 'Wow, spectacular shot.  (How did you do that?  etc. etc.)', '2004-05-30 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(742528, 78882, 7322, '<td valign="top">This subject has great potential for a still-life. This cropping is rather claustrophobic. The lighting is a bit cold and blue for this subject. The background appears to be a rug which places the subject out of it''s enviroment.</td>', 'This subject has great potential for a still-life. This cropping is rather claustrophobic. The lighting is a bit cold and blue for this subject. The background appears to be a rug which places the subject out of it''s enviroment.', '2004-05-30 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(742533, 79184, 7322, '<td valign="top">This has the potential as great subject matter. Unfortunately, this composition is hurt by the light switch (we really don''t want to see something as mundane as a modern light switch in a dramatic compostion such as this) and the dark areas to either side of the frame. Try this again but instead, don''t try to get the whole piano in the shot. Move in closer to the lovely scroll work of the music stand and the old fashioned name plate over the keyboards. Just rotating your camera and making this a vertical shot would have eliminated all the distractions I mentioned.</td>', 'This has the potential as great subject matter. Unfortunately, this composition is hurt by the light switch (we really don''t want to see something as mundane as a modern light switch in a dramatic compostion such as this) and the dark areas to either side of the frame. Try this again but instead, don''t try to get the whole piano in the shot. Move in closer to the lovely scroll work of the music stand and the old fashioned name plate over the keyboards. Just rotating your camera and making this a vertical shot would have eliminated all the distractions I mentioned.', '2004-05-30 14:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(742539, 79195, 16982, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would have liked this shot more if the whole left section had been blacked out or removed from the shot.</td>', 'Personally, I would have liked this shot more if the whole left section had been blacked out or removed from the shot.', '2004-05-30 14:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(742548, 78997, 8005, '<td valign="top">Too orange.4</td>', 'Too orange.4', '2004-05-30 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(742554, 78046, 8005, '<td valign="top">Very Cool. I am giving you a 10. I really like the reflected light.</td>', 'Very Cool. I am giving you a 10. I really like the reflected light.', '2004-05-30 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(742593, 79216, 22378, '<td valign="top">Cool viewpoint</td>', 'Cool viewpoint', '2004-05-30 15:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(742616, 78533, 6999, '<td valign="top">I personally feel that this is outside the challenge stipulations - but it''s such a nebulous and debateable area (clouds, reflections) that I guess I''ll let you off. Some technical problems around the sun, over-saturation etc., which could probably have been sorted out (were you given the advanced editing rules) and I''m not convinced about this framing. 7</td>', 'I personally feel that this is outside the challenge stipulations - but it''s such a nebulous and debateable area (clouds, reflections) that I guess I''ll let you off. Some technical problems around the sun, over-saturation etc., which could probably have been sorted out (were you given the advanced editing rules) and I''m not convinced about this framing. 7', '2004-05-30 15:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(742620, 78403, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find the angling of this shot odd - neither one thing or another: not extreme enough for impact, too much for accident. Can''t see what it gains from excluding part of some of the hanging fittings. Has a level of interest in tonal difference, and some play of light on that ceiling ... I just get a strong feeling that it would have made a happier composition were it straightened and were those fittings fully included: it has the distinct impression that this was the only way you could exclude some major distraction from frame.</td>', 'I find the angling of this shot odd - neither one thing or another: not extreme enough for impact, too much for accident. Can''t see what it gains from excluding part of some of the hanging fittings. Has a level of interest in tonal difference, and some play of light on that ceiling ... I just get a strong feeling that it would have made a happier composition were it straightened and were those fittings fully included: it has the distinct impression that this was the only way you could exclude some major distraction from frame.', '2004-05-30 15:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(742639, 79219, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle lighting to bring out great color against the dark background.  It may work better composed vertically.</td>', 'Nice subtle lighting to bring out great color against the dark background.  It may work better composed vertically.', '2004-05-30 16:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(742641, 79231, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lighting is well done and "obvious" use of multiple sources. Colors really work well.  Not sure the bubbles actually add anything - it may have done well with just a plain clear liquid - perhaps with a hint of food coloring.  Straw adds a good graphice.  Overall - a very strong entry that should do quite well.</td>', 'Lighting is well done and "obvious" use of multiple sources. Colors really work well.  Not sure the bubbles actually add anything - it may have done well with just a plain clear liquid - perhaps with a hint of food coloring.  Straw adds a good graphice.  Overall - a very strong entry that should do quite well.', '2004-05-30 16:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(742643, 77936, 19608, '<td valign="top">Aha - great rip-off of the original!  Very nice exposure, exceptional composition,  perfect focus.  For the final "W"W" - try it again with a love poem or other more appropriate text on the page.</td>', 'Aha - great rip-off of the original!  Very nice exposure, exceptional composition,  perfect focus.  For the final "W"W" - try it again with a love poem or other more appropriate text on the page.', '2004-05-30 16:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(742644, 77781, 10644, '<td valign="top">the black and white is very nice<br/></td>', 'the black and white is very nice', '2004-05-30 16:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(742645, 79294, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well thought out and executed.  Stand by for a ribbon - or darn close!</td>', 'Exceptionally well thought out and executed.  Stand by for a ribbon - or darn close!', '2004-05-30 16:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
