(742664, 78080, 19608, '<td valign="top">This will make an excellent print!  You''ve taken an excellent flower and turned it into a piece of art.  Just enough green to add nice contrast with the white and red.</td>', 'This will make an excellent print!  You''ve taken an excellent flower and turned it into a piece of art.  Just enough green to add nice contrast with the white and red.', '2004-05-30 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
