(742672, 78494, 10644, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity and composition</td>', 'wonderful clarity and composition', '2004-05-30 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(742673, 78512, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great setup.  Your placement so that the eggs'' shadows form triangles is superb.  While I like this shot a LOT, did you try the same thing without the source lights (just the eggs?)  That may be even stronger.  Having said that - it''s still one of my choices for top 10.</td>', 'Great setup.  Your placement so that the eggs'' shadows form triangles is superb.  While I like this shot a LOT, did you try the same thing without the source lights (just the eggs?)  That may be even stronger.  Having said that - it''s still one of my choices for top 10.', '2004-05-30 16:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(742674, 79089, 10644, '<td valign="top">very creative<br/>adorable shot<br/></td>', 'very creativeadorable shot', '2004-05-30 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(742675, 79219, 10644, '<td valign="top">beautiful macro</td>', 'beautiful macro', '2004-05-30 16:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(742676, 79262, 10644, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2004-05-30 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(742677, 78352, 19608, '<td valign="top">Clever - great colors and action.  A couple minor points:  The sign with text is a bit distrating as is the border.</td>', 'Clever - great colors and action.  A couple minor points:  The sign with text is a bit distrating as is the border.', '2004-05-30 16:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(742678, 78618, 10644, '<td valign="top">looks a bit over exposed on the bee<br/>like the dof</td>', 'looks a bit over exposed on the beelike the dof', '2004-05-30 16:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(742681, 79161, 19608, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract - good use of shadows.  Not a lot of interest pops out.</td>', 'An interesting abstract - good use of shadows.  Not a lot of interest pops out.', '2004-05-30 16:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(742684, 79158, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and well composed.  The black border seems a bit on the heavy side.  I like the shodow on the top left side.</td>', 'Very graphic and well composed.  The black border seems a bit on the heavy side.  I like the shodow on the top left side.', '2004-05-30 16:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(742685, 79000, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting - just at the right time of day.</td>', 'Perfect lighting - just at the right time of day.', '2004-05-30 16:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(742689, 78946, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in a good composition. Could be a bit larger.</td>', 'Nice colors in a good composition. Could be a bit larger.', '2004-05-30 16:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(742714, 78090, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hehe - nice play on words.   Nice instrument in good lighting.  May work a bit better in a diagonal composition.</td>', 'Hehe - nice play on words.   Nice instrument in good lighting.  May work a bit better in a diagonal composition.', '2004-05-30 17:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(742716, 78672, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice macro - with DoF about tthe right place, but it is a bit troublesome that the closest area, bottom right, is not sharp.  I thionk you could crop out the bottom without huting the image.  NIce colors - effective lightinmg.</td>', 'Nice macro - with DoF about tthe right place, but it is a bit troublesome that the closest area, bottom right, is not sharp.  I thionk you could crop out the bottom without huting the image.  NIce colors - effective lightinmg.', '2004-05-30 17:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(742717, 77883, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very subtle image and lighting. Nice composition and exposure.</td>', 'Very subtle image and lighting. Nice composition and exposure.', '2004-05-30 17:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(742718, 79316, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and artistic!    Did you take this for "unusual viewpoint?"  Hope you do well - it''s an excellent example of how something out of the ordinary can be shot.</td>', 'Very interesting and artistic!    Did you take this for "unusual viewpoint?"  Hope you do well - it''s an excellent example of how something out of the ordinary can be shot.', '2004-05-30 17:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(742719, 79037, 19608, '<td valign="top">Straight forward yet effective.  NIce DoF even with the low lighting.</td>', 'Straight forward yet effective.  NIce DoF even with the low lighting.', '2004-05-30 17:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(742721, 79293, 19608, '<td valign="top">A good idea executed very well.  Nice choice of colors - it looks "watermelony."  A couple dirts spots detract.</td>', 'A good idea executed very well.  Nice choice of colors - it looks "watermelony."  A couple dirts spots detract.', '2004-05-30 17:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(742722, 79282, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and silhouette.  Palm fronds in foregroud add interest.</td>', 'Nice colors and silhouette.  Palm fronds in foregroud add interest.', '2004-05-30 17:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(742723, 78823, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very strong graphically.  This image is very well composed and exposed.</td>', 'Very strong graphically.  This image is very well composed and exposed.', '2004-05-30 17:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(742725, 78269, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing image, gorgeous colors - it will make a nice print.  I''m not sure if everything should be dead center - think it would be stronger with about half of the sky and about half of the distance to the sun on the left cropped off.  The resulting image would place the sun on the golen point top left.  Even as is, it''s a very strong entry - thanks for sharing.</td>', 'A very pleasing image, gorgeous colors - it will make a nice print.  I''m not sure if everything should be dead center - think it would be stronger with about half of the sky and about half of the distance to the sun on the left cropped off.  The resulting image would place the sun on the golen point top left.  Even as is, it''s a very strong entry - thanks for sharing.', '2004-05-30 17:25:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(742735, 79173, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great repeating shapes - makes a compelling image.</td>', 'Great repeating shapes - makes a compelling image.', '2004-05-30 17:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(742736, 79007, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very interesting arrangement.  Nice colors and textures.  Make it even better by: a) Toning down the white pyramid at the bottom right, and 2 apply some curren to the filament and make it barely glow an orangy color.  Overall - it''s an excellent submission as is.</td>', 'A very interesting arrangement.  Nice colors and textures.  Make it even better by: a) Toning down the white pyramid at the bottom right, and 2 apply some curren to the filament and make it barely glow an orangy color.  Overall - it''s an excellent submission as is.', '2004-05-30 17:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(742737, 78504, 19608, '<td valign="top">Clever setup and execution.</td>', 'Clever setup and execution.', '2004-05-30 17:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(742739, 79306, 19608, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and a bit eerie.  Great colors - the light coming in from the left that illuminates the green grass is critical to your image and is perfect.  Your placement of the distant light halfway behind the tree is also right on.  A strong image I like more and more as I see it.</td>', 'Mysterious and a bit eerie.  Great colors - the light coming in from the left that illuminates the green grass is critical to your image and is perfect.  Your placement of the distant light halfway behind the tree is also right on.  A strong image I like more and more as I see it.', '2004-05-30 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(742743, 79180, 19608, '<td valign="top">A good portrait - very nice lighting on the face.  Perfect exposure and focus on the face as well.  The major trouble I have is that rotten bright sky, it needs to go.</td>', 'A good portrait - very nice lighting on the face.  Perfect exposure and focus on the face as well.  The major trouble I have is that rotten bright sky, it needs to go.', '2004-05-30 18:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(742745, 77949, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice seeing, the fading sky goes with the lights on the building very effectively.</td>', 'Nice seeing, the fading sky goes with the lights on the building very effectively.', '2004-05-30 18:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(742747, 78309, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  I think the edges of the frame are slightly overexposed, and that''s a little distracting, but I like this photo a lot.  9.</td>', 'This is really cool.  I think the edges of the frame are slightly overexposed, and that''s a little distracting, but I like this photo a lot.  9.', '2004-05-30 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(742748, 79020, 10268, '<td valign="top">Ah, I want a traffic sign!  That''s awesome.</td>', 'Ah, I want a traffic sign!  That''s awesome.', '2004-05-30 18:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(742749, 79180, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about multiple light sources, but I really like the pic.  Pretty subject, good DOF, Nice color/exposure.  9</td>', 'I don''t know about multiple light sources, but I really like the pic.  Pretty subject, good DOF, Nice color/exposure.  9', '2004-05-30 18:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(742752, 79158, 10268, '<td valign="top">I think a slight crop on the right would have been a little better.  You have it just off center, which doesn''t work.  I think it would either need to be way off center, or in the center.  <br/> <br/>I like this though, it''s really nice.  I''m digging the color.  7.</td>', 'I think a slight crop on the right would have been a little better.  You have it just off center, which doesn''t work.  I think it would either need to be way off center, or in the center.   I like this though, it''s really nice.  I''m digging the color.  7.', '2004-05-30 18:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(742754, 79290, 10268, '<td valign="top">Something''s really weird.  For the banana challenge, you and I both decided it would be funny to smoke a banana.  And for this challenge, we both used a monitor for lighting.  Very, very interesting.  <br/> <br/>This one isn''t as sharp as your usual self-portraits.  Your right hand is overexposed a little, too.  <br/> <br/>I think the lighting is a little too uneven, but I like the concept.</td>', 'Something''s really weird.  For the banana challenge, you and I both decided it would be funny to smoke a banana.  And for this challenge, we both used a monitor for lighting.  Very, very interesting.   This one isn''t as sharp as your usual self-portraits.  Your right hand is overexposed a little, too.   I think the lighting is a little too uneven, but I like the concept.', '2004-05-30 18:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(742756, 79004, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  <br/> <br/>I don''t know how much you messed with the levels, but I think it would be possible to keep everything relatively the same, and remove the distracting curves on the left side.  That would make a  lot better, in my opinion.  And I really like the looks through the window.  Very cool, and good photo.  7.</td>', 'This is really nice.   I don''t know how much you messed with the levels, but I think it would be possible to keep everything relatively the same, and remove the distracting curves on the left side.  That would make a  lot better, in my opinion.  And I really like the looks through the window.  Very cool, and good photo.  7.', '2004-05-30 18:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(742757, 79312, 10268, '<td valign="top">Awesome quality and really great colors.  Very little noise too, which is great.  8.</td>', 'Awesome quality and really great colors.  Very little noise too, which is great.  8.', '2004-05-30 18:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(742761, 77936, 10268, '<td valign="top">I would have maybe worked at the lighting a little more to get it more even across the entire book.</td>', 'I would have maybe worked at the lighting a little more to get it more even across the entire book.', '2004-05-30 18:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(742763, 79154, 10268, '<td valign="top">That''s so cool.  It looks like a some kind of creature in the center.  I see two eyes, a nose and an mouth, as well as a dress and two arms.<br/> <br/>That''s so cool.</td>', 'That''s so cool.  It looks like a some kind of creature in the center.  I see two eyes, a nose and an mouth, as well as a dress and two arms. That''s so cool.', '2004-05-30 18:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(742774, 79232, 12268, '<td valign="top">don''t worry be happy? Lovet he compo &amp; the lighting!</td>', 'don''t worry be happy? Lovet he compo & the lighting!', '2004-05-30 18:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
