(742979, 78730, 15920, '<td valign="top">The darkness in the middle of the building really hurts this.  Without bringing huge lights, the only thing I could think of was to lengthen the exposure (which might also make the fountain more interesting) and trade off the center for the sides being a little over exposed.</td>', 'The darkness in the middle of the building really hurts this.  Without bringing huge lights, the only thing I could think of was to lengthen the exposure (which might also make the fountain more interesting) and trade off the center for the sides being a little over exposed.', '2004-05-30 21:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
