(743010, 79037, 15920, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge, but needs something else to excel, maybe something in the sea of candles to rest your eye on?  Not sure, but that aside, hte flames are perfectly exposed, not overblown with some detail.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge, but needs something else to excel, maybe something in the sea of candles to rest your eye on?  Not sure, but that aside, hte flames are perfectly exposed, not overblown with some detail.', '2004-05-30 21:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
