(744549, 78949, 15919, '<td valign="top">Strange and interesting lightning.  Dont know what the thing on the floor is, think it takes the attention a bit from what matters.  Also think that you should have given the image a litle thighter croping from right.</td>', 'Strange and interesting lightning.  Dont know what the thing on the floor is, think it takes the attention a bit from what matters.  Also think that you should have given the image a litle thighter croping from right.', '2004-05-31 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
