(744741, 78834, 8891, '<td valign="top">Exquisite detail, marvelous composition and framing, love colors on the insect. Don''t care if the there are multiple light sources or not.  Excellent.</td>', 'Exquisite detail, marvelous composition and framing, love colors on the insect. Don''t care if the there are multiple light sources or not.  Excellent.', '2004-05-31 23:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
