(744770, 79319, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  I love the colors you have chosen.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  I love the colors you have chosen.', '2004-05-31 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(744771, 79312, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  Interesting angle.  :o)</td>', 'Great action shot.  Interesting angle.  :o)', '2004-05-31 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(744773, 78672, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very good macro.   I can almost feel it.</td>', 'Very good macro.   I can almost feel it.', '2004-05-31 23:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(744774, 79311, 18349, '<td valign="top">Simple is almost always best.  Good job!  Love the composition.</td>', 'Simple is almost always best.  Good job!  Love the composition.', '2004-05-31 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(744776, 78834, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro.  Very sharp.</td>', 'Beautiful macro.  Very sharp.', '2004-05-31 23:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(744777, 78325, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  Wish the drive were a little sharper in the center area, but not bad at all.   Good job! :o)</td>', 'Great lighting.  Wish the drive were a little sharper in the center area, but not bad at all.   Good job! :o)', '2004-05-31 23:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(744779, 79007, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great colors and interesting lines.</td>', 'Great colors and interesting lines.', '2004-05-31 23:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(744781, 79290, 18349, '<td valign="top">You are always so creative.  Lighting is good and effective.  My nitpick is that I wish you would take a self portrait where you are smiling...you always seem so serious for such a handsome young man!  :o)</td>', 'You are always so creative.  Lighting is good and effective.  My nitpick is that I wish you would take a self portrait where you are smiling...you always seem so serious for such a handsome young man!  :o)', '2004-05-31 23:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(744782, 79088, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  Definitely multiple sources of light! :o)</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  Definitely multiple sources of light! :o)', '2004-05-31 23:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(744783, 78957, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  What an awesomne capture !  !</td>', 'Fantastic.  What an awesomne capture !  !', '2004-05-31 23:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(744784, 79299, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and contrast between the orange glow and the purple-blue sky.  Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and contrast between the orange glow and the purple-blue sky.  Nice job!', '2004-05-31 23:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(744785, 78297, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W treatment. :)</td>', 'Nice B&W treatment. :)', '2004-05-31 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(744787, 78069, 10818, '<td valign="top">Cool, what a great perspective, and very cool neon colors.</td>', 'Cool, what a great perspective, and very cool neon colors.', '2004-05-31 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(744788, 79282, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wowsers!  That''s probably getting you some interesting comments, to say the least!  Very good silhouette; nice composition.  Palm tree is a tad distracting; other than that it''s a nice photo that fits the challenge. :o)</td>', 'Wowsers!  That''s probably getting you some interesting comments, to say the least!  Very good silhouette; nice composition.  Palm tree is a tad distracting; other than that it''s a nice photo that fits the challenge. :o)', '2004-05-31 23:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(744790, 79293, 18349, '<td valign="top">Is that Midori?  Yummmm!  Very pretty colors.  Like the composition and framing as well. :o)</td>', 'Is that Midori?  Yummmm!  Very pretty colors.  Like the composition and framing as well. :o)', '2004-05-31 23:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(744792, 78034, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Like the reflections and shadows.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Like the reflections and shadows.', '2004-05-31 23:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(744794, 78632, 18349, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the good old days back in the 80s with the hair bands and acid washed jeans...Ahh, the memories!  Great shot, BTW.  :o)</td>', 'Reminds me of the good old days back in the 80s with the hair bands and acid washed jeans...Ahh, the memories!  Great shot, BTW.  :o)', '2004-05-31 23:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(744796, 78020, 18349, '<td valign="top">Steam adds a nice touch.  Great capture! :o)</td>', 'Steam adds a nice touch.  Great capture! :o)', '2004-05-31 23:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(744801, 78632, 10818, '<td valign="top">Rock on !  Fantastic shot.    9</td>', 'Rock on !  Fantastic shot.    9', '2004-05-31 23:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(744816, 78146, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject to light and you''ve captured some nice highlights and shadows. I don''t much care for the centered composition or the looking down P.O.V. It kind of seems to be just floating there.</td>', 'This is an interesting subject to light and you''ve captured some nice highlights and shadows. I don''t much care for the centered composition or the looking down P.O.V. It kind of seems to be just floating there.', '2004-06-01 00:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(744820, 79041, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp foucs on the lighting filement (is that the right word?). The color is nice. I don''t find this to be a good composition, however. The looking-down P.O.V. makes the bulb appear top heavy, like it is about to fall down and out of the frame.</td>', 'Nice sharp foucs on the lighting filement (is that the right word?). The color is nice. I don''t find this to be a good composition, however. The looking-down P.O.V. makes the bulb appear top heavy, like it is about to fall down and out of the frame.', '2004-06-01 00:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(744822, 78985, 7322, '<td valign="top">A little too much going on here in terms of color and design. It becomes a jumble of color. Perhaps a black velvet background might have worked better? I''m assuming you used more than one light source to light this and are not just relying on a pun to meet the challenge.</td>', 'A little too much going on here in terms of color and design. It becomes a jumble of color. Perhaps a black velvet background might have worked better? I''m assuming you used more than one light source to light this and are not just relying on a pun to meet the challenge.', '2004-06-01 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(744826, 78386, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is such a nicely focused shot. I like the white against the dark background. The dew and the texture of the petals is captured quite nicely (except for a slight overexposed area on the petal directly beneath the purple and white petal). Unfortunatey there is no separation between the flower and the ''moon''. The light becomes a distraction. In my opinion, this shot suffered so much from that light.</td>', 'This is such a nicely focused shot. I like the white against the dark background. The dew and the texture of the petals is captured quite nicely (except for a slight overexposed area on the petal directly beneath the purple and white petal). Unfortunatey there is no separation between the flower and the ''moon''. The light becomes a distraction. In my opinion, this shot suffered so much from that light.', '2004-06-01 00:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(744859, 79143, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Great focus on the the landscape. The motion blur of light is super deliniated. The small amount of bright red works nicely in contrast to the overall dark greenish cast. This was one of my top picks. Good luck!</td>', 'Great composition. Great focus on the the landscape. The motion blur of light is super deliniated. The small amount of bright red works nicely in contrast to the overall dark greenish cast. This was one of my top picks. Good luck!', '2004-06-01 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(744862, 79176, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and moody. I love the grainy soft-focus. You will likely suffer in the voting for this but good for you for making the choice. The subtle gradiation in tone from light to dark is so effective. One of my top picks. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful and moody. I love the grainy soft-focus. You will likely suffer in the voting for this but good for you for making the choice. The subtle gradiation in tone from light to dark is so effective. One of my top picks. Good luck!', '2004-06-01 00:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(744865, 78251, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great color in the blurred ferris wheel. Nice focus on the foreground subject and the colors echo the wheel.  A really fun and effective use of blurring. One of my top picks. Good luck!</td>', 'Great color in the blurred ferris wheel. Nice focus on the foreground subject and the colors echo the wheel.  A really fun and effective use of blurring. One of my top picks. Good luck!', '2004-06-01 00:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(744869, 77850, 7322, '<td valign="top">She is so beautiful and jubliant it is hard not to be drawn into this portrait. I think you will suffer in the voting for the blown out highlights and graininess but I happen to love both for this shot. She is truly bathed in light. I don''t know if it was a conscious choice to have the model wear black and white but it works great. One of my top picks. Good luck!</td>', 'She is so beautiful and jubliant it is hard not to be drawn into this portrait. I think you will suffer in the voting for the blown out highlights and graininess but I happen to love both for this shot. She is truly bathed in light. I don''t know if it was a conscious choice to have the model wear black and white but it works great. One of my top picks. Good luck!', '2004-06-01 00:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(744878, 79232, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the skin tones in a difficult lighting situation. The man''s face has quite bright highlights but this is effective for this shot for at  least two reasons:<br/> <br/>A: It separates him from the dark background yet there is still good detail in his skin and hair. We can see the texture of his beard and dreds. <br/> <br/>B: It places him as the main focal point. The star, so to speak. <br/> <br/>Her face has much flattering lighting for a woman (except for perhaps the shiny spots on her nose) and the softer light puts her a bit more in the background despite their equal distance to the camera. Her hair is dark and blends invisibly into the background, placing her firmly in the secondary role of audience. <br/> <br/>The soft beam of light makes an interesting connection between the two. Excellent!  One of my earliest top picks!</td>', 'Good capture of the skin tones in a difficult lighting situation. The man''s face has quite bright highlights but this is effective for this shot for at  least two reasons: A: It separates him from the dark background yet there is still good detail in his skin and hair. We can see the texture of his beard and dreds.  B: It places him as the main focal point. The star, so to speak.  Her face has much flattering lighting for a woman (except for perhaps the shiny spots on her nose) and the softer light puts her a bit more in the background despite their equal distance to the camera. Her hair is dark and blends invisibly into the background, placing her firmly in the secondary role of audience.  The soft beam of light makes an interesting connection between the two. Excellent!  One of my earliest top picks!', '2004-06-01 01:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(744880, 79219, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. It captures the wonderful color and texture of this single petal. I particularly like the backlighting rimming the ruffled edge of the petal at the top. I like the yellow against this black background. Good work!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. It captures the wonderful color and texture of this single petal. I particularly like the backlighting rimming the ruffled edge of the petal at the top. I like the yellow against this black background. Good work!', '2004-06-01 01:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(744881, 79306, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really interesting subject. I love the soft orange lighting sillouhetting the middle trees and the side lighting that highlights the main tree. Great placement of the main subject.</td>', 'Really interesting subject. I love the soft orange lighting sillouhetting the middle trees and the side lighting that highlights the main tree. Great placement of the main subject.', '2004-06-01 01:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(744885, 79033, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good use of tilted format. This is a format that should be used with care and thought and I think it works very effectively here. The reasons:<br/> <br/>A: The background is so simple; just the wisps of trailing clouds. <br/> <br/>B:The diagonal emphasizes the buildings strong lines and the dramatic shadows. <br/> <br/>Good work!</td>', 'Good use of tilted format. This is a format that should be used with care and thought and I think it works very effectively here. The reasons: A: The background is so simple; just the wisps of trailing clouds.  B:The diagonal emphasizes the buildings strong lines and the dramatic shadows.  Good work!', '2004-06-01 01:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(744890, 79011, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the simple background for this old trick. The pose and simple monochromatic clothing also unifies the photo. Good job!</td>', 'I like the simple background for this old trick. The pose and simple monochromatic clothing also unifies the photo. Good job!', '2004-06-01 01:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(744895, 79281, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great rim lighting of the audience members, particulalry because you captured the guy in the front with his hand in "rock" formation. Really nice composition. The negative black space is used very effectively. Good job!</td>', 'Great rim lighting of the audience members, particulalry because you captured the guy in the front with his hand in "rock" formation. Really nice composition. The negative black space is used very effectively. Good job!', '2004-06-01 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(744898, 78627, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting trick. The  central subject is a teensy bit out of focus looking on my monito but this got high marks from me.</td>', 'Interesting trick. The  central subject is a teensy bit out of focus looking on my monito but this got high marks from me.', '2004-06-01 01:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(744900, 79262, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great colors, lighting, composition. Good job!</td>', 'Great colors, lighting, composition. Good job!', '2004-06-01 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(744903, 79122, 7322, '<td valign="top">Excellent simple composition. I like how the light coming from above throws the diver in sillhouette but still captures the glow of the air bubbles which have an interesting effect of anchoring him in his environment.</td>', 'Excellent simple composition. I like how the light coming from above throws the diver in sillhouette but still captures the glow of the air bubbles which have an interesting effect of anchoring him in his environment.', '2004-06-01 01:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(744905, 79227, 7322, '<td valign="top">If I''m seeing this correctly this is a very long exposure of runners wearing lights? The exposure is excellent. The composition quite interesting in spite of seeming a bit cluttered at first. This is one I looked at quite a few times. I like that the foremost pole is leaning slightly, as if from the speed of the  runners (like in a Road Runner cartoon). I imagine that is just a happy coincidence but it works.</td>', 'If I''m seeing this correctly this is a very long exposure of runners wearing lights? The exposure is excellent. The composition quite interesting in spite of seeming a bit cluttered at first. This is one I looked at quite a few times. I like that the foremost pole is leaning slightly, as if from the speed of the  runners (like in a Road Runner cartoon). I imagine that is just a happy coincidence but it works.', '2004-06-01 01:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(744908, 78050, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting of a classic subject.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting of a classic subject.', '2004-06-01 01:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(744911, 78994, 7322, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily, a shot this small  would lose points with me. However, I really like this shot for it strong lines and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Ordinarily, a shot this small  would lose points with me. However, I really like this shot for it strong lines and interesting lighting.', '2004-06-01 01:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(744912, 78956, 7322, '<td valign="top">A lovely capture of a child''s curiosity. The dark clouds are rather ominous looking but the bright sunlight on the trees and beach really make one feel the quixotic weather.</td>', 'A lovely capture of a child''s curiosity. The dark clouds are rather ominous looking but the bright sunlight on the trees and beach really make one feel the quixotic weather.', '2004-06-01 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(744913, 78957, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic lighting and viewpoint.</td>', 'Great dramatic lighting and viewpoint.', '2004-06-01 01:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(744915, 77847, 7322, '<td valign="top">Rembrandt-like in the quality of light. Really emotive set-up. Great use of classic triangle composition. Good job!</td>', 'Rembrandt-like in the quality of light. Really emotive set-up. Great use of classic triangle composition. Good job!', '2004-06-01 01:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(744982, 78834, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wow! I  love the colors and the detail that you have brough out in this. One of my favorites!</td>', 'Wow! I  love the colors and the detail that you have brough out in this. One of my favorites!', '2004-06-01 02:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(744983, 79219, 10339, '<td valign="top">Great! The soft focus that you used throughout really brings out the detail of the shot.</td>', 'Great! The soft focus that you used throughout really brings out the detail of the shot.', '2004-06-01 02:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(744984, 77936, 9809, '<td valign="top">I don''t doubt you reshot this for the challenge, but I swear I''ve seen this exact image in an earlier challenge -- maybe even by you!</td>', 'I don''t doubt you reshot this for the challenge, but I swear I''ve seen this exact image in an earlier challenge -- maybe even by you!', '2004-06-01 02:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(744986, 79262, 9809, '<td valign="top">Very cool! How could you possibly do this using "basic editing?" I gotta know this trick.</td>', 'Very cool! How could you possibly do this using "basic editing?" I gotta know this trick.', '2004-06-01 02:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(744987, 77789, 9809, '<td valign="top">Multiple light sources? I see ONE -- the sun.</td>', 'Multiple light sources? I see ONE -- the sun.', '2004-06-01 02:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(745064, 78275, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is unquestionable a beautiful image.  in my opinion, the meeting the challenge aspect is a bit stretched (even with your title taken into account).  but in terms of photographic merits, this is a very lovely picture.  it''s sharp, in focus, colours are terrific - as is your timing with the sun behind the clouds and it''s rays being clearly evident.  could''ve been a winner in the silhouette challenge we had recently.</td>', 'this is unquestionable a beautiful image.  in my opinion, the meeting the challenge aspect is a bit stretched (even with your title taken into account).  but in terms of photographic merits, this is a very lovely picture.  it''s sharp, in focus, colours are terrific - as is your timing with the sun behind the clouds and it''s rays being clearly evident.  could''ve been a winner in the silhouette challenge we had recently.', '2004-06-01 05:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(745077, 78834, 9441, '<td valign="top">Magnificient shot!  I love the colors...and the lighting is superb!  10</td>', 'Magnificient shot!  I love the colors...and the lighting is superb!  10', '2004-06-01 05:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(745078, 78325, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a definite favourtie of this challenge - the lighting (in it''s multipleness) is beautiful, as are the colours and the angle of the shot is pitch perfect.  your choice of subject is different and original, and for making something seemingly ugly and boring into the visoinary wonder i see before me is inspiring.  my only reservation is that i wish it was a little bit sharper in the foreground, but that aside, i am well impressed.  9.</td>', 'this is a definite favourtie of this challenge - the lighting (in it''s multipleness) is beautiful, as are the colours and the angle of the shot is pitch perfect.  your choice of subject is different and original, and for making something seemingly ugly and boring into the visoinary wonder i see before me is inspiring.  my only reservation is that i wish it was a little bit sharper in the foreground, but that aside, i am well impressed.  9.', '2004-06-01 05:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(745092, 79173, 22458, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Well executed!</td>', 'Great shot! Well executed!', '2004-06-01 06:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(745101, 79163, 20129, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot! Was it a laser pointer?<br/></td>', 'I like this a lot! Was it a laser pointer?', '2004-06-01 06:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(745149, 78742, 16004, '<td valign="top">initially, this is to me a very striking image.  the pattern of light and shadow is interesting and works well.  on closer study, it seems a pity that the doors at the far end weren''t cemtred; they kind of knock your symmetry a bit off-kilter.  also, some sort of support for your camera (a tripot, video box set, something like that) might have produced a less fuzzy image.  in all though; it''s a good subject, fits the challenge and very likeable.  7.</td>', 'initially, this is to me a very striking image.  the pattern of light and shadow is interesting and works well.  on closer study, it seems a pity that the doors at the far end weren''t cemtred; they kind of knock your symmetry a bit off-kilter.  also, some sort of support for your camera (a tripot, video box set, something like that) might have produced a less fuzzy image.  in all though; it''s a good subject, fits the challenge and very likeable.  7.', '2004-06-01 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(745159, 79239, 22083, '<td valign="top">This place looks familliar, I Like the time it was taken witht e very rich blue sky.</td>', 'This place looks familliar, I Like the time it was taken witht e very rich blue sky.', '2004-06-01 09:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(745160, 78620, 22083, '<td valign="top">I love how you got the wires to reflect the different colors.</td>', 'I love how you got the wires to reflect the different colors.', '2004-06-01 09:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(745178, 78297, 19841, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better in color, or at least in sepia tone.  Leaves in black and white look dead.  The use of the flash with the sunlight worked well.  6</td>', 'I would have liked this better in color, or at least in sepia tone.  Leaves in black and white look dead.  The use of the flash with the sunlight worked well.  6', '2004-06-01 09:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(745194, 78303, 16004, '<td valign="top">this could have done with a very slight Clockwise rotation - the wonkiness is a little bit distracting.  the position of the lights works effectively though, and i like how one light is yellower than the other.  but i might add that by coming in closer you would ahve picked up on the grooves on the vase more obviously.  i only mention that because the vase seems to have an interesting texture.  5.</td>', 'this could have done with a very slight Clockwise rotation - the wonkiness is a little bit distracting.  the position of the lights works effectively though, and i like how one light is yellower than the other.  but i might add that by coming in closer you would ahve picked up on the grooves on the vase more obviously.  i only mention that because the vase seems to have an interesting texture.  5.', '2004-06-01 10:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(745200, 79285, 20732, '<td valign="top">I like the one computer on in the middle. Was this intentional? If so it''s really good!</td>', 'I like the one computer on in the middle. Was this intentional? If so it''s really good!', '2004-06-01 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
