(745375, 78690, 21724, '<td valign="top">very interesting, but the reflection of the higher lamp on the lower one bothers me, not to mention that the lower lamp looks rather flat without a little light starburst of its own.  i still love this pic, though!</td>', 'very interesting, but the reflection of the higher lamp on the lower one bothers me, not to mention that the lower lamp looks rather flat without a little light starburst of its own.  i still love this pic, though!', '2004-06-01 14:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(745378, 78050, 21724, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!  at first glance I thought it was a stairwell, but then I saw otherwise.  fantastic use of black and white, although it would be nice to see just a tad more detail towards the bottom of the shell.</td>', 'beautiful!!  at first glance I thought it was a stairwell, but then I saw otherwise.  fantastic use of black and white, although it would be nice to see just a tad more detail towards the bottom of the shell.', '2004-06-01 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(745380, 79288, 21724, '<td valign="top">ewwwwww!  ;)  cool lighting.. I''m not sure if the contrast in tones from the bug to the screen works for me (perhaps try a background on your screen with some richer, more golden hues to pull it all together), but still a cool picture</td>', 'ewwwwww!  ;)  cool lighting.. I''m not sure if the contrast in tones from the bug to the screen works for me (perhaps try a background on your screen with some richer, more golden hues to pull it all together), but still a cool picture', '2004-06-01 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(745384, 79219, 21724, '<td valign="top">i''m going to have to take your word that this is more than two light sources, and that''s something I''m not all that fond of doing when it comes to voting.  i personally prefer submissions that are at least slightly more apparent - but that objectivity is what makes it art!!  :)</td>', 'i''m going to have to take your word that this is more than two light sources, and that''s something I''m not all that fond of doing when it comes to voting.  i personally prefer submissions that are at least slightly more apparent - but that objectivity is what makes it art!!  :)', '2004-06-01 14:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(745387, 79156, 21724, '<td valign="top">it''s all just a little too dull and grainy for me.. I''d like to see more contrast, some deeper colors, more definition of the details, and try to get that candle in focus..  watch out for the reflections in the glass, those really detract from the central point of the picture.  try using white posterboards to block out background objects, and also maybe try using a different fabric instead of a towel - all those terrycloth loops are just way too distracting!  :)</td>', 'it''s all just a little too dull and grainy for me.. I''d like to see more contrast, some deeper colors, more definition of the details, and try to get that candle in focus..  watch out for the reflections in the glass, those really detract from the central point of the picture.  try using white posterboards to block out background objects, and also maybe try using a different fabric instead of a towel - all those terrycloth loops are just way too distracting!  :)', '2004-06-01 14:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(745388, 79160, 21724, '<td valign="top">great idea, but the dolphin isn''t really in focus, and could stand to be polished up a little first, as well</td>', 'great idea, but the dolphin isn''t really in focus, and could stand to be polished up a little first, as well', '2004-06-01 14:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(745389, 79143, 21724, '<td valign="top">supercool, what a fun picture!  I''ve wanted to try something like this out myself for awhile now.  the light streaks are very clean and I love the starbursts.  FANTASTIC detail and coloring on the background.  wonderful job, one of my faves so far</td>', 'supercool, what a fun picture!  I''ve wanted to try something like this out myself for awhile now.  the light streaks are very clean and I love the starbursts.  FANTASTIC detail and coloring on the background.  wonderful job, one of my faves so far', '2004-06-01 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(745390, 78997, 21724, '<td valign="top">i just love all those little starbursts!!  i''m assuming you used a filter.. if not, how did you get such a great effect?  beautiful colors, but i''m not a fan of the blurry parts (woman getting in her car, the one car in the right lane).  I would have liked to see a picture of the street alone, with just the cars all lined up on the left and none on the right, with no people in sight.  very cool picture, great job</td>', 'i just love all those little starbursts!!  i''m assuming you used a filter.. if not, how did you get such a great effect?  beautiful colors, but i''m not a fan of the blurry parts (woman getting in her car, the one car in the right lane).  I would have liked to see a picture of the street alone, with just the cars all lined up on the left and none on the right, with no people in sight.  very cool picture, great job', '2004-06-01 14:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(745391, 79087, 21724, '<td valign="top">WHOOOOOOOOOP!!!  I probably shouldn''t do this, but just for having a fellow Aggie in this picture, you get a TEN!!  we ags gotta stick together ;)</td>', 'WHOOOOOOOOOP!!!  I probably shouldn''t do this, but just for having a fellow Aggie in this picture, you get a TEN!!  we ags gotta stick together ;)', '2004-06-01 14:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
