(745438, 77969, 21724, '<td valign="top">the tags are distracting, but that''s probably unavoidable.  a closeup of this would be a great macro abstract</td>', 'the tags are distracting, but that''s probably unavoidable.  a closeup of this would be a great macro abstract', '2004-06-01 14:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
