(745460, 78932, 11897, '<td valign="top">I would like to say something good about this but I can''t I''m afraid, overexposed and poorly executed.</td>', 'I would like to say something good about this but I can''t I''m afraid, overexposed and poorly executed.', '2004-06-01 15:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(745464, 78956, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but I think the sky is just a little too "unreal" for the scene.</td>', 'Nice pic but I think the sky is just a little too "unreal" for the scene.', '2004-06-01 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(745465, 79163, 11897, '<td valign="top">Certainly multiple, nice job.</td>', 'Certainly multiple, nice job.', '2004-06-01 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(745466, 78114, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of color without losing contrast. The grain of the hair on the snout does a wonderful job of leading the eye of the vewier back to the eye.</td>', 'Beautiful use of color without losing contrast. The grain of the hair on the snout does a wonderful job of leading the eye of the vewier back to the eye.', '2004-06-01 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(745468, 79173, 21899, '<td valign="top">I really like the 3 arches with the 3 alleys and how the light is captured.</td>', 'I really like the 3 arches with the 3 alleys and how the light is captured.', '2004-06-01 15:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(745469, 78408, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully elegant and simple composition that puts this shot above most others - the texture and luminesence of the shell is great along with the highlight around the edge to firmly define the edges.</td>', 'Wonderfully elegant and simple composition that puts this shot above most others - the texture and luminesence of the shell is great along with the highlight around the edge to firmly define the edges.', '2004-06-01 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(745470, 78464, 21899, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2004-06-01 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(745472, 79292, 11897, '<td valign="top">Lovely balance of lighting, not keen on the chap in the foreground, if he had been lit by flash maybe ? overall very good picture.</td>', 'Lovely balance of lighting, not keen on the chap in the foreground, if he had been lit by flash maybe ? overall very good picture.', '2004-06-01 15:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(745482, 79285, 21899, '<td valign="top">Your title makes the photo</td>', 'Your title makes the photo', '2004-06-01 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(745487, 78997, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little too small.</td>', 'Nice shot but a little too small.', '2004-06-01 15:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(745498, 79156, 11897, '<td valign="top">the focus lets this down.</td>', 'the focus lets this down.', '2004-06-01 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(745501, 79211, 11897, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, make a wonderfull print, my opinion of course.</td>', 'Very nicely done, make a wonderfull print, my opinion of course.', '2004-06-01 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(745503, 79082, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s an attractive shot, no question there, i just feel it''s somehow, erm, a bit incomplete.  i''m not overly keen on the unusual angle, and i think i might have cropped the image a bit more square like - specifically i would have taken out everything above the shadow on the ceiling. This would have the lanterns filling the lower thrid, rather than the lower quarter which i think is a bit unablanced.  with regards to the challenge it''s definitely a fit, and i think a very good choice location.  6.</td>', 'it''s an attractive shot, no question there, i just feel it''s somehow, erm, a bit incomplete.  i''m not overly keen on the unusual angle, and i think i might have cropped the image a bit more square like - specifically i would have taken out everything above the shadow on the ceiling. This would have the lanterns filling the lower thrid, rather than the lower quarter which i think is a bit unablanced.  with regards to the challenge it''s definitely a fit, and i think a very good choice location.  6.', '2004-06-01 15:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(745504, 77789, 19337, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I can''t figure out what the second light source is...</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I can''t figure out what the second light source is...', '2004-06-01 15:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(745506, 79156, 19337, '<td valign="top">The colors are interesting, but the candle is out of focus</td>', 'The colors are interesting, but the candle is out of focus', '2004-06-01 15:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(745509, 79281, 19337, '<td valign="top">Great picture! One of my favorites from this challenge!</td>', 'Great picture! One of my favorites from this challenge!', '2004-06-01 15:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(745512, 79128, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to tell if more than just one light source was employed here, but one should assume that it was.  it''s certainly very pretty...   did you consider cropping through the discs so that there was less black filling the screen?  it''s the wonderful colours that sell this image, so i think i would like to have seen more focus on that...  6.</td>', 'it''s hard to tell if more than just one light source was employed here, but one should assume that it was.  it''s certainly very pretty...   did you consider cropping through the discs so that there was less black filling the screen?  it''s the wonderful colours that sell this image, so i think i would like to have seen more focus on that...  6.', '2004-06-01 15:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(745516, 79297, 19337, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and a well controlled exposure. The picture looks a little bit tipped (clockwise). Good work!</td>', 'Excellent colors and a well controlled exposure. The picture looks a little bit tipped (clockwise). Good work!', '2004-06-01 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(745517, 77987, 11897, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, just slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Lovely scene, just slightly out of focus.', '2004-06-01 15:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(745518, 79039, 16004, '<td valign="top">too dark, really.  it might have been worth trying a coloured background in lieu of the black...  also the lemon is noticeably out of focus, and it being the brightest object plus being in the foreground, it kind of detracts from the overall image.  having the fruits wet IS a nice touch.  it''s a good example of fitting the challenge as well.  4.</td>', 'too dark, really.  it might have been worth trying a coloured background in lieu of the black...  also the lemon is noticeably out of focus, and it being the brightest object plus being in the foreground, it kind of detracts from the overall image.  having the fruits wet IS a nice touch.  it''s a good example of fitting the challenge as well.  4.', '2004-06-01 15:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(745522, 78957, 19337, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I really like this picture.  Good color and focus. I don''t think the multiple light sources are obvious, but I would still put this as a top 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent shot! I really like this picture.  Good color and focus. I don''t think the multiple light sources are obvious, but I would still put this as a top 10 in this challenge.', '2004-06-01 15:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(745523, 77850, 19337, '<td valign="top">I personally like the way this shot is overexposed.</td>', 'I personally like the way this shot is overexposed.', '2004-06-01 15:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(745554, 79089, 12268, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot! Great idea, technically great, love it bw! 10!</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot! Great idea, technically great, love it bw! 10!', '2004-06-01 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(745568, 78496, 11897, '<td valign="top">not really fitting the challenge but a great portrait of a lovely child.</td>', 'not really fitting the challenge but a great portrait of a lovely child.', '2004-06-01 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(745594, 79262, 19780, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition - the simplicity of it is really wonderful and it is well executed. I wish (ever so slightly, you''ve done a marvelous job) that the shadows were a little more on one plane than angled up on the blue one.</td>', 'Stunning composition - the simplicity of it is really wonderful and it is well executed. I wish (ever so slightly, you''ve done a marvelous job) that the shadows were a little more on one plane than angled up on the blue one.', '2004-06-01 16:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(745595, 79173, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple - great eye for perspective and texture.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple - great eye for perspective and texture.', '2004-06-01 16:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(745597, 77985, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting - the capture of the eye color is great. The use of the hat heightens the effect of multiple sources. I''m not fond of the pattern on the shirt as the white pops a little too much for me, but an extremely well executed shot.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting - the capture of the eye color is great. The use of the hat heightens the effect of multiple sources. I''m not fond of the pattern on the shirt as the white pops a little too much for me, but an extremely well executed shot.', '2004-06-01 16:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(745635, 78375, 1748, '<td valign="top">flip the imagedoes it improve it.lighting good face not quite sharp enough</td>', 'flip the imagedoes it improve it.lighting good face not quite sharp enough', '2004-06-01 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
