(745646, 77969, 17762, '<td valign="top">Thinking out side of the box or in this case the light ball. This is a great use of imagination.<br/> <br/>good luck to the photographer.</td>', 'Thinking out side of the box or in this case the light ball. This is a great use of imagination. good luck to the photographer.', '2004-06-01 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
