(745917, 79153, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different take on the Challenge.  You gave yourself a difficult task to show the river of light with candles alone.  I think you probably compromised on a darker exposure so that you wouldn''t blow thecandle light too much.  It was successful as far as I''m concerned.  I like it a lot.  Good one.</td>', 'Interesting and different take on the Challenge.  You gave yourself a difficult task to show the river of light with candles alone.  I think you probably compromised on a darker exposure so that you wouldn''t blow thecandle light too much.  It was successful as far as I''m concerned.  I like it a lot.  Good one.', '2004-06-01 20:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
