(745932, 78730, 7560, '<td valign="top">Okay, you have multiple sources here. The problem comes from how far back you are when the flash goes off. Most camera flashes will only go about 10 feet with 5 really being the optimal range.  The biggest thing you can do to improve the shot is move forward. That gets the flash into a range it can actually work.</td>', 'Okay, you have multiple sources here. The problem comes from how far back you are when the flash goes off. Most camera flashes will only go about 10 feet with 5 really being the optimal range.  The biggest thing you can do to improve the shot is move forward. That gets the flash into a range it can actually work.', '2004-06-01 21:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(745944, 79163, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very creative entry. Nice to see someone attempting to paint wth light, which is no easy task. Good job!</td>', 'Very creative entry. Nice to see someone attempting to paint wth light, which is no easy task. Good job!', '2004-06-01 21:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
