(745947, 79293, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Obviously you can''t clean up little spots because of te Basic rules, but I do think that a brighter light source would have made this photo stand out a bit more and helped clean up some of the BG noise. But I like the idea and the photo came out very nice. Good job!</td>', 'I really like this shot. Obviously you can''t clean up little spots because of te Basic rules, but I do think that a brighter light source would have made this photo stand out a bit more and helped clean up some of the BG noise. But I like the idea and the photo came out very nice. Good job!', '2004-06-01 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
