(745961, 77824, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very colorful subject and a nice composition. I think I would like an even brighter light source to make those colors really stand out. That would also make the BG a bit more lively. But I like this shot a lot and hope that you will use this subject to continue experimenting with light. Nice job!</td>', 'Very colorful subject and a nice composition. I think I would like an even brighter light source to make those colors really stand out. That would also make the BG a bit more lively. But I like this shot a lot and hope that you will use this subject to continue experimenting with light. Nice job!', '2004-06-01 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(745971, 78426, 22495, '<td valign="top">it''s funny</td>', 'it''s funny', '2004-06-01 21:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(745972, 78408, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. You managed to maintain the eggshell''s texture even in the most brightly lit area. Once this Basic rules contest is over, I think it might make the white vs brown coloring stand out even more if you darkened the background a bit, or made it white. Good job!</td>', 'Really nice shot. You managed to maintain the eggshell''s texture even in the most brightly lit area. Once this Basic rules contest is over, I think it might make the white vs brown coloring stand out even more if you darkened the background a bit, or made it white. Good job!', '2004-06-01 21:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
