(746313, 79294, 12962, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted and especially to those who made time to comment.<br/> <br/>Note about the lighting:   I wanted to show how much these glass bowls are good in conducting light especially the rims.  I also wanted to make the light sources so much to be a part of the composition.  So to do this, I purchased several colors of glow in the dark sticks, punctured them and squeezed a few drops onto the bowls, smearing them on the bottom of each bowl.  I then arranged the bowls on a black cloth in the bathroom, turned off the light ... and voila ... 1 second exposure of the night setting of the camera.<br/> <br/>Again, thanks ... I am humbled.</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted and especially to those who made time to comment. Note about the lighting:   I wanted to show how much these glass bowls are good in conducting light especially the rims.  I also wanted to make the light sources so much to be a part of the composition.  So to do this, I purchased several colors of glow in the dark sticks, punctured them and squeezed a few drops onto the bowls, smearing them on the bottom of each bowl.  I then arranged the bowls on a black cloth in the bathroom, turned off the light ... and voila ... 1 second exposure of the night setting of the camera. Again, thanks ... I am humbled.', '2004-06-02 01:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
