(746951, 79294, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, Ken. Congratulations!</td>', 'Very cool shot, Ken. Congratulations!', '2004-06-02 10:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(746959, 79262, 8159, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments everybody! =]<br/> <br/>A lot of people wanted to know how I did this, and it really isn''t complicated. Thinking back to a science class demonstration, I remembered the "colored shadows" effect. So I set up a quick test, and when I saw that it would work, I started thinking about the "creative" aspect (the <i>key</i> part to most challenges, in my opinion) of what to have make the shadows. I eventually thought of using flowers that  matched the colored shadows, but was reluctant because of the possible "another flower shot" backlash... but I decided to do it anyway because I couldn''t think of anything better. =] So I made a quick trip to the grocery store (where I had seen these multi-colored daisies in the past) and bought the flowers. I shot with the lights in several different locations, but I settled on this composition for my entry.<br/> <br/>(I''m glad this was a "Basic Editing" challenge, or I''m sure some voters would have assumed this effect was created in Photoshop!)<br/> <br/>I found <a href="//imagers.gsfc.nasa.gov/teachersite/UL1_1_2.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this web page</a> which explains the colored shadows phenomenon for anyone interested.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-02 09:20:17.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments everybody! =] A lot of people wanted to know how I did this, and it really isn''t complicated. Thinking back to a science class demonstration, I remembered the "colored shadows" effect. So I set up a quick test, and when I saw that it would work, I started thinking about the "creative" aspect (the key part to most challenges, in my opinion) of what to have make the shadows. I eventually thought of using flowers that  matched the colored shadows, but was reluctant because of the possible "another flower shot" backlash... but I decided to do it anyway because I couldn''t think of anything better. =] So I made a quick trip to the grocery store (where I had seen these multi-colored daisies in the past) and bought the flowers. I shot with the lights in several different locations, but I settled on this composition for my entry. (I''m glad this was a "Basic Editing" challenge, or I''m sure some voters would have assumed this effect was created in Photoshop!) I found this web page which explains the colored shadows phenomenon for anyone interested.', '2004-06-02 10:13:42.000000', '2004-06-02 10:20:17.000000', 0),
(746961, 77936, 9913, '<td valign="top">rather unoriginal to use the same idea twice</td>', 'rather unoriginal to use the same idea twice', '2004-06-02 10:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(746963, 78464, 3102, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  This was definitely my favorite this time around :)</td>', 'Congrats!  This was definitely my favorite this time around :)', '2004-06-02 10:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(747018, 78464, 16402, '<td valign="top">Laurie, congratulations on that first ribbon. It is a winner!</td>', 'Laurie, congratulations on that first ribbon. It is a winner!', '2004-06-02 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(747070, 78464, 14386, '<td valign="top">Laurie, this picture is excellent. can you send me a postcard of this...I''ll send you another one of mine. Just kidding. But if you will, I will too.<br/> <br/>What makes this shot good is the angle, the sharpness, and even the background. First ribbon? I am sure there will be more. Congratulations.<br/> <br/>manny</td>', 'Laurie, this picture is excellent. can you send me a postcard of this...I''ll send you another one of mine. Just kidding. But if you will, I will too. What makes this shot good is the angle, the sharpness, and even the background. First ribbon? I am sure there will be more. Congratulations. manny', '2004-06-02 11:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(747078, 79294, 14386, '<td valign="top">Ken, this is very clever. A very good shot. Excellent colors and the slant is engaging. Great. <br/> <br/>Your pre-shooting is interesting. I am learning from you.<br/> <br/>Congratulaton liwat Ken. Ti man...nasegunduhan na. Segurado ako nga ang sunod malapit na.</td>', 'Ken, this is very clever. A very good shot. Excellent colors and the slant is engaging. Great.  Your pre-shooting is interesting. I am learning from you. Congratulaton liwat Ken. Ti man...nasegunduhan na. Segurado ako nga ang sunod malapit na.', '2004-06-02 11:54:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(747164, 79262, 7969, '<td valign="top">A winner already with the mark II, I can see you are going to give us all very stiff competition with that new camera  : ) Congrats</td>', 'A winner already with the mark II, I can see you are going to give us all very stiff competition with that new camera  : ) Congrats', '2004-06-02 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
