(747210, 77936, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nazgul:</b></div><hr/><i> rather unoriginal to use the same idea twice </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree with Nazgul - you take a beautiful picture, but seeing the same type of image in two challenges, lessens the impact of a very nice shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by Nazgul: rather unoriginal to use the same idea twice   I agree with Nazgul - you take a beautiful picture, but seeing the same type of image in two challenges, lessens the impact of a very nice shot.', '2004-06-02 13:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
