(788342, 78464, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think that the blue gel you used on one of the lights really highlights this shot nicely.  Great composition - you really filled the frame with this.  My favorite part, however, is the splash of green.  It is an unexpected treat!</td>', 'I think that the blue gel you used on one of the lights really highlights this shot nicely.  Great composition - you really filled the frame with this.  My favorite part, however, is the splash of green.  It is an unexpected treat!', '2004-06-30 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
