(798688, 78359, 15920, '<td valign="top">Brandon:<br/> <br/>I agree with some of the comments below: this is slightly overexposed through a long shutter speed.  There is a rule of thumb, but I forget what it is (something like F4/.5 seconds, maybe 1 second for fireworks.)<br/> <br/>That said, it is hard not to like pictures that show excitement like this.  During the comeptition, despite the exposure, I voted this a 5.<br/> <br/>Best</td>', 'Brandon: I agree with some of the comments below: this is slightly overexposed through a long shutter speed.  There is a rule of thumb, but I forget what it is (something like F4/.5 seconds, maybe 1 second for fireworks.) That said, it is hard not to like pictures that show excitement like this.  During the comeptition, despite the exposure, I voted this a 5. Best', '2004-07-06 22:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
