(918720, 78251, 22975, '<td valign="top">Hey, I rode on that ferris wheel a week after this picture!  It was right after a friend of mine got his Coolpix 8700, and he surprised me one evening by taking me to this parking lot "fair" and all I could think was "why didn''t you bring your camera, dummy?!!?!"  :)  Nice picture.</td>', 'Hey, I rode on that ferris wheel a week after this picture!  It was right after a friend of mine got his Coolpix 8700, and he surprised me one evening by taking me to this parking lot "fair" and all I could think was "why didn''t you bring your camera, dummy?!!?!"  :)  Nice picture.', '2004-09-20 23:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
